        StaticItem("Ancestral Charm", "A small golden charm forged in the image of a\ndark elf, seated in meditation. Cradled in\ntheir hands would be a small, teardrop cut\nsapphire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dakirennis.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Wither Mask", "An abon mask forged at the ire of a\ncontroversial blacksmith who had founded his\nwork on the creation of All Spirit Eve's\ncostumes; albeit upon his final masterpiece,\nthe Wither Mask, it is said that he slipped\nand perished via some unorthodox means. To\nthis day, his soul supposedly haunts these\nmasks.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Holocron", "An diamond unnaturally bent to take the shape\nof a disc. It'd bear an enchantment that,\nwhen activated, projects a life size image of\nwhat a transfigurer knowledgable in sensory\nIllusion has willed it to. In all scales of\nlight the figure would appear shaded akin to\nits appearance at the time of the\nenchantment, unlikely to correlate with the\nconditions of many scenarios in which it\nmight be used. Should physical impact be made\nwith it - be it hand, sword, arrow or rain,\nit'd easily pass through the figure as one\nmight air.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valmir__.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Scarecrow's 'Head", "A very life-like Pumpkin that upon closer\ninspection of its reflective properties and\nthe scratches on its surface, would appear to\nbe made from transfigured steel. The very\nfaintly glowing features of a lighter orange\ncarved' upon it might appear translucent to\nthose inspecting, however only darkness\nresides within. At its base there would be a\nhole no wider than a balled fist. Its wearer\npresumably never taking it off and lacking\nany flesh on their neck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Valmir__.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of the Kingdom", "This is a finely-crafted wimba wood coin. It\nis studded with tetrahedrite. It is painted\nwith jungle-fungi dye and powdered flower\ndye. On the item is an exceptional image of\nMalin’s face. Malin is smiling. On the item\nis an exceptional image of an oak tree. The\noak tree is blowing in the wind.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Emberthorn Spear [T2]", "An massive eight feet long spear crafted of\nferrum. The spearhead is gilded with aurum,\nand a foreign arrangement of diamond shapes\nare seen upon it. When touched, the spearhead\nprotrudes six aqua-colored embers that\nefficiently shred through bare corrupted\nflesh. Touching the imagery again toggles the\ninfusion.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Luxmourn - Blessed Clerical Morningstar", "A ferrum mace with a spiked ball at the end.\nA silver and crimson light surrounds the\nball, radiating a powerful feeling from it.\nIt can be held in one hand and used to\ndeliever strong blows.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Goop", "A strange, viscous gel of some sort that\nappears to be a light blue color. Touching it\nwould seem to have no negative effects,\nthough whether or not it has any peculiar,\ninert qualities is unclear.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by sjw_king3.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scales of Jak'ol", "Five scales from Jak'ol, the son of the\nGod-Oak. The scales are rather floppy and\nuseless for armour, yet perhaps useful for\nAlchemy means.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Dragon Blood", "A medium sized vail full of gleaming red\ndragon blood. This sample came from Jak'ol of\nthe God-Oak. The vial has been carefully\nsealed by a metallic lid.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Everyleaf", "This is a leaf of undefined species. It is a\nbrilliant green-red, and smells like fresh\nrainfall. It is the size of your palm, no\nmatter who holds it. It will never turn brown\nor wilt, and from its stem leaks a milky sap\nthat tastes like raspberries.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:leaves", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of Edel", "A lapis coin from the nonexistent City of\nEdelburg.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Coarse Mammoth Hair", "Patches of bristly mammoth hair. The hair is\nlong and beautifully brown, however, rough to\nthe touch. Leaves and twigs seem to get\neasily stuck within the hairs, but it warms\nyour palm simply by laying within it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Fire Starter", "A small palm sized black gem that when tapped\nthrice, it releases a small gout of flames\nout of its tapered end, to aid in starting\nhearth fires or mayhaps mischief.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Youthful Lubba Scale", "A sizeable scale of the Lubba, a powerful sea\nserpent. The scale is blue-green in nature.\nWhile extremely light it also seems to be\nquite durable. Perhaps it could be used in\ncrafting something.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Seaweed", "A clump of seaweed. This tangled mess seems\nnearly impossible to unknot. Don't let your\nhair get caught in it! Some tell tales of\nturning such into a frozen treat!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Ogre's Foot", "A swollen foot cut from a mighty Deeproad's\nOgre.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:rabbit_foot", ""),
        StaticItem("Altar Key", "A key retrieved after sacrificing a Dwarven\nChild, for shame. The key looks as if it\ncould be used at a nearby fort.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Skull", "A decapitated Goblin head, taken from a\ngoblin tribe in the Deeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Ring", "A finely crafted golden wedding band. The\nouter edge is engraved with an elegant\npattern and the interior has the\ninscription 'Vargen & Katherine\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ShannonLeigh.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Short Sword", "A short sword taken from a slain Deeproad's\nGoblin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Pelt", "The skin of a ferocious beast known as the\nAmber Wolves, who are known to roam the caves\nand jungles in large packs. Its furr seems to\nbe perpetually damp for some reason.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by shimmeringbliss.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Suxal's skin", "Arcane X\n★Admin Approved★\nSigned by Paleo.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Lightning Bolt", "A bare scroll except for the word Fulmen,\nwhich once spoken would cause a bolt of\nelectricity to charge in the air for a period\nof four emotes before launching forward at\nhigh speeds, attracted to any form of metal.\n((Would cause some nerve damage and\nincompacitate the one who was hit))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Shrapnel", "Arcane I\nShrapnel plate, of small size which fell from\nsomething gargantuan. Extremely resilient to\nharsh conditions, and almost as hard as\nCarabum. Glowing streaks of light and dark\nblue-hues in random areas of the piece. It\nseemed to have no use… perhaps.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Amber Acid", "The amber fluid coating the amber wolves, it\nis said that it is the acid, and not the fur\nthat gives the beast its distinctive colour.\nIt glows in the dark with a soft orange hue.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by shimmeringbliss.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Druidic Herbs", "These herbs are quite smelly and are quite\nfresh, despite finding them in someone's\npocket! Perhaps speaking to a Druid could\nhelp identify what they are and its usage!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Slime Chunk", "A chunk of charred, blue slime. Although\nseperated from the main body, it continues to\nwrithe and wiggle. Perhaps it can be used to\ntrack the original monster. [PM Xarkly for\nfollow-up event]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:slime", ""),
        StaticItem("Tooth of a Giant Squid", "Large and menacing, this sharpened denture is\nquite dangerous. It would make quite a fine\ntrophy, but perhaps a creative craftsmen\ncould find a use for it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Knife", "A crudely fashioned bone knife, it has been\nsharpened to a fine edge.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Great Bow of Hollowfell", "A long bow made of an excellent dark wood,\ncarved and polished by hand. At the top you\ncan appreciate the head of a wolf and at the\nbottom you can appreciate the letter 'H' of\nHallowfell and next to it the letter 'W' of\nWolf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond-Studded Glove", "On squeezing the palm, an orb of water\ncharges in the palm. After three emotes, it\nreleases the orb in a pressurized stream,\nstrong enough to knock the average person off\ntheir feet. Three charges.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Mail", "Armour designed to fit goblins.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Cat", "A small plushed toy sewn tightly with thread\nholding hue akin to the fabrics which\nmanifested the kitten contour. Its eyes are\nblack buttons held onto its complexion of\nyawn whiskers, and a pink cotton nose.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Giant Squid", "The fleshy meat smells of the sea. It writhes\nat times, even after being long dead. Perhaps\nyou could make a delicious feast from this!\nSushi!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:stained_hardened_clay", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Longbow", "This is an exceptionally crafted yew wood\nlongbow. It is encrusted with amber, in which\nbloodflies, black beetles, and monarch\nbutterflies are trapped. It is decorated with\nsnail shell and dried corpora fungus, and\nencircled with bands of tortoise leath\nleather. Tortoise bone bucklings are attached\nto its sides. It has a bowstring of wyvern\nleather. It smells faintly of cinnamon.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornwood Arrow", "This is an expertly crafted thornwood arrow.\nIt is banded with gryphon leather and snail\nshell, and has a barbed bare wood tip. The\nobject has eaglefeather vanes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Shekel", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Stoneskin Potion", "A complete potion of greater strength.\nAn infamous alchemical creation, which\nswirls in its vial completely consistant in\ntexture and thickness. This brew causes\nthe users skin to harden to a coarse rocky\ntexture, which in turn halts all movement.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Daniel's Wolf Statue", "A small wooden statue, crudely carved to make\nthe image of a sneering wolf; it's stance\nindicating that it is preparing to pounce.\nThe first creation of Daniel's budding\nWoodworking Career!", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Halfling's Grass", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nCauses extreme nausea in some drinkers,\nand a lofty, lightheaded sensation in others.\nDrinkers become extremely hungry after consumption.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose", "A red rose often given out as gifts to women\nby members of House Ebonheart as sign of\nrespect.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Pygmy Dragon Feathers", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Red Hydra Coin", "Arcane I\nRuby Red hydra coin. Representing 500 minas\nworth to be used in Hydra Auctions\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("✽ Sapling of the Tree of Life ✽", "", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Tippen's Root", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nAn efficient coagulant.\nStops bleeding where applied.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Luminous Aurum Blade", "An excellent sword made of pure aurum, it has\na slight constant brightness when it is under\nthe light of the sun, the handle is wrapped\nin leather stained red, where you can read:\nDeath to the undead -AA", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Wary Ring", "Arcane I\nThis ring, made out of a silverish metal\nappears to also have a large ruby encrusted\ninto it. This ring tracks the wearer's\nhealth, measuring it out in a strange way. At\nthe peak of their condition the ring should\nstay the same color, a lustrous silver. As\ntheir condition worsens the ring starts to\nshift colors, progressively turning into a\nblack color. Once the ring has turned\ncompletely black the person is either dead,\nor so near death that nothing (save for a\nmiracle) can help them.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Necklace", "A simple iron chain that holds upon it a\nrather large emerald. The stone selected\ncarefully to ensure it is flawless despite\nits rather plain setting. The necklace itself\nhas been enchanted so that it wards the\nwearer against mental magic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aelsioln.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Broach", "An ornate broach crafted in the shape of a\ncrow. Enchanted by the Wizards John and\nColtaine Wick, when tapped thrice the gem\nwould glow and provide a feeling of warmth to\nthe wearer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("HotHands", "The crude chunk of quartz appears to be\nnothing more than an unspectacular rock,\nthough if pressure is applied, heat starts to\nradiate out with small temperature increases\naround the user's hand.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Abyssus.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Tankard", "The sides of the mug are ornately decorated\nwith etchings of glorious battles and vibrant\nfeasts. What draws your eye is the thin ring\nof runic symbols that ring the edge of the\nmug itself. Try as you might, you cannot seem\nto spill the contents but you have no problem\ndrinking. The piece is truly of Arcadian\nmake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ker'wolf Cloak", "A long furred cloak made from the fur of a\nblack Ker'wolf. The fabric can easily wrap\naround the whole body and keep the wearer\nwarm from cold environments. The cloak is\nattached to the wearer by a silver brooch in\nthe shape of a Mongoose circling a teal\npearl. The cloak is very comfortable and soft\nto touch.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Farryn.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Haelun'or Passport", "Looks official. A blue seal with the sigil of\nHaelun'or sits upon it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haelun'or Ministry of Admissions.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcadius", "A newly crafted staff, the base made from a\nspruce tree, giving it a darkenedappearance,\ntopped with a circular piece of iron. The\ninitials A.D.D engraved into thetop. A slight\nshimmer came from the staff, appearing as if\nenchanted. It bore magicalproperties, though\nwhat those properties were are unknown.\nAppearing to be of Doomforged Craftsmanship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by an Ascended.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Falchion", "Arcane I\nThe ancient aurum blade is well crafted and\ndecorated.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Claws", "Medium-sized claws of a young wyvern, the\nsurface smooth and white like ivory.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by EternalSaturn.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Biggun Treats!", "Food: 6\nSaturation: 6.0\nExpires in 6d 16h 40m", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluesteel", "A durable blue alloy.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Arrowhead", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Stud", "your mother doesn't love you", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealed Thanhic-Powered Icebox", "A sealed box that is used to keep food cold,\nusing the power of Thanhium. The Thanhium has been\nproperly sealed to keep the food toxin free, but\nas a concequence only raw food types can be put inside\nsafely.\nBrought to you by Greg Corp. [TM Greg 1541]\nGreg Corp is not responsible for possible\ninjuries, thanhic poisoning, or fatalities that may occur\nwhile operating the device.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("╁ Azure Emberknife ╁", "Arcane I\nWithin your hand is the second of seven\nEmberknife prototypes produced by Emberco, a\nholy weapons company formerly stationed in\nKal’Omith. It appears to be nothing more than\nan ornate silver hilt, though testing will\nreveal a twistable handle that causes an\nethereal blade of condensed holy fire to be\nproduced. The Emberblade phases through and\nis halted by any substance not corrupted,\nhowever, it burns through corrupted flesh\nsimilarly to an aurum blade.\nhttps://goo.gl/7QhjSQ\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Boggy Concotion", "This swampy brew adds a soothing\nsensation to the areas in which it is\nadministered.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Text", "Notes, political documents, letters, and\nessays written in an ancient language.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Memes", "Food: 1\nSaturation: 0.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cheesecake", "", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("✦ Cinderwarden Kite Shield [T5] ✦", "One of many items made popular by Emberco, a\nholy weapons company stationed in the dwarven\ncity of Kal’Omith. The Cinderwarden Kite\nShield is designed to damage any corrupted\norganic substance which comes into contact\nwith it, causing severe burns and potentially\nsetting them on fire with white holy flame if\nthey persist. Perfect for fighting Shades.\nResists 10 attacks before needing recharged.\nThis one comes with a manual!\nhttps://goo.gl/6XKT3Z\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Studded Coinpurse", "A small leather pouch, covered in polished\nleather studs, causing it always to make soft\nclinks, no matter the contents, or lack\nthereof. It has a small red drawstring, along\nwith 2 extra in the pouch incase one is lost.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:blaze_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Freezing Salve", "Almost freezing to the touch, this salve may\nallow you to pass through the hot climates\nof the world.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Salve of Mandragora", "A salve made from Mandragora, with\nAqua Vitae as a base. It has great tissue healing properties\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Pain - WHO WAS THE FALLEN, IRRI'AYE", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Cosmic entity,\n- Unwin", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Blissfoil", "A small collection of blue flowers perched\natop stalks of a flimsy nature. Easily\nremoved, it is a great pain reliever and\nnumbing agent. Using too much might\npermanently numb an area.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Night Sap", "Only found in deformed oak trees, the thich\nhoney like substance shines brilliantly when\nextracted. The smooth substance causes\nmuscles to relax and strike the patient with\ndrowsiness. Aftereffects include strong\nmigraines, and being addicted.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Toy Dwedish Soldier", "A wooden soldier with articulated joints, the\nwork of a famed company of Dwarven toymakers.\nHis stern emerald eyes gaze out above a\npainted auburn beard, armour carved to\nresemble that of a Grand Legionnaire. The\nbottoms of his his sturdily-booted feet are\ncarved with inert Dwarven runes, set in a\nsemicircle about the heel. \"Narvak Urguan,\nthey read, \"Narvak Tumunzahar.\" Below these\nphrases, a maker's mark of the Emberhorn Clan\nis evinced.", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrum Ingot", "*Moderator Approved*\nFyaaheart approved this item.\nA refined whitish gold alloy with few imperfections\nin it's surface, dark creatures would find it painful to the touch", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Salve of Serpent's Stalk", "A salve made from Serpent's Stalk, with\nAqua Vitae as a base. Leasens pain in\nburns and helps with it's healing.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Salve of Athin", "A salve made from Athin, with Aqua\nVitae as a base. It has great cooling\nproperties. More ingredients can be added", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Salve of Halfling's Grass", "A salve made from Haflilng's Grass, with\nAqua Vitae as a base. Works almost like a\ndrug, making the drinker feel more relaxed.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Mint", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Strawberry Ice Cream", "A lovely, creamy frozen dessert that tastes\nstrongly of freshly picked, Devirad-grown\nStrawberries.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Crossbow", "+20% Arrow Velocity", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Krastor's Bone", "A bone from the wing section of a giant alpha\nbat of Mordskov. Collected by savages in\n1633.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Journal", "", "minecraft:writable_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dragon Scale", "An ancient dragon scale found\non creatures in the harshest of environments\nfrom days long past.\nIt still seems to have some of it's old\ntexture. Perhaps it can be reused?", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Leather Helmet", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Dewlox.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Healing Potion", "A complete potion of greater strength.\nHeld highly for its strong healing power,\nthe concoction has a glowing green tinge,\nwhich, upon application, dyes the skin\ntemporarily. It's capable of closing and\nhealing any open wound, and can even\naid in internal bleeding. One becomes\nslow and disorentated when it's in use.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornbark Staved Longbow", "+37% Arrow Velocity\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by julius55.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Chestplate", "", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Minotaur's Horn", "A long, curved black horn cut from the head\nof a large minotaur!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by an Ascended.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Alchemist's Fire", "One of the great feats of alchemists.\nAlchemist's fire is to many known as\nfire in a bottle, an unstable concoction\nwhich brusts fire in every direction\nonce releaced. Dangerous to both\nenemy and thrower alike, as there is\na high chance of the volatile bottle\nexploding still in your hand.", "minecraft:splash_potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Tablet", "Roughly the size of a large book, this stone\ntablet is etched with unknown runes.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Oil", "You won't be surviving if you drink this.\nIt's an oil used in weapons and armor,\nmade to chill the skin of those it touches,\nslowing their movement greatly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Food Crate", "A crate for food containment.\nClick on this item with uncooked food in your cursor to store.\nContains:\n2.14x Pineapple\nTo open, right click with the crate in main hand.", "minecraft:piston", ""),
        StaticItem("Birch Tea", "An ancient Druidic recipe.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carrot Juice", "This orange liquid has a sweet, earthy taste.\nThe label says, \"Bekarr's Famous Relaxant!\nGreat for menopausal women with heat-flashes,\nand for improving eyesight!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by [Gobo Apothecary] Bekarr.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Eggnog", "A delicious and creamy drink that\ntastes mildly of custard.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Tinkers Post", "", "minecraft:daylight_detector", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Fricassee", "Food: 6\nSaturation: 6.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_rabbit", ""),
        StaticItem("Fried Chicken", "Fine crust of golden-brown,\nfilled with the blessing of all the\nculminated joys and hopes of murdered poultry\nFood: 6\nSaturation: 6.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_chicken", ""),
        StaticItem("tile.banner.name", "These banners were smashed together by\nrubbing colored rocks against them. They look\nextremely dirty and may have been used as a\ntissue. Regardless, the banners express\nKrugsmas cheer! Merry Krugsmas!", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of House Ashford de Savoie", "The dark black sun banner of House Ashford de\nSavoie. It was the banner that hung atop\nAldersport, the banner which flew overDuke\nJon the Conqueror on the fateful day of his\nfall and the banner which flew over Duke\nBohemond the Young when he and his kin were\nmassacred in the year 1593. Holding this\npower would empower a loyal soldier with an\nintense fervour of Savoyard nationalism.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of holding", "This ornate staff allows you to cause two\nobjects within 3 feet of the stave of up to\nfive pounds (2.2 KG) to float towards the\nstaff head once the head of the staff is\ntapped. The heads follow the staff, and\nceases to float once the head is tapped\nagain.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:iron_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Catus Green Blunt", "A Dank filled blunt, good for gettin lit\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by TakKumn.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Blood", "The blood is very toxic, and possesses\nacid-like features. It has similar properties\nto alchemist fire, and can also be used in\nmany religious rituals.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:lava_bucket", ""),
