        StaticItem("Thé du Jardin", "The tea leaves would form a light and elegant\nbrew, however with a sweet suggestion of\nsummer fruits it’d give its taste a\ncharacteristic twist with the hint of rose\nallowing it to glimmer a deep shade of rouge.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
