        StaticItem("Lesser Flute of Emotion : Fear", "A lesser version of The Flute Of Emotion.\nIt's effects take longer to cast and can only\naffect a single emotion, in this case Fear.\nMade out of darkened wood aswell as covered\nin several runes, the small magical gem\ninside of it gives the sound it creates a\nmagical effect to slightly alter someones\nemotions. The longer the user listens to the\nmusic it creates the stronger the effect\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Readicti.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Imperial Sword (Zeremonienschwert)", "The Imperial Sword has an overall length of 110 cm (43.3 in), with the length of the\nblade being 95.3 cm (37.5 in). The crossguard on one side bears the HORENVS : VINCIT\n: HORENVS : REIGNAT : HORENVS : INPERAT (Horen triumphs, Horen reigns, Horen rules).\nOn the reverse side, the shorter variant HORENVS : VINCIT : HORENVS : REINAT. The pommel\nis of the \"mushroom\" or \"tea-cosy\" shape typical of the high Imperial period. The pommel\nis engraved with the arms of Holy Orenian Emperor Godfrey The lower edge of the pommel\nis inscribed with BENEDICTVS · DO[minv]S DE[v]S QVI DOCET MANV[s]+ viz (Blessed be the\nLord my God, who teaches the hand [to wield]).\nThe scabbard of the sword is adorned with 14 gold plates engraved with depictions of\nmonarchs. The name Imperial Sword is (Zeremonienschwert)\n*Moderator Approved*\nTauFirewarrior approved this item.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
