        StaticItem("Snowmaiden's Greetings", "A little card made of cotton paper, with a artistic smattering\nof snowflakes decorating the card.\nSeasons greetings for the Year 1538, Merry Krugmas!\nSigned, the city of Laureh'lin.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle of Light", "Given to those who arrived to Aethermoore’s\nvery first festival, this candle is a small\nlittle thing. The candle’s holder is of twisted gold,\nholding a beeswax candle within it.\nIts wick is unlit.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
