        StaticItem("Silver Pocket Watch", "A silver pocket watch that has intricate\ncarvings on it, going all the way around the\nface of the watch. Deeply engraved on the\nback of it would be the word \"Elrith\". Upon\nopening the watch you can see that it held a\nrather simplistic design.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Celia's exquisite jewelry.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("The Fury - WHO WAS THE FIRST, NAME UNKNOWN", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Patron,\n- Unwin", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Grobsnopper", "A reddish-orange plant with small pot sitting\nin the middle of its petals, this plant is\nknown by apothecaries as a strong\ndisinfectant on wounds. It is usually hanged\nabove a bed post to ward off disease.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Dead Flower Crown", "", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Voidal Horror Blood", "A thin glass vial containing an eldritch\nichor. The contents swirl, having the\nconsistency of a thin ooze. The liquid\ncontained is the blood of a Voidal Horror\nknown as Y'Golekraj; The Beast of a Thousand\nFaces.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Winners Dice Game Token", "This token indicates a win in a round of the\ngame.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 6xdestroyer.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
