        StaticItem("Legion Donation Pendant", "A golden pendant given in reward for donating\nto Legio I Ioannes.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Rapier", "A steel rapier, honed to a needle point tip.\nIt appears to be abl to deflect a blow or\ntwo, though the blade is quite thin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Whalebone Dagger", "A Dagger, sharpened and crafted from the\nbones of a Whale. Carefully shaped and\ngrinded down, the edge of this makeshift\nblade has come to a sharp point.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Claw", "A bastard sword crafted by a master smith,\nwielded by Markus.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken sword", "Half the sword's blade is missing, a wolf\nhead is carved into the pommel\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sneakybandit.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Brew of Harmony", "A marvelous concoction of a light green hue.\nIf drank, it cleans the stomach of toxins and\nacids, making the person feel relaxed\nand well feed. It can also be used to purify\nthe outside of the body, this liquid many\ntimes used to clean alchemy ingredients\nand precious gems.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Happy Birthday, Holly!", "On your birthday, the pulsating vibes\nthat emit from within this stone shall\nbring you happiness when you are\nsurrounded by the ones you truly adore.\nShould your birthday be filled with\njoyous moments, and many grand moments.\nTo create memories is to live your life\nfully.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Dagger", "This Oceanic Crystal has been sharpened to a\npoint, creating a strong yet effective\nweapon. The shard would be bound to a small\nmetal handle wrapped in leather, creating a\nvery unique dagger.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Urguanian Ranger's Crossbow", "+1% Arrow Velocity\nWood and Grandaxe steel. Durable, and\nbeautifully crafted, adorned with runes and\netchings.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Ferrum Arrowhead", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluesteel Warhammer", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n20% chance on full hit to cripple target.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.8 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+32% Attack Damage\n+2.5 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Battleaxe", "Special Ability: Shield Break\nDisable an opponents shield on successful hit.\nWhen in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+9 Attack Damage\n+52% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Warhammer", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n10% chance on full hit to cripple target.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wedding Band", "A gold wedding band, simple in shape and\nbearing no stones. However the engravings\nform delicate vines and leaves, with an\nextraordinary level of detail despite being\ntiny.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Lemon", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Piano Wire", "A strand of silvery wire that glistens in\nsunlight.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tavern_Roleplay.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Banana", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Sausage", "Food: 3\nSaturation: 5.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Wedding Band", "A flawless circular shaped emerald sit's\nwithin the center of a pure gold ring. About\nthe band of the ring are incrested small\nemerald shards, Cassian & Annebelle is carved\nwithin the inside of the band, below the gem.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Ringbearer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Ruby", "The brilliant scarlet Ruby is the size of a\nbowling ball, though it will roll around if\npushed with enough force. Maybe it's useful\nfor something.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Lord Keldrith", "Within your grasp sits a circular lapis\namulet of the Triumvirate Lord Keldrith. An\ninncer circle made of gold sits within the\namulet itself, carved into this inner circle\nis the symbol of a radiant sun with a serious\nlooking face adjourning it's being.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Torc", "http://imgur.com/a/Evf2g", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Quartz Ring", "An elaborate ring of quartz carved to have\nthe appearance of many overlaying leaves.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Cru Bourgeois", "Made from hand-picked grapes grown in and\naround the village of Meursault, this is an\nabsolute belter of a white burgundy. With its\nsoft supple fruit, well-judged use of French\noak and juicy finish it could pass for\nsomething far grander.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Hair Piece", "A golden ornate hair piece embellished with\ncrimson poinsettia flowers and small white\ndiamonds that sparkle in the light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Imperial Family.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Makeup with Powder Puff", "Made of the softest material, its white\nfluffy puff would be able to apply powdered\nmakeup and even powdered scented perfume.\nThere would be a small silk strap on the back\nto easily grab and use this properly. The\nmakeup was a fine red powder to add to the\ncheeks to flatter men. It was held in an\nivory dish.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Scylfing Daemon Steel Blade", "A Daemon Steel longsword sits within your\ngrasp, the blade's length a shining midnight\nblack, the handle made of a fine steel\nwrapped in tooled leather depicting lettering\nin a forgotten language. A fine shining\ncrimson gemstone rests at the end of the\npommel shaped like a four sided star.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Necklace", "The necklace would be made with pure blood\nred rubies, each one reflecting off with its\npurity and lightness. Attached by a strongly\nmade string it would feel as if it were a\nperfect match once put on, the edges staying\npristine and untouched.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Scylfing Axe", "A masterfully forged norse styled bearded\naxe, the metal coloured a dark black, and the\nhandle of the weapon made with a fine oak,\nreinforced with iron. Archaic scylfing-based\ndesignes are painted upon the handle itself\nwith an off-white paint that depicts ancient\nwarriors and epics written in a forgotten\nlanguage.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Pickaxe of Disappointment", "It seems to almost apologize every time you\nhave to use it... weird.", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Armalite Crossbow", "A finely crafted Armalite crossbow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dabliusmaximus.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Chalice Coin", "Golden Chalice Coin\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of the Miner", "Brimming with raw knowledge.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottomless Satchel", "Exactly what it says on the tin! A seemingly\nbottomless bag, magical in nature!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Kiss", "A minty tasting powder that is very cold\nand chilling to the touch. Just the auroma\nprovides the holder with a chilling sensation", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Haensetian Whistle", "An ornate whistle carved out of bone\nenchanted by the Wizards John and Coltaine\nWick, when spoken through it would amplify\nthe users voice so they may cry out in there\ntime of need. (You may PM anyone in an 80\nblock Radius)\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Tinkerer Kalen's Crank", "What, did you expect\nFood or something? Do\nI look like a chef or something?", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Dwarf's Pumpkin Ale", "Better drink than Dwarf's Pumpkin\nonly exists to a lot of people. It's very\nspicy and very sour. Great flavor for a\ndrunken night out.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Potion of Accuity", "Improving your senses through drinking a\npotion has never been as useful as\nimproving your body. Yet a Greater potion\nof Accuity can make your senses better,\nnot only the external ones, but also how\nyou sense your own body. With greater\ncontrol of it, you are able to move it better\nand achieve greater feats.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Tranquility", "Arcane I\nA sea-blue sweet pea that when held will\ngrant the person a sense of serenity and\nstillness in any chaos from their life. This\nmystical flower is said to be used by even\nthe most eldest of druids in their direst\ntimes. The feelings will linger for some time\neven after the flower is gone.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Happiness", "Arcane I\nA pale dandelion that when held will grant\nthe person the sense of happiness and joy.\nTheir weights are lifted, and their spirits\nare high. Even after the flower is withdrawn\nfrom the person, the sense will linger at a\nmuch less potent rate.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:yellow_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Backpack", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by [[Temp skin]] [No Real Name].", "minecraft:purple_shulker_box", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Blade", "The golden blade would seem to\nshine in your hand. The weapon\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe hilt would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a brazier\nlit with the outline of a what\nappears to be a flame decorates\nthe base of the blade. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Dagger", "The golden dagger would seem to\nshine in your hand. The weapon\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe hilt would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a brazier\nlit with the outline of a what\nappears to be a flame decorates\nthe base of the blade. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Staff", "The golden staff would seem to\nshine in your hand. The item\nitself looks to be holy in construct.\nThe head would have the symbol of\na Mongoose engraved into it. A\nsecond engraving of a scroll\ntied with a ribbon which loops\nmany times around decorates\nthe length of the staff. When\nactivated by someone with a\nconnection to the song of Aeriel,\na silver light would pulse from them.\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Avern's Aurum Staff", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Avern.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Necklace of the Mongoose", "Necklace made of small rings aurum, it has a\nlarge diamond polished with a golden mongoose\ncarved in the center and the emblem of the\nAscended on the other side, with a phrase\nthat says: \"You will be always in our\nhearts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Suxals.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Necklace", "A rather well-crafted golden necklace. The\nchain is entirely gold, while the main part\nof the necklace is also gold. However, there\nare also different gems embedded in the main\nnecklace: Diamond, Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald.\nIf one were to look on the otherside of the\nnecklace, the word 'Aeriel' is seen.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Painted Wooden Abacus", "A finely polished painted wooden abacus. A\ncounting apparatus with many different rungs\nwith 10 beads on each . It is well finished,\nand slightly glossy.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:ladder", ""),
        StaticItem("Heart Fragment", "The heart is still a little bit bloody, but\nit looks valuable enough for research!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Portal Core", "The portal core seems to have intricate runes\ninscribed into it, the runes would not be\nidentifiable. Perhaps putting it in the\nportal will do something?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Portal Core.", "minecraft:redstone_lamp", ""),
        StaticItem("Raw Thanium", "", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Forsaken Scripture", "The disparaged remnants of an old gift, hewn\nof leather, now torn apart from a fit of\nguilt and angst. Once a wineskin gifted by a\nLady to a Knight, it now acts as a\nremembrance to the bitter turmoil invested in\ntheir detachment. A darkness resonates from\nthe prayers carved into the hide scrap, with\nits history of contempt being the only source\nof ill will. \"Harrowing Maiden, bear witness\nto my resolve...\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Lurker", "The crystalline shard has strange etchings\nthroughout its structure. The center of the\npiece appears to have some sort of dark\nsphere, which its strands extend outwards\nthrough the crystal. The shard would be\nomniously cold, contact upon flesh for an\nextended amount of time would cause great\ndiscomfort. [PM BedsAreBurning if you come\ninto contact with this object and for any\ninteractions with it.]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Head of Cy'thar", "A head taken from a greater Strigae who led a\ncult in the swamps of Mardon. Only known as\nCy'thar Child of God.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_K_Production.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Amethil Sword", "A pure black sword of seemingly otherworldly\norigin, the metal a special alloy of\nmeteorite and aurum. It would appear\namazingly sharp, with several words etched\ninto the side. Most would be unable to read\nsuch, and find looking at the words akin to\nlooking at the sun. A single diamond gem\nwould rest within the crossguard.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Dabokkvare Fragment", "The crystal fragment would glow a soft orange-red,\nand would seem to drain magical energy from those who touch it.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Helmet of the Ashkeeper", "An ancient helmet known by the even older\nNecromancer that wore it in his prime;\nAshkeeper Abdiel, the lord of the Redshrouds,\nand the one who breathed the long-buried\ntruths of Xionism back into the fray of\nmortalkind. It is stained with dark, dried\nblood, bidding suggestion to a violent,\npresumably final, struggle.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Thalon the Wight", "An ominous cranium with multiple dents and\nfractures from what would appear to be from\nintense combat. Clean to the bone, itwould\nbear no filth, and the only modifications to\nbe seen would be a leather strip ran through\neye slits, enabling easy carry and transport\nfor the holder.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Witch Blood", "The cold blood of a Frost Witch, chilled to\nthe touch. Condensation gathers around the\nglass in warm areas.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood Sample", "A small clear vial containing a viscous, dark\nred liquid. A small label is placed on it\nreading 'Kyral Winterleaf - Severe Soul\nAlteration", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion", "draught of incITE\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Zarsies.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Spine of Steel", "The rod of steel is cold, and whispers\nviolent tendencies to those who touch it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MrJoshy.", "minecraft:bone", "")
    )

    private fun _AXIOS_TAHN_3(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Hugger Head", "The dome-like, nigh featureless head of a\nMordskovian Hugger. Nothing but two pin-like\nnostrils and shark black eyes, and a huge set\nof razor-sharp jaws are visible.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield of Iblees", "Carried by a Servant of Iblees in the days of\nold, stuck down by the Ascended at the siege\nof Bastion, this shield remains battered and\nscortched, it's metal Rim looks rusted and\nmarkings of Iblees is engraved within the\nwood\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Jeweled Necklace", "An expensive and flashy looking necklace made\nfrom fantastic looking gemstones strung with\na silver chain. The necklace would have a tag\nattached with the words \"Maehr'sae\nHiylun'ehya\" inscripted on it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Helm", "This is a set of superiorly-crafted bone\nboots. It is encrusted with sea-salt and\npowdered silicate, and studded with pearls\nand lobster shell. The object is decorated\nwith giant squid beak, giant crayfish shell,\nand raenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Ring", "A simple but carefully made band of silver, a\nsmall emerald cut to exact porportions sat\ndirectly upon the middle. Cut to only ever\nfit right one a certain person's finger, it\nwould shine with an unspoken promise and\nremind one of happy memories long forgotten.\nUpon the inside of the band lay the words,\nnearly undetected save for a careful eye,\nForever and Always,\" followed by the\nInitials F.H.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Langeschwanz.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Pendant", "Hung upon a chain of a thousand tiny silver\nrungs, this piece of jewelry rests easily and\ncomfortably around a one person's neck, as if\nmade for them. Hanging off the chain, would\nbe a single pure and immaculately cut\ndiamond, white in color, and the size of a\npinky nail, the small gem would twinkle\nfaintly. One couldn't help but feel a\nbitter-sweet remorse when touching it, as if\nremembering a friend or a lover, long\ndeparted. Upon the back of the clasp holding\nthe gem were the initials F.H.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Langeschwanz.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Saffron Amulet", "Within your hand rests a silver amulet inlaid\nwith a single, intensely bright golden ember\nin the shape of a diamond. It glows brightly\nat the touch, and illuminates a small area in\ndarkness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Crude Bonespear", "A crudely fashioned spear with a bone tip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bokermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Antediluvian Blade", "An ancient blade of curved aurum\nused for ritual sacrifices\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Chestplate", "This is a superiorly-crafted bone chestplate.\nIt is encrusted with sea-salt and powdered\nsilicate, and studded with pearls and lobster\nshell. The object is decorated with giant\nsquid beak, giant crayfish shell, and\nraenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Islebone Leggings", "This is a set of superiorly-crafted bone\nleggings. It is encrusted with sea-salt and\npowdered silicate, and studded with pearls\nand lobster shell. The object is decorated\nwith giant squid beak, giant crayfish shell,\nand raenkelp.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:chainmail_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("A Very Lovely Cake.", "It's not actually that lovely. Maybe like...\na 4/10. It's tasty, though.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of nafari", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("A Coinoins", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Lever", "Not your typical lever. This lever is\ncompletely busted, in the shape of a spork\nand seemingly changes into a tiny teacup\nplate with the use of some mad enchant", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Necklace of Cy'thar", "Arcane III\nHanging upon a near-pure silver chain is an\nemerald shaped like a diamond, engraved\nwithin is the phrase 'Long live the son of\nGod, most holy Cythar\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by A_K_Production.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Uriel Necklace", "A brilliant and beautiful gem, encrusted\nwithin a pristine clasp with various\nengravings lining the metallic linings of the\ngem. Crafted and worked upon by the finest\njewelers, the family relic emits a softened\nglow when held within the hands of a specific\nindividual, seemingly able to identify and\nresonate with harmony within her presence.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Uriel Dynasty.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Horror Stone", "A crystalline object, imbued with the call of\nthe Horror. When you hold this in your hand,\na certain chill is sent down your spine.\nShould you find yourself in deep meditation\nin it's possession, you may hear a faint\nwhisper in your ear. [[MArt: The Horror Stone\n- Equipment of an Artificer v2]]\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ser Crumena.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcanist Breastplate", "An arcane breastplate, formed around a mana\ngem meant to be secured to one's person. It'd\nshimmer with a magical glow, its capabilities\nexpansive. To see full information, check\nArcanist's Breastplate in the Magic Artifacts\nsection of the forums.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Luminescence", "Basic aurum and reinforced glass sphere,\nenchanted to cast a brilliantly bright\nmagelight in the center of the orb, along\nwith ground aurum dust on the inside. This\norb, when broken, expels an insanely sharp\nlight in all directions, along with the aurum\nflakes, temporarily causing blindness to any\nwho directly hit by the light,and affecting\nspooks in the nearby area. Roughly the size\nof a tennis ball, this rather heavy and dense\norb holds the unique ability to simply lock\nin place wherever it is\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Mad Artificer.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Starlight", "A beautiful ring, with a black band made from\na fallen meteor. Within the band itself rests\na shining Aengul Eye that glows bright white\nagainst the black of the ring band. When a\nword is whispered the ring will surround the\nuser in a bright white light, similar to the\nglow of a star. This glow encompasses them\nand any equipment they possess, instilling a\nfeeling of calmness on the wearer. On the\ninside of the ring, inlaid with silver, is\nchisled \"The Darkness gives way to the Light\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arik Vanir.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Meteorite Ore", "Ore drawn out from a fallen meteor", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Tattered Robes", "Within your grasp sits a poorly constructed\nand hardly cared for black robe crafted in\nthe style of the Cy'thar Canon Cultists\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lukariatias.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Branch of the Far Glade", "A branch from one of the Far Flade's trees.\nIt brings back memories that simply feel like\ntruly elaborate dreams.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ri'va T'sagari.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Divine Flame", "A piece of charcoal that radiates with heat.\nIt is physical proof that you havebeen\npurified in the flames of the Far Glade.\nIt'll allow you safe passage into the\nundergrove.The heat it radiates is hot enough\nto set your clothes aflame and melt thin\narmor. It is highlyrecommended that you DO\nNOT hold this with your bear hands. On one\nside of the piece of charcoal is a simple\nphrase, \"You are Damned.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ri'va T'sagari.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Data Collection Cube", "A sensory and data storage unit, used to\nstore any and all information possible. Be\nthey memories, traits, fingerprints or other\ntypes of data, the Data Cube is used solely\nto store any and all information forced into\nit. Similar to a Golem Core, the Cube may be\nimprinted with a personality. The cube pulls\nat the mind, soaking up any and all\ninformation it can find if nearby a person or\nbeing.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Alviras", "A unique and ornate necklace that, when worn,\nallows the wearer to induce a constant and\nongoing calming effect to sooth a tempered\nmind, allowing the cracks which formed within\nthose broken to be eased and mended by it's\nsheer power for time of it's burden.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Erised", "Created by a madman, the time was designed to\ntap into the very being who laid their hand\nupon it, constructing and allowing the reader\nto survey it's contents; As the user would\nread the time, they'd read the perilous\njourney of their lifethus far, and soon begin\nto transition into detailing untemperered\nstories of their future. As digits coiled\naround it's binding, the seemingly ancient\ntome would instill confidence into the\nholder.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Mad Artificer.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Multitool", "A base handle with a foot long, thick and\nheavy metallic rod. This object has several\nabilities. With the ability to extend forward\nto the length of an arming sword, the tool\ncan either have the metallic rod shift and\nchange shape to suit the users needs, or the\nrod can push forth an Arcane projection to\nthe shape the user requires. Adopting either\nan Arcane projection or simply altering the\nshape of the thick metallic rod, the tool is\nsupposed to simply make menial tasks easier.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Mad Artificer.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Karate (or Kung Fu) Egg ★", "Some rumour that the hou-zi once got into\nmartial arts and began to break bricks with\ntheir bare hands. There was a point that they\ncould break even a thousand bricks at once,\nbut then, a suspicious easter orc came and\ngave them some easter eggs that couldn't be\nbroken even by the strongest of the hou-zi.\nNow, one of these very eggs rests on your\nhand, but it was softened with the power of\nlove. Also, it tastes of chocolate and peanut\nbutter. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Renascence Egg ★", "An easter egg so good-looking that some\nrenowed artists such as Horenardo da Vinci,\nMalilangelo and Krugatello have made great\npaintings about this egg. But it doesn't\nreally matters since all you want to do is to\neat it due to its innovative taste of grapes\nand chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sea Serpent Pin", "The pin depicts a writhing sea serpent with\nteeth bared, a vicious looking beast cast in\ngold. There is a point on the back so it can\nbe clasped to a jacket. The pin itself is\nonly about an inch in length.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Estrid.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Thot Patrol Badge", "This green and white hand stitched patch.\nComes with black letters along the center\nThot Patrol", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("BoomStick", "Applewick was bored and created a wonderful\ncreation, this is the first of many relics he\nmade on his journey to be the best GM lotc\nwill ever know\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by AppleWick.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Azure Simorgh feathers", "A radiant, azure feather that glistens\nwonderfully when exposed to light at certain\nangles. It's quite long too, being at least\nan entire foot long. Would make for a great\nquill, or hat and hair accessory.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Tariel", "An amulet in the shape of a twelve pointed\nstar with an additional four pointed star\nwithin, tis the symbol of Lord Tariel, Prince\nof the Stars.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Keldrith", "Amulet of Lord Keldrith, King of the Sun. The\nnecklace is in the shape of a circle with the\nsymbol of the shining sun within, the sun\nitself has a masculine face in it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of Rellenia", "A circular diamond amulet of Lady Rellenia,\nQueen of the Moon. The necklace is circular\nin shape and depicts a female face on a full\nand illuminated-looking moon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("The Lyiaxian Blade", "Arcane V\nA brilliant longswords with the ability to\nunleash blasts of pure arcane energy towards\nits opponents. This is done with a slash or\nthrust of the sword, activated through the\nusage of the weapon as though it was a\npaintbrush. The weapon itself is made from a\nsolidified and warm arcane weaponised blade,\nable to shift and alter it’s shape over time.\nUnfortunately, the more arcane which is\nexpelled through slash and thrust attacks,\nthe weaker the blade itself will be.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by A Mad Artificer.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Revion's Right", "A leather glove for the right hand, with a\ndiamond set at every knuckle and a focus\ncrystal in the center of the palm. When\nactivated, a powerful electrical charge\ngathers on the glove, able to deliver a shock\nto anyone touched. One charge, four emotes to\nbuild up, lasts for four emotes before\nending.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wrist Rocket", "An intricate purple gauntlet, running with\nlines of magegold. A golden spike protrudes\nfrom a ferrum canister upon the top.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Magegold Gauntlet", "A fragile gauntlet of magegold, with a\nrounded ferrum cylinder protruding from its\ntop. A nozzle likewise extends from the\ncylinder.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Revion's Left", "A leather glove for the left hand, with a\ndiamond set at every knuckle and a focus\ncrystal in the center of the palm. When\nactivated, a powerful, blinding flash of\nmagelight erupts from the palm. One charge,\nthree emotes total.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Staff", "A metal staff, wreathed in diamonds and\nmagegold lines. A focus crystal sparkles on\nthe tip.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Electric Rapier", "A finely-made rapier of aurum, with a large\ndiamond concealed underneath the cupped hilt.\nAn elegant weapon for a more civilized age.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mori Language", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Arlen Teharissa's Compendium Vol. 1", "The original copy of Arlen Teharissa's\nThesis that he turned into Prince\nArtimec, on20th of The Deep Cold, 1561.\nThe book details Arlen's vision on what\nnature is, how it came to be, and why The\nAspects are representatives of nature,\nbut not actual nature itself.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
