        StaticItem("Melon Juice", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Witch's Ring", "A simple golden ring, with the small shape of\nan upside-down triangle clumsily carved into\nits side. Possessed by an aurageist, this\nring changes the colour of one’s magic to a\ntwisted, dark, glowing, half-opaque purple,\nspare holy magic. The wielder of the ring\nfeels soft tingles on the worn area of flesh.\nThe tingling would slowly grow in magnitude,\nreaching heavy levels of pain if not taken\noff for a few hours. This ring was surely\nmeant for a finger that didn’t feel pain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AlFalah.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Meteorite Fragment", "This odd and warm rock seems to have fallen from the sky.\nIt gives off a pleasant and soothing aura to the holder,\nand shimmers with a golden hue.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Skaddernak Eye", "★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ApacheSniper.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:spider_eye", ""),
