        StaticItem("test block", "", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Chillblain Potion", "Grey, frosty scales of condensation\ncover the glass of the vial, blocking your\nview inside. Upon application, your skin\nchills to a icy blue, growing cold and hard.\nMore ingredients can be added", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Numbing Potion of Serpent's Stalk", "A blueish green potion.\nA mix of Serpent's Stalk salve with Blissfoil.\nQuick acting to numb the pain on burns.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toxic Tonic", "A glowing pink liquid that looks beautiful.\nIf one is captivated enough to drink it, they\nwould taste an extremely sour liquid, and\nsoon find something was dreadfully wrong.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's Pocketwatch", "The little watch would be hung by a detachable chain.\nIt is of a gold metal, with the clock face's hands\nmade of copper. An image of a beast would be detailed\ninto the back, its barbed tail filling its viewer\nwith an odd sense of power and security.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Band of Harmony", "A silver band with an intricate design. It\nwould appear as if alchemicalsymbols are\ncarved into the sides. The gem on top would\nbe of a light purple hue, giving off a slight\naura of power and harmony.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Soap", "*Moderator Approved*\n501warhead approved this item.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Holiday Helper Ornament", "The small shining bulb feels comfortably warm in your hand.\nIt would make illuminate any holiday tree you place it on!\n*Moderator Approved*\n_Aengul_ approved this item.", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Ring", "A pure golden ring, with many intricate\ninscriptions on it. Some depict heavily\nwooded areas, others depicting rivers. The\nfocal point of the ring is a tortoise and a\nporcupine, whom are on opposite sides of the\nring, with precious minute gemstones\nsurrounding them.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Holiday helper Hugs!", "Technically it is just a blanket... But boy is it soft.\n*Moderator Approved*\n_Aengul_ approved this item.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Nemo's Dad", "I gotta find my son!\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Music Box", "A delicate little music box, small details carved into\naged wood. When opened, soft music would fill the air,\nmaking its listeners feel safe and at home.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:noteblock", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Flute", "A long wooden flute that produces a beautiful sound when played.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("White and Blue Vase", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fancy Tea Cup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Blissfoil", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nNumbs muscles and nerves where applied.\nUseful for medics & doctors, and as a\nmuscle relaxant.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Elf's Hair infusion", "An infusion made from Elf's Hair, with\nAqua Vitae as a base. It makes you appear\nmore graceful after consumption.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Thin Concoction", "A liquid with a thinner consistency than water that\nswirls menacingly in its phial. It grants you some\nagility, but blurs your vision greatly.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Beauty", "Ever wanted your skin to be as best it could?\nTo have everyone in a room stare at you?\nThis potion makes you almost gleem in\nbeauty, softing the skin and giving it almost\na glow.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Blood Lotus", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nAn incredibly large source of vitamins and nutrients.\nProvides a day's worth of meals in one bottle.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pork Noodles", "Food: 8\nSaturation: 7.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Books", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Smudged Charcoal", "As the name suggests this inky black\nsubstance can be smeared on objects to dye\nthem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AerialKaibab.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Monkey Goods", "A lapis with multiple depictions of various\nelven genocides by Hou-zi carved into it.\nAcquired during the first meeting between man\nand monkey, circa 1599.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Spooky Pie", "Beware! You've been spooked!\nExpires in a spooky eternity!\nNaturally Soulbound", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Apparition's Skull", "A cracked skull that's seared black, strange\nwhispers envelop it, a profound darkness\nbesmurching its humble countenance.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AerialKaibab.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Figurine", "A big figurine made of lapiz, one\nrepresenting a dragon. The eye cannot but\nhelp but run along the body to view each\nminute scale and crease of muscle. While this\ndragon will match no description in record,\nthe cool and knowing gaze it holds does well\nto compliment any true dragon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jistuma.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Worm Teeth", "Who even knew worms had teeth? This sharp\nwhite spines are backwards facing, used by\nworms not only to chew, but to force prey,\ndirt, and poo into their gullets.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Leg", "The leg of a person that was once turned to\nstone. It's knee is bent backwards and broken\noff at the thigh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Arm", "The arm of a middle aged male turned to\nstone. It is broken off from the rest of the\nbody at the shoulder and in its grasp is a\nblank map.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Feather", "A large, white feather plucked from the skin\nof one of the most dangerous creatures of the\nlands.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Bone", "A large and heavy bone from a cockatrice. The\nsize of the beast it belonged to was surely\nformidable; This bone alone is nearly the\nsize of a man.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Cablam.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hei-Hei", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of 25yr. Herendulian Whisky", "This bottle of whiksy would be covered in\ndust, and if opened, would have a peaty\nalmost earthy smell to it. This aged whisky\nis almost unheard of in the land of Axios\nanymore.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("In Progress Potion", "Your potion, Soft Relaxant, is being brewed here!", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The graceful potion", "White wisps flow in the liquid of the potion,\ndancing like a petal in the wind.\nDrinking it makes you move more gracefully.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent and Tippen's Mix", "In this bottle is a thick light green sludge.\nWithin the mixture are unbroken clumps of\nmatter which had not been evenly integrated.\nA salve of tippen's root and serpent's stalk,\nfor healing cuts and burns. It gives greater\nsoothing sensation than expected, but rashes\ncommonly form.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Portable Brewing Kit", "Contains the essentials.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:brewing_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Twisted Wooden Rod", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ritual Lapis", "A piece of lapis with various depictions\ncarved into it. It primarily seems to be\nHou-zi slaughtering en masse.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Unknown Slimey Substance", "An odd slimey substance, doesn't really seem\nto have any use whatsoever. The Hou-zi seem\nto eat it sometimes, likely a cause of their\ndepopulation.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiny Ape Goods", "A mysterious material, offered to the\nWesterlands by their newfound ape-like\nfriends.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("A ghoulish head", "A ghoulish head, quite a filthy trophy, but\none nonetheless\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Haroldoni.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Winged Screamer Head", "The head of a 'Winged Screamer', commonly\nknown as a giant crow. A bolt protrudes from\nits right eye and patches of feathers are\nmissing from the head. The beak appears\nfragile, dropping the winged screamer's head\nwill surely break the beak off.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Carcoran Heart", "The disgusting heart of a massive Carcoran\nsat in this jar proof that one had slain the\nhorrific beast, a great trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by KBR.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
