        StaticItem("Curved Staff", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Maga Hat", "A reward for all the Orenian patriots who\nfought in service of the Lord Saviour on\n11/8/16. It practically sparkles in the\nsunlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Red_Rockkit.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Beauty Sleep", "For those who need help falling asleep\nat night, this potion creates a quick yet\nvery natural sleep. It doesn't last long, but\nyou will feel rejuvinated afterwards.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Quartz", "The diligent work of an expert stonemason.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Sock", "As you tip over the handy dandy Krugmas sock\nendless treats pour out from it!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Lapis Lazuli", "A 2 and a half inch red crystal sphere imbued\nwith magic, it's core would have a bright\nswirl to it. This is imbued with Flame\nTorrent. ((Please refer to the Arcane\nCylinder lore for how to use this))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toxzero.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugium", "This drug could be called opium if it was as\nweak as one. A red powder, tinted by unknown\nmeans, maybe even nature. The difference from\nthe krugium and the opium is that the krugium\nhas its plant derived from the jungle. It\nappears to be mixtured with a very tiny\nammount of night sap. In a matter of one or\ntwo minutes, the user will feel relaxed,\nsleepy, happy and numb all across the body,\nbut with a more pleasant feeling, forcing him\nto sleep after the use. Addicts a person\neasily.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
