        StaticItem("Wyvern Scale Chestplate", "A finely made plate-mail armor piece, meant\nto cover the wearer’s torso and arms. The\nchest-bit is made of reddish-black wyvern\nscales, which slowly fade into greenish-black\nat the arms. The pauldrons and elbowpads are\nmade of strong steel, made to deflect\nincoming blows as best as possible. In the\nmiddle of the chest, a small golden plate\nwith an onyx Lion on it is placed, indicating\nwho made it. The scales would provide\nexcellent defense against cuts, being near\nimpregnable. Piercing damage would be largely\nstopped, but not quite to the same extent as\ncuts. The scales make the armor surprisingly\nlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonscale Hauberk", "In your hand lies a scalemail hauberk, made\nby an expert smith. Noticeable about the set\nwould be that the scales weren't metal, but\nthick, boney, pitch black scales, most of\nwhich were as big as the palm of a hand. The\nscales derived from one of the mightiest\ncreatures in existence, namely a dragon. The\nhauberk would reach down to the wearer's\nknees, and had long sleeves attached to it.\nThe ends of the hauberk was decorated with\nsilver, giving it a lordly appearance.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Angmarzku.", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Redberries", "A sweet redberry.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
