        StaticItem("Rhum Tournant", "A standard edition of rum, bottled straight\nfrom a maturing oak barrel and distilled with\nnaturally grown sugarcane. Its taste would be\nslightly sharp but in turn allowing the\nnatural flavourings of the sugarcane to\nlinger upon the tongue, giving a sweet\naftertaste. Its bottle is marked with the\nl’Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
