        StaticItem("Potion of The Damned", "Where did you acquire this potion? When\nuncorked, the sounds of birds chirping\nandleaves swaying emanates from the bottle.\nThe smell of pine runs endlessly through\nyournostrils as nostalgia brings you back to\na place you haven't been since you were a\nchild.To drink this potion is to become\ndamned.. Or to be awakened.\n[PM Finalhazard if you're going to drink\nthis.]", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Classic Cactus Green", "In your hands, a prime piece of cactus green\nrests. With cactus farmed from the old\ndeserts by poorly paid goblins, where it was\nafterwards made into a paste and sold to you.\nThis cactus green is undoubtfully the best\none you can ever place your lips upon whilst\nhaving a strong scent and a quick jab of a\nbreeze on your head, continuing as you blaze\nit further. Made by Eath'Lur.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eath'Lur.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Thanhium-studded Leggings", "This recipe discovers the item\nThanhium-studded Leggings", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Black shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Luminous Aurum Waraxe", "Special Ability: Shield Break\nDisable an opponents shield on successful hit.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Vase", "A beautiful black vase.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Sword", "A bastard sword forged of bluesteel, with a\ndiamond buried into its crossguard and ruby\nas its pommel. When used properly, the holder\nof this weapon would find themselves capable\nof allowing blue-gray electricity to run\nalong the blade upwards of five minutes\nbefore they would require it to be recharged.\nPM Fury_Fire for Info.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Daemon Steel Blade", "Inscribed in the blades hilt is a quote of\nthe All-father, \"... and may your Flames\nnever die.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Angus's norlandic bluesteal", "A heavy sword that would be hard to swing and\nmaster, only a norlander could know how to\nuse this weapon with skill\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Monk Champagne", "Tastes like sweet sweet victory.\nExpires once the hangover ends\nNaturally Soulbound", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Revolver", "+40% Arrow Velocity", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Crossbow", "+26% Arrow Velocity\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mullraugh.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Firery Remedy", "It burns when applied to any open wound\nbut it leaves quick results.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield", "Stolen shield of the forces of Mordring, this\nis made of blackferrum and has stamped the\nimage of a black sun. The shield stinks to\ndeath and putrefaction, if you're not careful\nit could infect you some disease.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
