        StaticItem("Unstrung Redwood Stave", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Anti-Magic Amulet", "The golden amulet would have an intricate\nrune inscribed onto it. Any magic that would\ncome in contact with the rune would disperse\nor be weakened depending on the power of the\nspell. On the back of the gem the Arcadian\nSeal is stamped.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Green", "The most famous cactus green across ages,\nproduced and brought to you by the elder\nshaman Eath'Lur. Different from orcish green,\nthis cactus green comes from the desert from\nthe best and most selected cacti plants. It's\npure in essence and green as an orc skin. Far\nbetter than what any druid can enchant.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Os Baculo", "This staff would have a hound carved into it.\nThe shaft would be wrapped in gray and brown\ncloth stained with blood. A blunt bone would\nbe in the top of the staff. This dark oak\nstaff would appear to be from House Brawm.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mah'r.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Vins Fleur", "A standard edition of wine, aged only shortly\nand thus its full flavourings not coming\nthrough upon taste. Nevertheless its taste\nwould be a graceful combination of vanilla,\nsmoke and hints of sweet spices such as clove\nand cinnamon. A distant buttery aroma would\nlinger upon this wine. Its bottle is marked\nwith the l’Vienne crest.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Opiate Powder Solution", "A solution of the finest hard liquor mixed\nwith a lot of pure opiate powder. This is a\nvery, very strong solution with a single shot\nenough to get you high. It glows a purple\ncolour as the alcohol mixes with the opiates.\nIt shows the purity of the drink. WARNING:\nNOT TO BE CONSUMED BY UNDER 25 YEARS.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Unlabelled Wine", "The murky bottle seems of crude quality,\nnevertheless its contents take upon a deep\nrouge as the wine floats within.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:dragon_breath", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Future Egg ★", "An easter egg made of white chocolate even if\nthe technology of now doesn't allows such.\nProbably a fat rabbit travelled in time and\nwarped it through the fabric of space, but\nthis doesn't even changes the taste. Happy\neaster!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fur Brawm Vest", "The sigil of the Brawms the rabid hound is\ndepicted in the center of the chest, rabit\nleather is used to create the depiction", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Scale Armor", "The armor would be mostly made out of scales\nfrom a cockatrice, making it light as well as\nmore durable than iron. Specially made for\nfighters who like to be on the move but still\nbe protected by armor\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Tusk", "A tusk of a boar that is curved slightly with\nan tinge of yellow, they seem to be from a\ngrown adult! My what a chopper\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:quartz_stairs", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreakvir Bearded Axe", "Special Ability: Shield Break\nDisable an opponents shield on successful hit.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cyclopse Tooth Club", "A club whose head is made with the tooth of a\ncyclopse.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Deathbane", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rising Sun Glave", "The 6ft tall glaves blade would be made out\nof a strange ore that is constantly\nscortching hot, the weapon itself would be\nheavy but would be as durable as refined\nsteel. On the side of the blade would be the\nblacksmiths insignia, a three headed hydra\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Doom Blade", "The weapon was forged upon the legendary\nDoomforged anvil, and engraved in a plethora of runes.\n*Moderator Approved*\n__Xan__ approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Waraxe", "A large waraxe fit for an orc. However,\nthe blade has seemingly rusted with\nremnants of blood on the unkept\nblack-ferrum head.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hektor's Grimy Longsword", "A steel longsword of dull colour. The hilt is\nstrapped in a traditional rabbit hide grip\nthe sword is covered in an array of blood and\nuncleaned dirt. On the hilt you can barely\nmake out the name 'Brawm'.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Viktor's Battleaxe", "A well-polished axe, forged by a dwarf of the\nGoldhand clan. It has a glassy surface which\nalmost glimmers in the sun. The hilt of the\naxe is fastened from a traditional rabbit\nhide grip, you could also make out a 'Viktor\nembroided on the hilt.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dreakvir Roundshield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragments of Orcish Horns", "These partially intact fragments of what\nseems to be horns gave off an odd feeling.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Deleted Email", "Legend has it this was recovered by the\nDwarven whistleblower, \"Assangegoth.\" With\nhis efforts, Ski_Kings corruptions was\nbrought to light on 11/9/16.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Red_Rockkit.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("A Toy Boat", "This is an old timer, a veteran of the brine.\nThe old planks retain the odour of fish even\nafter a storm, indicating this boat may have\ngotten lost when the descendants sailed to\nThe Isles of Axios.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Aids_Of_Space.", "minecraft:boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald", "A perfectly cut, round Emerald necklace, it\nwould be a beautiful shade of green with a\nbright shine to it. the chain would be rather\nthin, made out of gold. it would catch\nanyones eye", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Hothgar \"The Fattest\" Irongrinder", "He died like he lived. Fat.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold Skull", "A skull coated in a cold layer of permafrost,\nit would always seem to be cold but it's\nunlikely to be poisonous. It seems like a\ngreat place to store drinks and the like.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Gooey Ball", "A sticky foul substance which is great with\nplay with when lacking of entertainment.\nThough, if not moved for even a mere second\nit will form to a hard solid unable to go\nback to its state beforehand without\nmovement.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Akello's Horn", "A large Alpha Venator's horn, quite a trophy!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
