        StaticItem("Boar-Zilla's Tusk", "One of two tusks belonging to the fabled\nBoar-Zilla, slayed by the Sirame. They're\nincredibly big compared to most boar, a true\nsign of the beast's greatness in life.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
