        StaticItem("Black Ferrum Lance of Varis", "This 12 ft long lance would be a solid Iron\nshaft with a wooden handle, and solid Aurum\nhandguard. thespike at the end would be made\nout of lead and a golden point which would be\nmade out of slayer steel, forged by Mariane'a\nAbernathy of the Ascended\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Space_Matrix.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Latoma", "Translating roughly to \"Bonecrusher,\" Latoma\nis a vicious flanged mace of Ruskan style.\nIt's made of hard steel with a blue Carbarum\nhead, and can be used with one hand or both.\nIt has long design running down the haft,\ndepicting a sea shark and ships.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Child] Boris Nikolas Ruthern.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Levana Olaris' Staff", "An ornate staff.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
