        StaticItem("Distress Switch", "A basic household enchantment using a long\ndistance focusing crystal. When activated, a\nspecific and attached gem would adorn a soft\nglow, as would the gem at the apex of his\nswitch. As the two gems get closer, the light\nwill get brighter and brighter.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Crumena.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
