        StaticItem("Engagement Ring", "A gorgeous ring eminating elegance. It's\nsteel formed sleek and comfortable around the\nfinger, with a glistening emerald decorating\nthe ring's top, shaped like a refined square.\nSmaller, less vibrant gems decorate the\nring's body, adding to its eloquence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Katherina de Fontaine.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
