        StaticItem("Mah'rs Pipe", "A finely crafted Brawm pipe carved out by\nHouse Brawm's best woodworker and famed\nChampion of the North, Mah'r Volaren. The\npipe would have a splash of green and grey\ndye to compliment the brown wood of the pipe.\nA hound would be carved onto the pipe\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Arockstar26.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
