        StaticItem("Gobo's Pumped Up Kicks", "The shoes of the trolls' little Gobo Helper.\nThe shoes are really two pieces of leather\nthat are tied around the feet, but they make\nyou feel faster... somehow. Merry Krugsmas!", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Unrefined Steel Blade", "", "minecraft:netherbrick", ""),
        StaticItem("Walking Stick", "Lore: A simple walking stick made for a blind\nperson\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MissToni.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Jellystone", "Petrified ooze, filled with an overexposure\nof natural energies. The flavorful taste\nbounded with exotic sweetness, and a hint of\noak texture. The perfect treat for your\nresident lifesucking entity! Or just a yummy\ncandy rock.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Experiment #11.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Plant Plume", "Contained within a small leather bag would be\na mysterious green powder. When tossed on a\ngrowing plant, a puff or plume of jade mist\nwould appear for but a few seconds. In its\nplace, the plant would have enhanced growth\nof almost ten times its original speed until\nit reaches maturity! [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nature.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Experimental Ooze", "Parts of an experiment. Subtle traces of\nnatural energies float within the otherwise\nsilent glob of ooze. It didn’t seem to do\nmuch other than jiggle. Jiggle jiggle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Experiment #11.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Mini Pool-Noodle", "Arcane I\nA small blue pool noodle, perfect for the\nlittle ones to use. Oddly enough when the\nnoodle was placed into water it would change\nthe color, turning it a bright aqua color.\nThe words 'Veris Summer Festival, 1618' would\nbe engraved into the noodle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby Shot Glass", "In your hand lies a small crimson shot glass\nmade from finely cut rubies. The cup's bottom\nbearing an engraving of a stout tankard of\nbeer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by sean66.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather of a Winged Screamer", "This massive, black feather reflects a subtle\nblue in the sunlight.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murdervish.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Blue Crab's Carapace", "Before you lies a great blue carapace having\nbelonged to a rare Giant Crab. The shell is\nvery thick and rough. Its resilience being of\nsimilar quality to that of leather armor.\nOtherwise a great ornament or trophy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by sean66.", "minecraft:prismarine", ""),
