        StaticItem("The Conservatoire Stamp", "A golden coin, the edges of the token formed\ninto an octogon. The front of the coin has an\nillustration of a book and quill inscribed\nonto it. On the back, a large \"C\" is carved,\nand under it, the phrase \"Scientia est\nPotentia\" is scribbled.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Prayer Rope", "You hold a prayer rope consisting of 300\nknots, made of thick black wool. Holding it,\nyou feel a strong urge to pray. A Lorraine\nCross hangs at the end.", "minecraft:lead", ""),
        StaticItem("Gentleman's Handkerchief", "A plain white silk handkerchief carried in\nthe pocket of a true gentleman. Though\nusually used to wipe your brow or nose, it\nmay also be offered - IF CLEAN - to a woman\nif she were crying. A true gentleman never\nasks for his handkerchief back.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes & Schmick Formal Outfitters.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
