        StaticItem("Ivory Staff", "A five and a half foot long mage's staff made\nfrom what appears to be ivory colored quartz.\nIt is straight with a pointed end at the\nbottom that could be possibly used as a\nweapon. The top bears a very large pale blue\nsapphire, cut into an orb.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Biting Frost", "An ornate and exquisitely beautiful necklace,\nwrought with great care by a master jeweler.\nIt drapes elegantly between the wearer's\ncollarbones, a glimmering cascade of silver\nwhich appears akin to a frozen row of\nicicles... or are they fangs? A large\nsapphire of exceptional size and quality is\nset along the upper part, high and snug\nagainst the wearer's throat.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Light-Keeper", "A black ferrum dwarven blade. On the blade\nitself multible runes can be seen. Creation,\nlighting, water, and Grimdugan can be\nidentified. A smith's stamp is placed on the\nbottom of the handle. DI is the stamp of\nDwain Irongut, Runesmith of the Irongut Clan.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hiebe.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
