        StaticItem("Lucky Rabbit's Foot", "The well preserved, soft paw of a rare\nwoodland rabbit. Superstition would have it\nthat wearing a rabbit's foot grants you luck,\nhopefully not the same luck that befell the\nrabbit.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Aleksandra var Ruthern's Ring", "A beautifully crafted golden band, with a\nshining diamond cut into a heart set into it.\nGleaming emeralds surround the outside of the\nheart shaped diamond, causing the ring to\nsparkle blue and green in the right light.\nChiseled very carefully, and in a neat hand,\nalong the inside curve of the band the words\nMy heart belongs to you\" inlaid with silver\nto better stand out against the gold. This\nring is a truly beautfiul craft, as well as\nthe ring used by Stefjan Kovachev to propose\nto Aleksandra Abrielle var Ruthern.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
