        StaticItem("Gilded Dragon Sallet", "An ornate, masterfully crafted sallet with a\nbevor, engraved with exquisite patterns of\ndragons in flight or breathing fire. It seems\nto fit perfectly and snug, a fine purple silk\nliner making it feel comfortable as can be.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by arkantos1279.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Wristwatch", "The watch would be made of silver. It would\nhave an engraving written on the back of it.\nThe engraving would state 'To my bestfriend,\nAleksandra Ruthern. May we be friends until\nthe end of our lives.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 5xdestroyer.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
