        StaticItem("Ethic-Breaker", "A small, circular metallic item with a red\ntinge. Upon igniting the deadly power within,\nthe burster can cause an explosion, one that\nexpells the metal and powdered, raw ruibrium.\nA deadly substance. (two meter radius).\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Burster", "A circular item forged of jutting metal and\nimbedded glass. Inside the item is a deadly\nmixture, should it be ignited via a fuse this\nitem will explode (1 meter radius explosion),\ncausing flame, some force, and metal and\nglass shrapnel to scatter about the area.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("The Frigid Bite", "A bastard-sword of a hard and sharpened steel,\nthe hilt of the blade had wolf-like heads on the\ncrossguard and fine, strapped leather around\nthe handle. The threaded pommel contained a stone\ninside, fueling the blade with a strike that dealt a\nfreezing cold.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWretched approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Knockout gas", "A substance with churning blue gas. Should it\nshatter, the gas would linger in the air for\na few moments, those that breathe it in would\nfind their senses waning; they would find\nthemselves going to sleep. Knocked out by the\ngas.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Carnivorous Solvent", "This bottled concoction holds a horrific\nsubstance within; the churning liquid, should\nit make contact with flesh, cloth, leathers,\nand bones, will begin to burn away at it -\neating away at the substance for a brief\nduration; this can be nullified by various\noils on the cloth, having the solvent eat\naway at those, should it connect.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stunners", "A bottle with a churning fluid and gas\ninside. Should the bottle shatter, the fluid\nwould spell into the air, glowing bright as a\nreaction happens to it. In addition, the\nvapor would linger, causing someone to slowly\nseize up and become paralyzed. ((2-3 emotes\nfor the paralysis to be in full effect. Lasts\nfor three emotes))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcane Disruptors", "A shard of Arcanium, suspended midair within\na cylindrical, reinforced glass case. On one\nof the ends of the glass case is a small\nbutton that, when pressed, will crush the\nArcanium in on itself, shattering it into\nmana pieces. Unfortunately, for any Mage\nresent, this will release the mana stored\nwithin the Arcanium out into the glass case.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Blackened Cockatrice Feather", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Virulent Slime", "This potion resembles that of tar. Deep\npurple in color, this brew will soak into the\nusers skin, creating a revolting odor as it\nbegins to work, a bubbling feeling felt inside,\nirresistible not to scratch, as it sears your skin.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Flame", "This mixture is not so much acid, as it is\nextremely spicy, and very bad for your\nstomach. Some dwarves and orcs might\nthink of it as a delicacy.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Gallon of Liquid Essence", "A gallon of churning, magical fluid. This has\nvarious uses, be it for sustaining magical\ncreatures, or for other applications.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Magic Ink", "An odd ink with magical power imbued inside\nof it. It can be used for odd and magical\npurposes.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Liquid Essence", "A bottle of churning, magical fluid. It has\nmultiple uses, be it for sustaining some\nmagical creatures, or for other applications.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by NailmasterSpiffy.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Ruibrium", "A vial with churning red liquid inside it.\nDrinking this grants mage's a boost in their\nfocus; all will feel ectasy and joyful\nsensations, only to cause heavy addiction.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Liquid Essence", "A bottle of churning, magical fluid. It has\nvarious uses, be it for sustaining magical\ncreatures, or for other applications.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cactus Black", "An intense hallucenogenic strain of cactus\ngreen created by Vecirok, noted by its black\ncolor. Once smoked, the world would begin to\nspin and bend, with colors growing intense\nand vibrant. Even the most experience of\nsmokers would find this experience\nbreathtaking.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Urn", "A handcrafted clay urn, cracked and broken\nfrom it's time within the burned village.\nFaded inscriptions within the urn seem to\ntell a story of life and death for the people\nof the world, yet too light to truely make\nout. Within the url lay ashes of some unknown\nlife, perished in an age lost\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Baron_Korbinian.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("!! Wrath's Rebuke !!", "The large femur bone of a Wyvern\nhas been unnaturally fused with\ndual-lines of Megalodon teeth.\nThe bone connecting to the main surface\nand the bottom of each tooth having\nbeen melted in some darkened\njoining of bone and marrow. The\nhilt being made of an ebony coloured\niron, which the lowest point holds\na heavily made ring with\na thick dagger-like point jutting off of it.\nThe sentient weapon would have the ability to\npollute and corrupt the very mind of\nthe wielder over time.\n[Consult with Luv for further interaction.]\n*Moderator Approved*\nDiscoLiquid approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Water]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, clean water comes out of it. It appears\nit doesn’t have an end, where does it come\nfrom?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:water_bucket", ""),
