        StaticItem("Blue Mana Blade", "A 3'8 saber of blue, Arcanic substance,\ngiving off a light blue glow from its\nsillouet, which would be projected from an\nOrnate, golden hilt, within its center a\nlarge, glowing saphire would be embedded.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir_.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Arcanic Truncheon", "Arcane I\nA truncheon, roughly a foot in size. The item\nis crafted with wood and metal; residing\ninside is arcane power, allowing sparks and\nweak arcs to generate around it, able to\nbriefly stun an opponent. ((1-2 emotes to\nactivate. Contact Niv_Mizzet for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Calabreeni Cleaning Mops TM.", "", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Calabreeni Cleaning Brooms TM.", "", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Rapier", "A slim bladed rapier, made from pure\ncarbarum. Obviously crafted from an amazing\nsmith, this weapon is both beautiful and\ndeadly. It is made a little shorter than most\nrapiers, almost as if made for a child. Black\nleather wraps around the hilt to offer a\nbetter grip. A carbarum handguard wraps\naround the hilt as well, to offer protection\nto the weapons user.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Wedding Ring", "A ring with a flawless emerald on a iron\nband.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Mysterious Device", "A smooth, but thick sheet of metal sized one\nmeter x two meters, its composition is not of\nthis earth. When listening closely, one would\nslightly make out a faint humming, of which\ncorrelates with the pulsing purple symbols\nupon it. A singular indent is pressed into\nthe middle. ((PM BathRugMan to interact.))\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:daylight_detector", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Rum]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, rum comes out of it. It appears it\ndoesn’t have an end, where does it come from?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Wine]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, wine comes out of it. It appears it\ndoesn’t have an end, where does it come from?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Binding Ropes", "Finely crafted rope with grains of mage-gold\nwithin them, plant them around the object and\nthey'll tie them up with a firm knot!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Taser", "A piece of metal attached to a precious gem!\nWhen activated, it gives off a buzzing\nsound...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FlyingHalfMast.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Brownie", "Rectangular of soft chocolate,\nmelting on top of your tongue.\nFood: 2\nSaturation: 1.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Gizzard", "The hanging giblets from a Cockatrice's jaw,\npacked with a thick, petrifying grey sludge.\nContact with large quantities of oxygen in\nthe air caused the fluid to turn a thin\nvapour, turning whatever it contacted to\ncrumbling stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("Salvaged Cockatrice Hide", "A thick hide, that of a Cockatrice. Laden\nwith scale-like patches of hardened\nfeathering, though it didn't quite provide\noptimal defense given its weighty thickness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Serpent Scales", "This glowing piece once belonged to a beast\nwhich roamed under sheer layers of particles\nfrom the desserts of Axios, pale and covered\nin a sheen layer what granted it an alluring\nappearance. Mighty, now slain for this is the\nonly evidence remaning to let all of those\nsee the horrendous creature removed of a\nrealm by; Hredwyn of Brionne and Avenel of\nAshford.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Talon", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Venomous Stinger", "A large stinger, that of a Manticore. Packed\nwith a thin venomous fluid incurring nigh\nimmediate paralysis on those it enters the\nbloodstream of.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:netherrack", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Hide", "The tough, ridiculously repurposable hide of\na Manticore. Particularly resilient to\nslashing and piercing.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Talons", "Long curved talons, razor sharp to the touch.\nThey lay the length of a grown mans forearm\nand nearly twice as thick, a good trouphy or\nmake shift weapon even in the hands of the\nright people.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Bones", "A small collections of skeletal remains,\nthick and strong. They belong to that of a\nManticore.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Sorcerer's Mask", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Boar Skull", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Rock Crab Chitlins", "The remains of the giant Rock Crab that\ninfested the River Salv.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shady_Tales.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Urn", "A dented and cracked bronze urn, blackened\nfrom fire and smoke. Within the urn sits a\nhazel-coloured cloudy substance, smelling of\nrotten eggs.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Baron_Korbinian.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Cup", "A golden trophy cup with a plaque at the\nbase. \"1st Place Winner of The Jousting\nCompetition. Horse Olympics, 1581.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ShadowedOblivion.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Snake Fang", "A jagged fang rid of a giant serpent from the\nsandlands, pry directly from the maw in rough\nforce.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade effigy", "This jade statuette depicts a grotesque\nman with webbend hands and feet. It\nappears to be clawing at a shell that\nsits on its head. Anyone who touches it\nhears a cacophony of whispers all\nrattling on in different languages in a\nmanner that is incomprehensible to anyone\nsane.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ImCookiie.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Arcane Drone", "Arcane I\nA roughly spherical shell of black steel\ncontaining dense crimson arcane energy. The\nconstruct is roughly one foot in diameter,\nand may float or defend depending on whether\nit's active or not. There is an opening on\nthe front aesthetically acting as the being's\neye'. It hums with near-silent power as if\nmerely observing you. [PM Gladuos to\ninteract]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Star compass", "The dark metal framed compass rests snugly in\nyour hand. The insides, whilst lackingany\nmarkings, shows something of a constellation.\nTapping the top of it issues an image to\ndisplay above the glass showing the black\nheavens and its starry glory.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Harrrison.", "minecraft:compass", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Cloth", "A lovely piece of crimson, glistening in the\nsunlight by its given material\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of _Sug", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Manticore Claws", "A bundle of Manticore claws from a singular\npaw, all about three inches in length, ending\nin horrifically jagged points capable of\nrending most commonplace material.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:iron_bars", ""),
        StaticItem("Gladiatorial Trident", "This is a well-crafted steel trident. It is\nstudded with black bronze, and banded with\ncopper. The object’s shaft is composed of\ndesert jukewood, and it is decorated with\nvulture feathers.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Mental Ward", "Arcane I\nA powerful mental ward is imbued on this\namulet. It prevents the entrance of a master\nmental magi for a total of five times, before\nrequiring an hour's rest. ((Contact\nNiv_Mizzet for more information))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Aequor Daevah", "This is a 750mL dragonglass bottle containing\nmasterfully-crafted wine. It is 14% alcohol\nby volume and produced from aeroda grapes. It\nhas been aged fourty years, and small amounts\nof lemon juice and citrate extract have been\nadded. It smells of alcohol and sweetness. It\ntastes smoothly sweet, with hints of\nbitterness, and a weak alcohol aftertaste.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Holy Staff", "A short staff with unreadable runes running\nup along the hilt. Placed on the top is a\ndull golden spike.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Bracelet", "Interlocking loops of golden material,\nmanifesting a lovely bracelet for ones wrist!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Fatherland", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Statue of Lorelle", "Arcane I\nA lovely statue of a lovely woman, clothed in\ntrousers and a tunic with a sword at her hip.\nWhat a looker\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lorelle.", "minecraft:end_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Arcane Shield", "A scroll with various runes on its parchment.\nWhen the word \"Y'drel\" is uttered, the\nparchment gleams and manifests arcane energy.\nThe energy swiftly spreads out, interlocking\nto form an arcane shield the size of a viking\nroundshield. This can take strikes from\nbladed weaponry, yet a few strikes with a\nmace will shatter and burst the shield into\nforce and second-lasting shrapnul. When the\nspell is finished, the scroll expires. ((2-3\nemotes for shield. Contact Niv_Mizzet for\nmore info))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Arcane Bolt", "A scroll with various runes on its parchment.\nWhen the word \"Viscero\" is uttered, the\nparchment gleams and manifests arcane energy\n- discharging a small arcane bolt at high\nspeeds; when it hits, it impacts with the\nforce of a crossbow bolt, only to burst after\nin concentrated kinetic energy. Once the\nspell finishes, the scroll will burn up.\n((1-2 emotes for the small arcane bolt.\nContact Niv_Mizzet for more information.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Tasty Cheesecake", "A tasty cheese cake. So tasty\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Youngie5500.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Blood-Seeking Blade", "A Blade imbued with a rune, upon activation\nof the rune it can drain blood from drawn\nwounds to empower itself. Outside of that, it\nis a normal sword.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Water of Hydrochloric Acid", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by BathRugMan.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Growth Formulae", "Pink and purple liquid, this viscous\nsubstance enhances the growth of any plant\nexposed to it by a magnitude of 50.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BathRugMan.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Silverfish Potion", "Inside the red liquid of this bottle\nyou can see some floating orbs,\nand some moving parts.\nDon't break or Silverfish get loose.", "minecraft:splash_potion", ""),
