        StaticItem("Tome of the Alchemist", "Brimming with raw knowledge.", "minecraft:enchanted_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Hand Mirror", "A small handheld mirror used to see your\nreflection on the go or anywhere a\nwall-mounted mirror might not be. Due to the\nprocess of making such an item, mirrors are\nrather expensive and usually do not end up in\nthe hands of common-folk unless stolen.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hobbes & Schmick Boutique.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Saint's Grace", "Feeling envisioned by a saint only happens\nto holy men. Or does it? Drink this potion\nand feel the raise of your heartbeat, and see\njust as if you were high... up with god.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Light Blue Dye", "Damn, this shit is fucking good. *Snort*.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Artemis.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonscaled Leggings", "Powerful lightweight leather armor that\nhas been padded with Ancient Dragon Scales\nwhich seem to give the user an advantage in\nbow play while giving great speeds.\n+29% Archery Damage", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Training Sword", "A blunted Type XV Arming Sword, it's edges\ndull and harmless.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Gauntlet of Kir'Gorgar", "This gauntlet was ripped from the metal body\nof a dreadknight. Inside of the gauntlet lies\ndried blood runes, unreadable to anyone not a\nnecromancer. Anyone who would wear the\ngauntlet would hear voices to murder friends\nand family.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kir'Gorgar, Servant of Unlife.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Johnny John's Special 9,6pH Soaps", "A high quality soap designed by Johnny John\nspecifically for members of the CCC. The\nconsistence and its great 9,6pH makes any\nother soap made simply of animal fat feel\njealous. The letters \"CCC\" are branded on the\nsoap. May you never drop the soap!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Johnny John.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate wood carving", "A wood carving of a woman doing a polite\ncurtsey, one hand behind her back. The\ndepiction of the clothes would be\ndistinctive.", "minecraft:log2", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfling's Wings", "A brew famous among halfling thiefs; it grants the\nuser better perception and flexibility but it causes\nthe user to be less effective in combat.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Barry's Pan", "A special frying pan gleaming with magical\nenergy made special for Barry, the simple pan\nwould cook any food put into it without need\nof a fire.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.\nWhen in main hand:\n-3 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+27% Attack Damage\n+4 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Hansetian Wayfinder", "A semi clear gem seemingly humming with\nmagical energy enchanted by the Wizards John\nand Coltaine Wick, when tapped thrice the gem\nwould flood the immediate area with a bright\nlight, to guide the user in times of\ndarkness.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HurferDurfer.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Makeup Dish", "A thin disc obtaining of a powdered\nsubstance, used to apply to ones cheek to\nrefine their contours! A lovely little object\nto hold upon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tao.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
