        StaticItem("Blessed Roses", "Floral graced by GOD, distributed on 5th of\nThe Grand Harvest, 1608; The day Callixtus\nthe I and Najila Shadid joined in wedlock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Church of the True Faith of Old Believers.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Moonlight", "This dagger is beautifully decorated. It's\npommel is a small golden sun, with golden\nrays going all over the black ferrum hilt,\nslowly fading. The crossguard is set with\nsmall diamonds, representing stars, while a\nbigger one in the middle of the crossguard\nrepresents the moon. The blade itself is made\nfrom sharpened silver, shining marvelously,\nand has Rakim engraved in it, along with an\noak tree, closer to the hilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Rakim.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Long Tooth", "A dwarven forged dagger, with a sharp edge.\nFrerir Irongrinder is written on the handle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Khro Nazka", "A double sided dwarvish axe made by the\nfinest of smiths and gleams with golden\nsymbols. Only Valia Ireheart and her kin may\nwield this weapon to its true power. When the\nrunes are activated by the user it will emit\nraw lightning out at foes. The runes along\nits handle protect the user from such\nelemental wraith.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Harolds' Bread of Welcoming", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Haroldoni.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of Clugor", "The eye of a massive cyclops named Clugor. It\nwas defeated on the isle of Asul on the 14th\nof the Grand Harvest, 1572.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Clugor the Cyclops.", "minecraft:ender_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Varekan", "The metal sphere is rather cool to the touch\nbut warms upon activation. The curving shapes\nof the runes across the surface light up at\nthe touch of the user and emit a bright\nwhite-blue light from across the entire\nsurface of the sphere. As it is with all\nrunes, the runes would cease to work without\na timely renewal and would stop working all\ntogether after several uses.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:sea_lantern", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Stave", "An archaic wooden stave carved from the\ncorpse of a long since deceased ent. The\nstave itself appears oak in colour and make,\nat it's head sits a small faded crystaline\nshard. The lime coloured shard emits faint\ndruidic magics, causing small flora to grow\naround you at random\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Luka_Shashavani.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Training Sword", "A standard wooden training sword made for a\nDwarf. The sword would mimic other swords\nused in the Legion, though would be\nnoticiably thicker and heavier than its metal\ncounterparts.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Oak Staff", "A staff about six food in length that bares\nno blemish. The edges at the ends are rounded\nto help prevent damage to them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DarkSoundwave.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
