        StaticItem("Arzhovy", "TECHnically a fish\n0.0lbs, 8\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Gleaming Ruby Amulet", "A fine polished ruby encased in a golen\nlocket adorns a thick golden chain of high\nquality, it looks like a brilliant smith and\nmason worked in tandem to create the piece.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Time Travel Pendant", "A pendant, inscribed with ancient dwarven\nruins, that seems to take the person holding\nit back in time. There is a dial on the\npendant, but it seems to be stuck on \"4th of\nthe Ambercold, 181\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Time Rune.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
