        StaticItem("Stupid Block", "This is meant to hit people that are stupid\nin the head with. Please use with caution, as\nif using on a smart person, it may turn them\nstupid.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Iblees.", "minecraft:dirt", ""),
        StaticItem("Knox Charm", "A wooden pendant hanging off of a silver\nnecklace. The pendant itself is painted\norange, and carved into the likeness of a\nlaughing pumpkin. On the back, one word is\ncarved into it, with large, jerky carving:\nKnox\".\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
