        StaticItem("Witch's Grimoire", "", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Flash Fruit", "These yellow fruits with orange streaks emit\na rich sweet smell, luring animals and people\nfrom all around. Growing upon the tallest\ntrees with their vines, they dangle\nenticingly out of reach, usualy found on\nElder Trees or in the tall jungles.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
