        StaticItem("Mahmossi", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Water Blaster", "Arcane I\nThis appears to be some form of crossbow, but\nit has a small tank that can be filled with\nwater at the back. When you use the odd\nlittle contraption, it's water would appear\nto be some magenta color instead of the\nnormal color. When the water makes contact\nwith skin, it stains the skin for a day! Have\nFun! On the tank of water would be the words\nVeris Summer Festival, 1618\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
