        StaticItem("Axe of a Druii", "A rather long axe, used for chopping wood.\nVines are wrapped firmly around the ironwood\nhandle. Swirling designs are seen carved into\nthe axe's sharp blade. One would notice that\nthe name 'Anthron' is carved into a section\nof the handle which is free of vine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The_Shrouded_One.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
