        StaticItem("Set of Kitchen Seasonings", "A wide leather strand with various slots,\nfilled with small glass bottles of various\nherbs and seasonings, such things as salt,\npepper, coriander, sage, saffron, garlic,\ntarragon, parsley, cinnamon, basil, and\nlavender for some reason. The strand would\nseem foldable, with a small button and clasp\nat either end to ensure it may be closed for\ntransport.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
