        StaticItem("Bag of Chocolate Truffles.", "A small bag of small chocolate spheres with a\nslightly hard shell and a softer inside.\nDespite the name, these candies are completly\ndevoid of truffles, yet the sentiment of the\nname is enough to be dispensed by the truffle\nseller.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Trueshot Dart", "A odd little dart! Whenever thrown at a\nnon-living target it would always hit its\nmark! Great way to cheat in a game of darts!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Burn Healing Salve", "Murky green slush that moves slowly\ninside the vial. Upon application, your skin\ntingles cooling slowly.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Salve: Blissfoil Salve", "A salve made from the petals of the Blissfoil\nflower. Smallish quantities were used to\nensure that the numbing side effect was\nsufficient, yet not dangerous. The cream was\na thick consistency, it being mixed with\nhoney and beeswax to create a useable salve.\nIt was essentially used to relieve pain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laurelin.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Kasfer's slime friend", "A lil' baby slime, seemingly happy with it's\nsmall size and it's lot in life.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Kasfer's Bonin' Stick", "A large bone, looking to be off a large\nmammal of some sort, used for whippin' and\nwackin' baddies!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell of Cernunnos", "A seashell used by numerous crabs for their\nhomes, or to protect from the wilds. Now,\nabandoned and left to the will of nature.\nThis unique, mystical item can be held to\none's ear as they would hear the marches of\nthe wilds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin", "Formal invitation to join the Pumpkingdom", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Pipe", "A hickory wood pipe, seemingly 'carved\nflawlessly. However, to druids, the wood has\nbeen awakened. The pipe eminates druidic\nenergy, and while in the hands of a druid,\npassively grows pipeweed within it, growing\nfast enough to grow back fully between\nsmokes. If not held by a druid, it simply\ngrows at pipeweed's normal growing pace.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Archipelego.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Salve: Serpent's Stalk Salve", "A salve made of Serpent's Stalk. The healing\nquality of such a salve was focused around\nthe mending of burns. The stalk's liquid had\nbeen extracted, and combined with some water,\nhoney and beeswax to create a pleasent\nsmelling cream. It would lessen the pain from\nthe burn, as well as aid in healing it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laurelin.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Bush", "A bomb in disguise.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Solid gold coin", "A small shiny gold coin, seemingly years old,\nhowever not at all rusted, One might find a\ngood price for such a coin..or not\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by moosehunter123.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Orange Dye", "A cream made from Mandragora, honey and\nwater. Known for its excellent healing\nproperties, this plant was the most prominant\ningredient to the salve. When used, it would\naid in repairing damaged skin; cuts, burns\netc.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Laurelin.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring", "An emerald ring which shines beautifully when\nlight reflects from it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Soup", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Family Ring", "A band of pure aurum that obtains only the\nmost alluring appearance. At the centre is a\nharpy made of tungsten carbide, crafted\ncarefully with plenty of detail for it is\nheld on by prongs of wire made from the same\nmaterial as the shank. Moonstone and\nmorganite make up the limbs of the being;\nreplacement for the feathery limbs. Hidden in\nsight upon the gallery is the the simple\nsurname ^Tahn'thill^, for all those whom\npossess such a beautiful piece belongs to the\nbloodline.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tahn'thill Family.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Bones", "The bones are very sturdy, and can be used to\nmake efficient weapons!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvernscale", "A highly durable scale of the infamous\nForktail-wyvern /Dûn/. Shimmering espacilly\ncolorfull in moonshine, it breaks the\nlightwaves into almost an anti-rainbow. Maybe\nan expierenced craftsman can create something\ngreat out of it?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Tipped Arrow", "Arrows that have aurum on the tip of the\narrowhead. A rich silver and crimson emits\nfrom the arrows, making them painful to any\ndark or tainted beings who are struck by\nthem.", "minecraft:spectral_arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Charred Scales", "Scales, charred by an energy quite unlike\ntypical fire.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Flint and Steel in a Box", "", "minecraft:flint_and_steel", ""),
        StaticItem("Bronze Harp", "A harp wrought from bronze, buffed and\npolished to a rich golden glow. Its body\nresembles a tortuous cherry bough, finely\ndetailed with little knots and furrows,\nsprouting flowers at the bend of its knee.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Ivory", "Orcish Ivory taken from an Olog's mouth,\nstill bloody and tainted by the Olog's Stink", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Lich Bones", "", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Coltaine's Grimoire", "A dusty, thick leather bound tome brimming\nwith the gathered knowledge of the wizard\nColtaine Wick.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Porcelain Doll", "A male doll, delicately made. Clearly of good\nquality.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos Statue", "The quartz has been carefully chiseled into\nthe form of an imposing male with\nproud antlers, a bow in his hands strung\nwith a strand of silken thread.\nThe squared base he stands upon reads,\nCernunnos the Great Huntsman.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Cerridwen Statue", "The quartz has been carefully chiseled into a statue\nof a beautiful elven woman holding a basket of fresh wheat.\nShe is clad in a flowing dress that pools\naround the base of the statue.\nThe squared-off bottom of the statue bears\nthe inscription, \"Cerridwen, the Mother of the Morn.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Yarn", "a decently sized ball of yarn.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Fire Whiskey", "A very strong alcohol, that carries the faint\nscent of oranges. When someone drinks this\ndark amber liquid they would be hit with the\ntaste of oranges, and a strong burn. Not\noverwhelming by any means, but it is indeed\nquite strong.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Archi's Friendship Bread", "Food: 4\nSaturation: 3.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Sickly Bone", "The bone appears to have a green colouration,\nits structure rather precarious and weak,\nwith a sharp, protruding end at either side.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Egg", "A fine crafted, chicken-egg sized, aurum egg.\nPolished it'd reveal the names of the previor\nowners 'Nicolas Egglington'. Eventhough it'd\nbe handy it'd weight quite a lot!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Seeds", "Seeds that have laid dormant for countless\ncenturies, though they have an odd attribute\nto them. When planted, a herb would sprout\nslowly in its place, with tender care. This\nherb would have intense hallucinogenic\nproperties, far beyond any mundane drug. [PM\nMurlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nature.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Ice Cream", "A rich, decadent chocolate flavored frozen\ndessert. Seems someone spent quite a while\nmaking this!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Candle of Cerridwen’s Light", "This is an exceptionally crafted beeswax\ncandle. When lit, it will burn a green flame\nfor up to one saint’s hour. Blight cannot\nspread into the region the candle shines\nlight upon, though it is not repulsed from\nthis region if already there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Turkey Plushie", "A medium-sized toy crafted with excellent\ncare and attention to detail. It had the\nscent of autumn across its soft surface. The\nperfect toy for any child. Or any adult too\nfor that matter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidsgiving Cornucopia", "The horn-shaped cornucopia was quite light\ndespite the many delights resting within.\nCarefully woven from dried plant fibers, the\ntraditional container was decorated in an\nassortment of autumn leaves with a treated\nleather strap allowing it to be carried. It\nexuded the scent of a druid. Laying within\nwas an ever-refilling variety of delicious\nnuts, fruits, and vegetables to appease even\nthe fattest dwarf in the realm.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Aged Druidic Gravy", "The oddly savory sauce was perfect for\nanything .. at all! Aside from the hint of\nstrange herbs floating across the sauce's\nsurface, the gravy had some peculiar\nproperties. It seemed to enhance the flavour\nof anything it's poured upon. Whether that be\nyour husband's horrible cooking or even an\nolog's armpit!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Insta-Corn!", "Concealed within a small, tied leather pouch\nwere a dozen enhanced corn seeds. When one\nuse of these seeds made contact with raw,\nhealthy soil they would sprout a 2x2 patch of\nmatured corn within a minute. The taste of\nthe juicy fruit was unbelievable.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Butterbeer", "A large mug of premium foaming butterbeer,\nstraight from the druidic breweries! The\ndelectable beverage had the taste of sweet\nand welcoming butterscotch. With only a mild\nalcoholic potency the drink was perfect for\nany occasion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Spice Latte", "You'd best have your yoga pants on when\ntaking a sip from this pumpkin-scented coffee\ndrink! With a hint of cinnamon, nutmeg, and\nclove to add to the milky-pumpkin flavour,\nyou feel the breezes of autumn pass your skin\nat each sip. Metaphorically of course.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Druidic Order.", "minecraft:skull", "")
    )

    private fun _AXIOS_TAHN_9(): List<StaticItem> = listOf(
        StaticItem("Thanium Mask", "", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Nugget", "It looks like it used to be a coin, but the\nelements have worn it down to a warped lump\nof gold. It's still shiny and valuable,\nthough.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Leg", "The leg of a Giant Hawk. It's muscular leg\nseems to be covered in small soft feathers.\nSurprisingly light and gentle to the touch.\nQuite the trophy, good hunt!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Natural Flute", "What once was an elegant and well formed\nflute now remains a modified instrument. With\nthree sealed cracks around the body of the\ntube, the wooden rod now maintains it’s shape\nwith an added twist - it appears grown. From\nthe hands of a skill druid, the instrument\nnow portrays a natural beauty.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Grand Princess Arahaelth Tundrak.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Statue", "Dragon Breath V\nA statue made from a dark metal, chiseled\nmasterfully to bear the likeness of a giant\ndragon perched atop a mountain of gold. The\nbeasts lips draw back to reveal rows of razor\nsharp teeth. Powerful wings spread back, as\nif it were declaring dominance over its\nhoard. Deep blue, expertly cut, carbarum gems\ntake place of its eyes. Glowing a beautiful\nblue when the light hits it just right.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Grandmaster Kaldvark Undir.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("? Tasty Egg ?", "An easter egg found deep underground trapped\ninside the preserved bones of ancestral\ncreatures, and yet, the eggs seem to be\nintact. It probably did no good to these\nterryfing creatures, but it should be fine to\neat for you since it tastes of strawberries,\nnuts and chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Forktail Wyvern Scales", "*Moderator Approved*\nAengoth approved this item.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Eye of The Comet", "*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:end_stone", ""),
        StaticItem("Decorative Eagle Feather", "This tail feather is large and full, it's\nbristles undamaged and healthy. A dozen\nlines of black and blue beaded string are\ntied about the stem, holding a small\nleather cord in place. From this cord\ndangle several silver disc-like charms,\neach carved intricately with mountains.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Beylund] Ruari Hoarfrost of Orvar.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Seed Token", "A glowing token, perhaps it is redeemable?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantUsopp.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Elven Window", "This plain of glass seems to be centuries\nold, yet the design seems to be of an anicent\nwood elven design that seems to fit an unique\nframe\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Hierophant] Earendur.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Tree Sapling", "A healthy pine sapling cut from Father\nKrugmas' very own Krugmas tree. It seems to\nthrive regardless of the conditions around\nit.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Dire Wolf Teeth", "Slightly curved fangs of the more meager\nvariety, these greyed bones still dispaly a\nformidable sharpness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Statuettes of the Aspects", "A pair of two wooden statuettes, standing\nupon a small wooden pillar. The male\nstatuette has antlers coming out of his head\nand a bow in his hand. The female statuette\nholds a small carved flower statuette in her\nhands, while a green cloth is tied around\nher. At the bottem of the pillar, there are\nwords: 'May this remind you of the union of\nDruii and Shaman.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Tragedy Stack", "A stack of cards with tragedies painted\nacross them, if staring too long at them they\ncome to life - But only for the user.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Spirit Magnolis", "The plant is long with short leaves. A bit\nrough when you pass a finger through it, and\nvery hard to crush and tear. Replanting it in\nanother place is impossible.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Seedling of Veist", "A small seedling, seemingly nothing special\nabout it. ((PM HedgeHug for details))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Spider's Silk", "This is a smooth, unbelievably fine\nmaterial of clothlike silks.\n*Moderator Approved*\ndagothagahnim approved this item.", "minecraft:web", ""),
        StaticItem("Misfortune Token", "A token bearing the face of\nthe Misfortune Teller, giving\nyou a thumbs up!\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Severed Harpy Head", "+10% chance to dismember\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TheWildHunt.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("DRUID MAGICS", "Zwoom! Zap! Pow pow! Kachooomfp!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:vine", ""),
        StaticItem("Tahn Hound Pelt", "The pelt is quite well cut off and kept\nfresh.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Toren.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Rose Bush", "This is a small, yet pretty rose bush with\nmulticolored petals. They would be primarily\nred with swirls of white.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Komodo Skull", "The head of a Komodo Dragon\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hoster102.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Experiment #03", "A bouncing baby b-.. Slime? This little glob\nof oozing joy had a pink to purple tint.\nSwirling within its core were beaming\nenergies of lifeforce. No matter the damage\nthis completely passive thing took, it would\nreform itself only to bound with ignorant\nglee once more. Though, some things it can’t\nbe brought back from. You probably wouldn’t\nwant to eat it either, as stomach acids mixed\nwith this experimental blob would cause a\n(literally) bloody explosion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Petrus Sapling", "This little sapling was quite the\ntroublemaker! Once innocently planted, it\nwould begin to slowly expand its roots\noutwards over the course of days, seeking to\nsprout more of itself even through light\nrock! To druids, it would whisper of Atheran\ntales.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Wolf.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Tranquil Feather", "A feather of pure white, plucked from the\nskies above. It was soothing to touch,\nperhaps even to an addicting level. When held\nclose, the user would feel at utter peace;\ntheir mind at ease. When bound to a specific\nitem, it will provide immunity against mild\ntaints and diseases. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nature.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Isis, Staff of the Forgotten Follower", "A perfected replica of the original living\nstaff, also possessing living traits of its\nown. It was a long wooden staff that has a\nvine wrapped around it. At the top of it is\nan aurum gilded blade, making the staff not\njust a druidic symbol, but a dangerous\npolearm. It has various runes and carvings\nrunning up it, and upon the blade there is an\netching of a bat.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Oropher.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blue Aspect Stone", "The stone emits a powerful aura of druidic\nenergy, capable of preventing corruption from\nbreaching it's vicinity. When in close\nproximity with the other stones, all druidic\nenergy surrounding them becomes multiplied\nexponentially.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:diamond_block", ""),
        StaticItem("The Silver Aspect Stone", "The stone emits a powerful aura of druidic\nenergy, capable of preventing corruption from\nbreaching it's vicinity. When in close\nproximity with the other stones, all druidic\nenergy surrounding them becomes multiplied\nexponentially.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:iron_block", ""),
        StaticItem("The Black Aspect Stone", "The stone emits a powerful aura of druidic\nenergy, capable of preventing corruption from\nbreaching it's vicinity. When in close\nproximity with the other stones, all druidic\nenergy surrounding them becomes multiplied\nexponentially.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Druidic Herb", "The strange herb seems to have untold druidic\nproperties perhaps a herbologist or a\nknowledgeable druid could uncover more?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SeventhCircle.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Potted Rose Plant", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Penguin Plushie", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Willow Soul Tree Seedling", "A powerful seedling embedded within a pendant\nand attached to a string necklace. The\nseedling itself gives off a calming aura.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elswyen.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Coconut Cup", "Arcane I\nCoconuts made into rounded cups. Suitable for\ndrinking, as accessories, or even just a\ncollectible. However, when the cup is\ncomplimented and feeling appreciative, it\nwill fill a serving portion of\nmildly-alcoholic, sweet coconut water.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Ring", "Arcane I\nThe ring is carved from a very familiar yew\ntree wood, into the shape of a bull skull.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toren.", "minecraft:wooden_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Feather", "The large feather belonging to a Giant Hawk.\nThese quills once served as a tool to soare\nthe skies. It's underside is soft like a\npillow but its edges are brutally sharp.\nCareful!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect’s Token", "This is an exceptionally crafted fired-clay\ntoken. On the item is an image of Cerridwen,\nas an immaculate doe. Cerridwen is sleeping.\nWhen pressed into the forehead of a spriggan\nor ent, this item evaporates into a puff of\nsmoke. For the next saint’s day, the spriggan\nor ent cannot attack the person who pressed\nthe token into their head, unless they are\nbodily harmed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Tranquility", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Fox", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ever.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugar", "OH, HONEY HONEY", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Areln's Potato", "Whispers of the tater beckon\nto be devoured.\nTaters of empathy and compassion.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Healing Salve", "A powerful healing salve concocted by the\nPine Druid Gi'Garun.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gigarun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("The Dedicant Whacker", "This whacking stick was made with dedicants\nin mind--the head of the cudgel has the face\nof a very upset person on it. A dedicant?", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Artilleryman Shears", "", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Artilleryman Helmet", "", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Elven Crystal", "A green, fist-sized crystal. It emits a dull\nglow as you hold it, becoming brighter as you\ngo nearer to the heart of the Ancient City.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Misery Ring", "Upon wearing the beautiful piece the user\nwould begin to feel miserable after a point\nto where it was unbearable.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Yew Soul Tree Sapling", "Attuned Druids would sense very powerful\nnatural energies eminating from the sapling\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Pine Tree Sapling", "This would seem like a normal pine tree\nsapling. Attuned Druids would sense rather\npowerful natural energies eminating from it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Lefkos's Armpit Hair", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Portable Shrine", "A decorative box filled with all things\nneeded to make miniature shrines on the go!\nIt includes everything one might need to make\na pray space dedicated to either the Aspects\nor the Spirits Freygoth and Arwa. Includes\nincense, statuettes, small offerings, and\nmore.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ashton.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Waters", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. It was almost liquified\nin its frozen state, dripping endlessly with\ncleansing waters. [PM Murlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
