        StaticItem("Shard of Life", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. Glistening moss and\nleaves coiled around its form indicates it\nwas once with nature. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Corruption", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange, though felt similar to a cold metal\nsurface. It leaked with dark whispers,\ncorrupted by a dark taint that did not spread\nnor harm. [PM Murlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of the Ancients", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. Scratches, dents and a\nmisshapen form indicates it has been through\ntime. [PM Murlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Knowledge", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. It was alive with\nwhispers; seeping with raw knowledge. [PM\nMurlocs to interact].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Shard of Power", "Shimmering with ethereal power. It was quite\nstrange to touch, though felt similar to a\ncold metal surface. It seemed quite heavy,\nsurging with contained power. [PM Murlocs to\ninteract].\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Well.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Boomsteel Powder", "The mysterious black powder offered a sharp\nscent of something explosive. This form would\nmake good for long-lasting tinder or as a\ncatalyst; though it seemingly was unable to\nexplode.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Homemade Dulce de Calabaza", "These delicious treats are made by first\ncutting, peeling, and deseeding a pumpkin\nbefore chopping it up into small pieces to\nboil. Brown sugar is then stirred in to water\nwith a mix of cinnamon, poured over the\npumpkin pieces, then boiled again. For at\nleast a quarter of a day after that the\ncovered pieces soak up the syrup. They are\nthen boiled one final time before being\nallowed to dry out for at least half a day.\nTo finish it off, they are sprinkled with\nsugar!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Beastly Dumbbell", "An enormous dumbbell, awarded to the one who\ntriumphed above all the rest with brute\nstrength. While this dumbbell is not only\neffective at training, it also causes one to\ngain temporary beastly urges and personality\ntraits when using it extensively.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon-Kissed Candle", "A pale wax candle that burned endlessly atop\na small golden candle plate. The flickering\nflame was a soft blue color though didn't\nseem to offer any warmth or heat. It didn't\nburn others and only itself for eternity. If\nyou put your ear to it, whispers would seduce\nyou into mindlessness until you pried\nyourself away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Eve Pumpkin", "A sinister grin was etched across its\nterrifying features, with eyeless sockets\nthat burned into the center of your soul. The\npumpkin never succumbed to rot or disease.\nThough as it was held, you could sometimes\nsee piercing red eyes staring at you out of\nthe corner of your eye.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Bat Plushie", "A large, near-perfect replica plushie of a\nHallow's Eve bat. It was complete with floppy\nwings, wide ears, and large glass eyes that\nhad an eerie amount of realism to their\nfeatures. You swore it moved out of the\ncorner of your own eyes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Rose", "A small black rose that never wilted or\nsuccumbed to disease naturally. The rare\nplant was blessed by the forests. Small wisps\nof pale green mist jumping between each petal\nand leaf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Limited edition ‘Cloud Temple Monk’ action figure", "This very small toy is a part of the current Cloud Temple Monk toy series.\nThere is only a limited number in existence!\n*Moderator Approved*\nFyaa approved this item.", "minecraft:armor_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Black Cat Plushie", "Every feature upon the near-perfect replica\nplushie appeared quite realistic. The bright\nglass eyes highlighted against the darkened\nsoft fur. As you hold it, you heard the\nfaintest 'meow' off in the distance\noccasionally.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Rune Stone", "A smooth, golden rock covered in seemingly\nrandom patterns which are cut into the gold.\nIf one were to toss one of these golden rocks\ninto the air while under attack from a mage,\nthe magic being used has a high chance of\nhitting the rock instead of the original\ntarget. However, the rock is destroyed in the\nprocess.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mister TREEsure-seeks!", "Arcane I\nA small, happy seed. When planted, a\nminiature entling sprouts after a few elven\nminutes. He will bound with joy, yet in\ntree-like silence as he will remain\nstationary and point in the direction of\nwhatever ‘shiny’ he can see. Once his task is\ndone, he will return to the earth as a seed\nonce more.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Flipper", "A pair of flippers created from leather, and\ntreated so they are waterproof. A name would\nbe carved into the bottom of one of the\nflipper, reading \"Shark Druid Za'Kabar\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aeriel Earthmover.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Cecilia's Earrings", "A pair of finely made earrings, crafted from\nflawless emeralds, with aurum around the\noutside.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet, Sweet Potaoes", "These juicy peeled sweet potatoes are first\nbaked, cooled, then mixed into a concoction\nof sifted sugar, margarine, milk, cinnamon,\nalmond extract, and vanilla extract.\nAfterwards, this mixture is kneaded until\nsmooth with added coconut bits, shaped into\nsmall ball-like formations, dusted with\npowdered sugar and finally refigerated in\nyour local thanhium cooling unit!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:beetroot_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Sugared Cranberries", "Perfectly-ripe cranberries that were boiled\nin water with a half cup of sugar, soaked and\ncooled for one elven hour before draining,\nthen rolled in another half cup of sugar on a\nbaking sheet. Afterwards, they are dried for\nfour elven hours. An amazing sugary sweet!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Renn.", "minecraft:nether_wart", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Day Lilies", "A bouquet with colors as warm\nand bright as the summer's\nsun. Typically given to one\nwho could use a bit of cheer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheDarkIsEternal.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Pipe", "the pipe is seemingly grown from ironwood. It\nshines as if someone had just used the best\nmaterials to shine it and to a druid this\npipe feels alive, as if it was originally\nfrom an awoken staff and ingrained in the\nwood is Halfling's Grass, so even if you\nsmoked all of the grass it would still grow\nback over time, but this can be sped up using\ntheir druidic gifts, the one who obtains this\nmay never need another pipe ever again!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Tribal Spear", "A long, sturdy spear. Its point is given by a\nfashioned boar tusk, tied together with\nroots, tree sap, and leather. At its base, a\ncarved message reads, \"Nani's and\nZa'Kabar's.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("YoYo", "This piece of wood consists of a pair of joined discs\nwith a deep groove between them in which a string is attached and wound.\nThe YoYo would be capible of being spun downward and upward alternately.\n*Moderator Approved*\nFyaa approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_button", ""),
        StaticItem("Maiden's Reprieve", "The lute is highly elegant, it curving to fit the figure\nof a woman just right. Its wood is of a dark stain, a\nbeautiful deep and dark mahogany. If strung by those\nskilled of hand, it will produce a sound that strikes\nlonging into the hearts of even the manliest of men.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:fence", ""),
        StaticItem("Rotten Man's Goop", "The smile pile of goop seems to have the same\nconsistancy and workability as playdough. Who\nwould have thought dead folks were so fun?!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:magma_cream", ""),
        StaticItem("Straadoth Hide", "This set of scaley, reptilian skin would be\nextremely dry and rugged, yet appeared\nbeautiful, should it glimmer against\nsunlight. It'd be a dark beige, seeming to\nmimic the color of sand. Should one test it's\ndurability, they'd find that it's amazingly\nresilliant to natural elements.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos' Hunt", "A combination of Cedarwood and Cinnamon\nBrandy, with a few other ingredients produces\nthe well renown Cernunnos’ Hunt. Contained\nwithin a rectangular bottle, with its nozzle\nplugged by a cork, the substance is a\nbronze-esque hue, with a fierce scent to it,\nindicating the sheer strength of the brandy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Distillation Liquid", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Silver Necklace", "", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Cactus", "A mixture of ingredients, similar to Cactus Green.\nThe drug is notoriously dark, barely visible to\nthe naked eye.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Bone Pendant", "What would appear to be a bone and wood\npendant; dangling pieces of both hanging\nfrom a delicately-woven sinew, acting as\na necklace. Engraved onto the back of one\nof the wooden pieces would be a black\nraven emblem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Case of Alcohol", "A large, mostly uninteresting case crafted\nfrom wood. However, the contents are much\nmore interesting. There are multiple\ndifferent bottles of alcohol residing within\nthe case: Ale, Vodka, Wine, Mead and Whiskey.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("The Misfortune Boots of Failure", "The wearer will always\nstumble around, sometimes\neven fall!\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Shark", "An expertly carved shark statuette made out\nof a large diamond. It's a very high quality\npiece of work with an oak stand that goes\nalong with it for display.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ashton.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed Mirror", "A mirror supported by polished wood, for\nthose whom stare into may hallucinate of a\ntime in their past that brought; Misery,\nsorrow, anger, regret, or more.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Seedling of Qiovor", "A seed of Axios that seems to glimmer with a\nfaint aura, a delicate aura present within.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Orb of Xaakt - Ilzgul Udalgum", "A black orb, swirling with crimson\ncontents.On the surface of this fist sized,\nashen glass would be shamanic writing\nengraved upon the weak shell.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Lego_XBOX.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Soil Sample", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.\nSigned by The Dirt Man.", "minecraft:soul_sand", ""),
        StaticItem("State of the Art Whacking Stick", "The whacking sticks seem good for most\nuses! Getting those darn children off\nyour law, even hitting your nephew!\nPerhaps punishing those pesky thieves? Or\neven for use behind locked doors ;).\nEngraved into the grip would be a black\nraven emblem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragment of the Staff", "The bottom half of what appears to be a\nstaff. Thorns circle the'handle' of the\nhalf-staff, making it near impossible to\nhold. It seems to radiate a strong natural\nenergy.\nI wonder what happens when you find the\nother half..?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Aethermoorian Sun Amulet", "A golden amulet that resembles the sigil\nof Aethermoor, the sun.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iLovePumpkins.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Jack-o-Lantern Sparkler", "A sparkler that lights up with a warm orange\nand yellow glow! Said to ward off those evil\nspirits on All Spirit's Eve. A small token of\nthanks for attending the All Spirit's Eve\nevent of Linandria, 1583.", "minecraft:fireworks", ""),
        StaticItem("Drauch's Rib Bone", "A humanoid rib bone, torn off from the\nribcage.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by tentacle_addict.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Sword", "An ancient sword used by one of the many\nnative tribes of Vailor. While the blade\nisextremely worn-out, it still can due a lot\nof damage. A thick layer of rust coats the\nhandle, leaving you to believe that it wasn't\ntaken care of very-well.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("T Resathri T", "A blowgun forged from tempered ironwood. It\nfeatures a number of druidic inscriptions\nalong its ornate, smoothened surface. Parts\nof it was wrapped in the hide of a great boa\nfor easier grip, with the hollow insides\nlined with slick bamboo rolls. Druidic\nenergies surged through the weapon as faint\nwhispers could be heard when listening\nclosely. Strung on the end of such a\nbeautiful craft was the feather of a\ncockatrice; a grand trophy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cernunnos, The Great Huntsman.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Pine Soul Tree Sapling", "This would seem like a normal pine tree\nsapling to most. Attuned Druids would sense\nrather powerful natural energies eminating\nfrom it, although unable to be identified\nreally.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Anchor Pendant", "An elegant, solid gold pendant shaped into a\nmina sized anchor. Its chain is linked\nsilver. The back of the pendant is engraved:\nSutica 1591.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Potent Strychnine Poison", "A vial of lethal poison created from\ndruidic-enhanced strychnine seeds. Even\ninhaling the rather putrid aroma can cause a\nfew issues. If ingested, it will cause\nconvulsions, paralysis, and intense\nasphyxiation.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Fishing Rod", "A light, small fishing rod toy made perfect\nfor young children. It could potentially\ncatch a small fish!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Music Box", "A box of melodies for which obtains a\nspinning youth with outstretched arms,\npainted delicately to bring out each detail.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:log", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe of the Last Ice.", "This axe was weilded by hefty workers.\nUsed for lumber durning the old times. A\ncold touch fills your palms. As your\ngraps fits around the axe. The blade\nfreshly sharpened.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:diamond_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Cecilia's Pipe", "A long smoking pipe, carved from spruce wood.\nSmall carvings of woodland animals line the\nlength of the pipe. Upon examining a certain\npart of the pipe, one would notice the word\nCecilia' carved into the wood.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stinging Blade", "A crudely made dagger with an odd hue to it.\nIf this dagger were to cut a mortal, it would cause\na strong burning sensation, making it difficult to focus until\nthe effects have completely worn off.\n*Moderator Approved*\nImCookiie approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Medallion", "A pumpkin shaped, inexpesive piece of gold.\nAwarded to those who complete the Witch's Maze.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMorsmordre approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Shark's Bite", "A wooden long sword, primarily crafted from\nThornbark. Extremely sharp points poke out\nfrom the wood of the sword, though there\nappears to be an abundance of these sharp\npoints at the blade. A long strip of leather\nhas been wrapped around the handle to protect\nthe user from the wood's sharp points. Blue\nswirls appear to have been painted all along\nthe wood. The words 'Shark Druii' has been\ncarved into the guard of the sword. If one\nwere attuned to nature, they would sense the\nsword is alive...\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Gusmarzku.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Flesh Cleaver", "The rusted, bloodstained cleaver appeared to air this stench of putrid smell.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDohvi approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fr3sH 0aTs", "A handful of a lovely druidic meme.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Fishing Rod", "With a handle comprised of cork for a\nfirm grip, this rod looks to be made of a\npale red mahogany, it's length about\nsixteen feet. Several blue painted bands\ncircle the shaft, crawling upwards every\nfew inches, holding a metal loop. A\nsingle eagle feather hangs from the base.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The_Shrouded_One.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Ker'Wolf Pelt", "A massive black pelt, cut from the body of a\nKer'Wolf. One would notice that there appears\nto be rather large cuts in certain areas of\nthe pelt. Dried blood can be seen around\nthese cuts.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wool-Padded Winter Hat", "A well insulated, festive hat. The Object\nwould be padded with a thick, yet rather soft\nlayer of snow white wool.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir_.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Expertly-Crafted Mechanical Fishing Rod", "The rather normal-looking fishing rod was\nanything but. Reinforced ferrum laced the\nshaft; with the fishing line hooked up to\nthe cog-like reel. The rod still required\nlabour behind it, but it seemed much\neasier to handle overall. Engraved into\nthe side would be, 'Renn'.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Cosmic's Pokeball!", "You have been caught by CosmicWhaleShark!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect Pendants", "An Aspect Pendant, moulded by a common\ncraftsmen and from the rich mineral, bronze.\nIntricately designed, it is a bronze necklace\nwhich links together a set of Stag’s horns,\nand at their ends, sits a rigid pomegranate\ndesign.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen__.", "minecraft:fire_charge", ""),
        StaticItem("Specter's Blade", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Glob of Wax", "A rather large glob of tannish-yellow wax,\nthat seems to glow dully. Aside from it's\nglowing, it has no deviant properties from\nstandard wax. whether for use in a candle,\nseal, or as a glue.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Sand!", "Magical sand, awarded to one who is best at\nsand. This sand would sand like no other sand\nas it stands sandly. It acts similar to\nputty, and makes for an excellent children's\ntoy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:sand", ""),
        StaticItem("Cernunnos' Resolve", "A pendant made of vivid green emerald and\nshaped into the likeness of a stag, complete\nwith protruding antlers that curve\nmajestically above it. The jewel hangs from a\nsimple cord to be worn around the neck or\nwrist. Should one clasp the pendant tight, a\na faint sense of warmth floods them\ntemporarily.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wytchlings.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Etched Pottery Vase", "Crafted by the expert hands of a warhawke,\nthis terracotta vase is slim on it's neck and\nthick on the bottom. Intricately designed by\nthe artists' fingers, the design used mimics\nthat of a bird's feather pattern, repeating\nall through out.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Oaken Cutting", "A barky shaving taken from the bulk of a\ngreat tree. The cutting remains constituent\nwith but a miniscule drop of potential left\nwithin it, as though it were waiting to be\nnurtured and grown. [PM Gladuos for details]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gladuos.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("Great Beast Hide", "The hide of a great beast once slain by\nHevera. It is thick and tough, but rather\nheavy. Whatever it was she slew, it seems to\nhave scales of some sort...\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Ink Set", "A wooden box carved and painted in colors\nwhich have worn away with time. Inside the\nbox is a set of corked glass flasks, each of\nwhich contains a different colored ink.\nNearly every color of the rainbow is laid\nwithin the velvet lined box. There looks to\nbe a space for a feather quill within as\nwell, but it seems to be missing.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Pandann.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Magma's Molten Joy", "A crude Dwarven rum, amber in color. As you\ndrink it, a warm burning sensation fills your\nthroat followed by a sweet cooling effect.\nMany herbs and spices were added to this aged\nrum.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ardor.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toy Galleon", "The large toy ship would be quite hefty\nto carry. The ship flew blue flags atop\nits mast; with figurines littering the\ndeck. It seemed to float quite well,\ndespite being a collector's item or\nchild's toy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:birch_boat", ""),
        StaticItem("Thornweed Dart", "A set of darts crafted from modified\nthornweed. Each thorn is tightly woven in\ndurable behemoth spider silk. This allows\nthese darts to be able to absorb liquids, and\nhave a cushioned tail while also retaining a\nsleek design.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Heart Pipe", "An elegant pipe made from living purple heart\nand cactus. Within the wood was flecks of\ngold giving it a glowing appearance despite\nit never having a light.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Archdruid Whacking Bone™", "A large bone, carved specifically to beat\nirresponsible Druids and Dedicants. It would\nhurt.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lifebinder's Circlet", "A flowery circlet that could fit fashionably\nupon any head. To one not affiliated with\ndruidism, they would faintly hear whispers\nfrom above. To one attuned however, they\nwould feel their herblore gifts amplify by an\nadditional two tiers.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Cerridwen.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Black Craft Venom", "A vial of faintly-coloured venom. Derived\nfrom the black craft worm, the thin ooze\noffers little to no aroma; and the taste is\nbeyond horrid. When ingested, the venom\nprogressively paralyzes its victim. Through\nsluggish, painful aches the victim eventually\nbecomes completely incapacitated. The effects\nlast upwards of an hour.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pickle", "holy fuck it's a pickle!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:speckled_melon", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Claw of the Lion", "The ancient claw of the lost lion druid. It\nhas some ware to it, with blood and scratch\nmarks lining its fur. It acted similar to\nthat of a glove, with sharp long claws\nprotruding from the fingers. When one attuned\nto nature equipped the relic, they would feel\ntheir communion enhanced by one additional\ntier.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Lost Lion.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of the Summer Festival", "A token of the Summer Festival, for the\nscavenger hunt. Maybe you can redeem these!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Diluted Nightglow Poison", "A weakened variant of poison created from the\nnightglow flower. The lightly-coloured liquid\nwould offer faint illumination as well as a\nsweet scent when opened. However, if the\nnightglow poison was ingested it would\nrapidly increase heart rate, cause intense\nnausea, and induce temporary cardiac arrest;\nor severe heart palpitations.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ituri's Head", "The head of a Frost Witch unlucky enough to\nincur the wrath of the Aspects. Having slain\na man in the Mother Grove and left his\ndecapitated head behind, Brother Leatherback\nand Veidan Torena slew the woman in cold\nblood.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Veist.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Magic Seeds", "Something's not quite right about these\nseeds...\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:pumpkin_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Harolds' Pity Bread", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Haroldoni.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("Bamboo Wind Chimes", "A well-crafted set of bamboo wind chimes. It\nis made of bamboo stalks for the chimes,\nbirch wood for the disc and knocker, and held\ntogether by strong, long-lasting hemp thread.\nWhen caught in the wind, it produces a melody\nof hollow knocks that can be both calming and\neerie to hear. It seems that great care was\ntaken in this set's craft, producing an\nalmost perfect melody in the wind.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Roxforbraynz.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Shogging Shovel", "A masterfully crafted shovel, utilised for\nshogging by only a true master!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by OwOwotstis.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Aurum Retribution", "Forged against the heat of molten liquid,\nthis aurum blade pertains an elongated\nensignia against its hilt, and an array of\ncarvings coursing along its metallic frame.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Linseed Oil", "A small, squarish bottle, filled with a\nbright orange transparent liquid. A single\nlabel on the front reads ⓁⒾⓃⓈⒺⒺⒹ ⓄⒾⓁ. The\nflax-sourced oil inside bears a somewhat\nhearty taste, though it is surprisingly\nflammable. It seems well suitable for\nanyone's oil based needs, whether cooking,\noiling, or setting things aflame.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Cobblestone", "Just cobblestone - nothing special . . . . or\nis it?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Exasperated Revenant.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Wyvern's Maw", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Staff of Goldrim", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
