        StaticItem("Descent's Wile", "A four foot tall branch of a staff covered in\nnumerous vines and blue to white flowers. Its\nshaft is composed of elderwood, making it\nhighly durable and immune to non-magical\nflame. The flowers provide immeasurable\nhealing properties, being blissfoil and\nPhoenix' Teardrops respectively. If able to\ndiscover such, the staff's core is made\nentirely from the bioluminescent Starlit\nMonacrie wood, as bright as a torch. Waves of\nlife pulse out of the awakened implement. [PM\nGladuos for details]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
