        StaticItem("Mystic Pearl", "A finely crafted statue, carved out of a fine\npure pearl of the Haensetic Sea. It form\nresembles much that of the common picture of\nthe Aspects, standing along side another.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BlauSchlumpf.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Crown", "Crown of the Dominion, Inheritor of Malinor.\nThis silver crown adorned with emerald\nleaflets seems to have been the touch of a\nfeminine hand. Emblazon on both its sides are\nthe words 'Ame nae evareh", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Evar Hileia", "A Spatha measuring about 39 inches long would\nbe held in your hands. The blade would have a\nbronze hue to it, being made of a rare metal\nmixture known as Elberu'cinhir bronze. The\nhilt and the guard would be made of a dark\nironwood, varnished to fit comfortably in the\nusers hand. Along the blade a floral pattern\nof vines would snake to the tip, the weapon\ncoming with a dark leather sheathe as well.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by sidmmvv.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Vine", "A neatly crafted emerald, shaped to look like\na vine that might hand from a tree.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Poppys", "A lovely gathering of flowers tied by their\nstems, decorated with a piece of elaborate\nparchment to hide the twine.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tao.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Rare Square Melon Seeds", "Upon growing into a lively fruit, the melon\nwould look quite peculiar. The extremely rare\noddity would produce literal SQUARE melons.\nYou really question your state of mind, and\nif you're just hallucinating..\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:melon_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Elasibur", "A sword which burnt through all enemies of\nhis father who was one of the great\nElf's of the time.\n*Moderator Approved*\nMaruthir approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aspect's Token", "This is an exceptionally crafted fired-clay\ntoken. On the item is an image of Cerridwen,\nas an immaculate doe. Cerridwen is sleeping.\nWhen pressed into the forehead of a spriggan\nor ent, this item evaporates into a puff of\nsmoke. For the next saint's day, the spriggan\nor ent cannot attack the person who pressed\nthe token into their head, unless they are\nbodily harmed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Orchids of the Golden Tempest and Storm's Calm", "A pair of entwined orchids, one blue and one\ngreen. Together, they seemed to aid one\nanother in standing tall, stretching towards\nthe sky. The pot holding them would have\ndelicate carvings of intricately curled\ndragons circling it. Despite the abundance of\ncarvings, a single decoration stood out from\nthe rest. A woman wielding a coiled staff\nabove her with a tornado behind was apparent.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("111111 Spoopy Candle 111111", "A tiny wax jack-o-lantern with a gleeful face\nradiates creepily with a cold harsh glare with it\nlit wick. It gives off the scent of rotting pumpkins.\nDo not use as nightlamp. Commerates Laureh'lin's\nGrand Harvest Festival in 1524.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Salvian Wisteria Sapling", "A specially preserved sapling that was bred\nfrom the wisteria trees from Anthos. When\nplanted, the tree takes 4 to 5 years to\nbloom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Medallion of the Sun", "A fist sized hunk of gold that was carved and to a spherical shape, then\nflattened out so it could be worn. Around it are feather outlined hunks of\nmetal evenly spanning the outer edge of the metallic object. On the front is\nbe a face. the expression holding that of a peaceful view. If one was to give\npraise to the sun while wearing this. They may just be answered back.\n[Consult with Cneyele for further interactions]\n*Moderator Approved*\nJames27049 approved this item.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusted Blade", "Gods, these things have been sitting around for ages!\" - A wandering scholar.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:stone_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather of a Cockatrice", "The ornate feathers of a cockatrice. Often\nused for ancient ceremonies, these things are\nnow a rarity amongst certain collectors.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl Earrings", "A pair of pearl earrings that glimmer softly\nwhen struck by sunlight.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Sigil", "A carved crystal in the shape of a dragon.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTheHuskyPuppy approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Forktail Wyvern Fang", "*Moderator Approved*\nAengoth approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Visconti Ceremony Axe", "The axe is engraved with old ilatian\ninscriptions, being of endless worth for\nthe Viscontis.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:golden_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Translucent Orb", "The orb glows brightly, etchings projected from the light that protrudes.\n*Moderator Approved*\nPandann approved this item.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Shears", "These old and worn shears seem to be engraved\nwith a typically Elven pattern, their blades\nmore jagged than the typically sharp, modern\nversion.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Smawton.", "minecraft:shears", ""),
        StaticItem("Ursula's Washbasin", "", "minecraft:hopper", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's scale", "The object would be about the size of an\nadult Orc's palm, cut from a female Wyvern.\nThis scale is quite resistant to a good deal\nof physical damage - taking to a hue of dark\naqua.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of a Star", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iHB_.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Only the best Honey from the Hive(tm)", "Glorious tasting honey!\n*Moderator Approved*\nMittoTheSavage approved this item.", "minecraft:sponge", ""),
        StaticItem("The Imperial Orb", "It is a golden globe decorated with a band of enamel and diamonds. On top of this is a\nhalf-circle of enamel and diamonds. It is topped by a diamond-studded cross.\n*Moderator Approved*\nTauFirewarrior approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Spear", "A rather long spear with a sharp steel tip.\nThe long handle of the spear is made entirely\nfrom ironwood, making it strong and durable.\nVines appear to have been wrapped all along\nthe length of the spear. Upon inspection of a\ncertain area of the handle, one would\ndiscover the word 'Renn' carved into the\nwood.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Fae Dust", "Glittering dust preened from the wings of a\nFaerie.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
        StaticItem("The Forever Snowball", "A perfectly round snowball that never melts\nor loses its form. Whatever magic holds this\ntogether is a true Krugmas mystery.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Harbinger's Whisper", "The small orb glows faintly, and seems cold to the touch.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Valenteh_.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("A pound of Rotted Flesh", "The pile of rotted flesh gave off a rather putrid, cringe-worthy smell.\n*Moderator Approved*\nDohvi approved this item.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Half-Orc's Liver", "The bloodied liver that once inhabited a\nmother Orc's body. It is a grizzly sight to\nbehold, and has an even more off-putting\nsmell.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Scorched Staff of the Melancholy Silence", "A lengthy staff of almost 6', rising above\nthe height of most Mali - or it would have,\nif it were not broken almost entirely in two\nsave for a single redwood wooden strand. The\nbranches that once coiled together to form\nthe strong stem were now dry and lifeless;\nblackened by a flame. The head of once-thick\ncurls was now diminished with only a few\nspikes remaining - scorched also. The\ntrinkets that once chimed in the wind were\nnow chipped and broken; the staff swaying\nwith a harrowing silence.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cytherea.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("A Month of Crow", "This is a copper leaf vial, containing a\nmonth of a life of a crow. It smells and\ntastes of nothing. When consumed, for the\nnext saint's day, causes its drinker to\nbehave as a crow would.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stag Head Medallion", "Hums in the presence of curses, vibrates in the presence of magic.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TheWildHunt.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Stag Skull", "This is a large stag skull. Its horns are\nthree feet in length. It has been\nsun-bleached white.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Venator Talon", "A razor-sharp, curved ivory talon with some\nscratches marring its nearly smooth surface.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Muun'tletl", "A Khopesh-inspired blade forged from a\ndarkened boomsteel alloy. It featured a\nnumber of subtle inscriptions along its\ncurved shape. It sat atop a hilt made from\nbehemoth, toughened bone with tanned leather\ntied into a firm grip. An ornate, ceremonial\ncockatrice feather hung as a trophy from the\nhilt, being supported by woven fibers. A\nblade truly made for the hunter or huntress\nof the wilds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Metzli, the Daemon of Time.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Crescent Moon Necklace", "A beautiful crescent moon pendant, with black\nrope used for fastening it around ones neck.\nThe metal of the pendant would oddly have a\npurple sheen to it, in the right lights\nsometimes looking completely purple. If one\nwas to touch, or wear the necklace they would\nfind that their eyes strangly shift away from\ntheir natural appearence, instead taking on a\npurple color.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Special Melon", "A special melon, for a special person. How\nspecial? Who knows.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:speckled_melon", ""),
        StaticItem("Purifier", "A blue steel blade taken from the cold dead\nhands of a mountain troll, although the\nperfect balance, style and make hint at more\ninteresting origins. Small runes are carved\nalong the fuller.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RealMinea.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+29% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Elidee", "A masterfully forged bluesteel longsword. The\ngrip is made of very fine oak, the word\nElidee' engraved in the side. The pommel is\na golden falcon head, with two perfect\nemeralds as the eyes. You'd also notice a\nclear diamond peaking out of the hilt.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Sapling of Hileia", "The sapling's appearance would be that of\nbirchwood with several tiny leaves sprouting\nhere and there along the tiny branches. A\nfaint, light green hue could be seen from it\nand when held by a druid, one would feel pure\nnatural energies pulsing within it. The\nsapling being plucked from Hileia, an ancient\nbirchwood tree from several centuries ago.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("The Shark Tooth", "The shark tooth would stand tall above most\ndescendants, at a height of seven feet and\nfive inches. At the butt of the weapon would\nbe a small, steel, spike spurting from the\nwell carved ame’lie shaft. As the wood\ncontinued upward at two points would be\nmaroon leather straps tightly wound where one\nwould rest their hands. When the beam met its\nfinal destination a large shark tooth would\nbe strapped to it, rigid teeth angled\ndownward.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by sidmmvv.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Owl Staff", "An ornate staff as tall as the average elf.\nAt the top is the carving of a barn owl,\nspreading its wings. The shaft is decorated\nwith the ilmyumier motifs of the Calithil\nseed.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Hard Candy", "The delicious sweet tastes of green apple!", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
