        StaticItem("Skull of Murlocs", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of jollyb123", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Verian Steel longsword", "*Moderator Approved*\nAetosion approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Tiny Music Box", "A small music box, meticulously crafted by\nhand, the box plays a song shared by a\nhusband and wife. Inside the lid is a small\nscrap of paper, two names can be made out,\nhowever faintly, Peter & Zoey.", "minecraft:noteblock", ""),
        StaticItem("Venerable Sword", "This longsword has been worn by the\nprimordial essence of time, although its\nprimary structure stands firm it can still\nshift through flesh with considerable ease,\nand for some reason or another the blade is\nunable to be dulled via combative means,\nbacked through an enchanted jewel lodged into\nits hilt. Albeit also contains a second\njewel, enabling the blade to pierce through\nsteel with enough force backing the motion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Archer's Boots", "Standard issue boots to any Chambery Marine\nholding the status of Archer", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Archer's Cowl", "Standard issue cowl to any Chambery Marine\nholding the status of Archer", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Archer's Tunic", "Standard issue tunic to any Chambery Marine\nholding the status of Archer", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Archer's Leggings", "Standard issue leggings to any Chambery\nMarine holding the status of Archer", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Simple Dagger", "A standard dagger given to Senior Enlisted of\nthe Imperial Legion. A quick solution to\npiercing chainmail armor.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Katana", "The ancient aurum blade is well crafted and\ndecorated.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Chicken Soup", "A savory, delightful bowl\nof chicken soup.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Drauch's Shoulder Tendrils", "Only usable by the Darkstalker Drauch. These loose limbs can shoot out for\na foe in close proximity; one meter away.\n*Moderator Approved*\nZerachial approved this item.", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
