        StaticItem("Lightblue Bird", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Soothsayer", "Arcane I\nA fine blade with an ornate hilt. When the\nblade interlocks with its adversary, a\nblinding light briefly flashes in their mind.\nAfter such, a reassuring whisper trickles in\ntheir ear, reassuring that they made the\nright move. ((Contact Niv_Mizzet for more\ninformation.))\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Seisraz.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kincaid_ Porno", "Good things come in small packages", "minecraft:record_ward", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of remeron", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
