        StaticItem("WarAxe of Living Embers [T5]", "Within your hand rests a sleek Black Ferrum\nWarAxe. Upon the hilt can be see an intricate\nyet foreign arrangement of diamond-shaped\nembers that smolder ever so slightly. Should\none with a pure soul touch this ideogram the\naxe would begin to glow and shimmer before\nultimately erupting in a dazzling display of\nethereal, white fire. These flames burn\nexceptionally hot against the flesh of the\ncorrupted and, if in contact long enough, may\nset them ablaze with its intense holy heat.\nThe infusion does not last long, however, and\ndoes require recharging by either seeking out\nthe one who created it or using the weapon to\nincinerate a foe.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dire Wolf Head", "This Dire Wolf's lower right jaw would be\nsomewhat broken into peices as if an axe had\nrammed into it. Though other than that it\nwould seem to be fine, bleached white and\nwith a sturdy structure immune to decay from\nthe elements of time.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
