        StaticItem("Rotten Staff", "The branch seems to be half melted as though\nit were in the final stages of decay. Yet...\nSmall leaves and twigs left on one end of the\nstaff seem to show the youth of it and the\nimpossibility for such a thing to be\nnaturally decaying in this manner.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Chimera Skulls", "The great skull of a draconic appearing\nchimera. It has horns and sharpened teeth\nthat gleam with a white bone color.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Chimera Fangs", "A fang from a mighty draconic chimera. It was\nlong, about 8 inches in length, and could\neasily pierce armor. It had a keen sharpness\nto it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Orcish Tusk", "A rather large tusk from an Orc. The base of\nthe tusk is a bit yellowed.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by 2samspan.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Pelt", "A wolf pelt skinned by the axe of Dwan\nGrandaxe.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by CaptainBrock.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Willow Crown", "Intricately interwoven in a natural, almost\ndeific sense, the slender boughs of a weeping\nwillow seem to have grown into an elegant\ncirclet. Accompanying the soft brown of the\nbranches, gentle, teardrop-shaped leaves grow\nalong the affixed structure, further\nhighlighted by the gentle blossoms of\nflowers. White in color, the flowers add an\nelegance to the piece which, in itself,\nappears too well crafted to have been formed\nby human hands.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Grand Princess Arahaelth Tundrak.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Rainbow Trout", "This fish has the multicolored stripes of a\nlarge rainbow fish. The rainbow fish weighs a\nmassive 200 pounds and is 4ft in length. The\nscales glitter in majesty when held to light.\nWhen alive this creature would have been\nknown to put up a fight against any who\nattempted to capture it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
