        StaticItem("Ironic Activation", "This blade appears completely and utterly\nordinary, aside from its pommel, which would\nappear to be an emerald orb with iron\nintricately spiraled around it. Upon saying\nthe phrase \"I'm an actual braindead slaver\",\nit would ignite into flames.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tasty_Cheesecake.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Reggin the Parrot's feather", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mini Shreck'Lak Plushie", "", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("String", "A doll of impressive height, made of weaved\nstring about a base of cotton. His features\nare that of a smiling man. Ebonic strings\ntied back to represent hair and fabric with\nsewn detail donned upon his frame as an\nalluring robe. It seems to be a mage as he\neven comes with few tiny balls of 'fire'.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Melia.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Spring Bouquet", "A sign of love in the air, the bouquet of\nfreshly picked flowers often means a new love\nis born into the world. Tied together with a\nsoft, pink fabric, the bouquet says all\nthat's needed.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Anastasia II", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Recruit's Helmet", "Standard issue Chambery Marine chainmail\nhelmet", "minecraft:chainmail_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Recruit's Chestpiece", "Standard issue Chambery Marine chainmail\nchest piece", "minecraft:chainmail_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Recruit's Boots", "Standard issue Chambery Marine chainmail\nboots", "minecraft:chainmail_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Gus' Birthday Cake", "It's a birthday cake.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Rusty Dirk", "A rather thin, long dirk.\n*Moderator Approved*\nZerachial approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of breadsticktrumpet", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Holy Golden Cross", "In your hand laid a dazzling and gorgeous\nbeauty of an ornate looking golden cross. Its\ndetails breathtaking while your eyes gazed\ntowards the flawless gems which laid in each\ncross section. A ruby in the middle, 1\ndiamond on the upper and lower cross section,\nand 1 emerald on each of the sections on the\nside. A masterpiece of a relic.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marie Brusleton.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Bracelet", "A bracelet of pure, unscathed silver\ndecorated decorated with a sizable diamond,\nthat glistens almost seductively.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Rose", "A finely crafted Rose, the stem hewn from a\nlarge emerald, and carved with delicate care\nto resemble the thorny neck of the red\nflower, whose petals themselves were carved\nfrom sparkling rubies, likewise a masterful\ncraftsman poured his love into such a piece,\nAlong the inside of one of the petals it the\nname \"Elisa Roswell\" in flowing letters. At\nthe very cender of the petals, a triplet of\nyellow diamonds, no larger than a pinky nail,\nbut which shined brilliantly laid.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dabliusmaximus.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Truimph", "A simple iron sword, once owned by BLESSED\nJack Rovin of the Order of Saint Lucien. The\nblade is lined with numerous ornate carvings\nand runemarks, although you don't recognize\nthem. As you grasp the hilt of the sword, you\nfeel strangely erotic and more confident. YOu\nare the sole King of Waldenia. You are the\nOne King of Aesterwald.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Runes", "A collection of small bones and stones, well\npolished and carved.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("The Rose", "The sword is perfect.\nImpossibly so.\nIt shimmers unnaturally.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Electrical Rapier", "A lengthy rapier forged of slayersteel. Many\nsmall, intricately carved patterns adorn its\nhandle, along with what seems to be a built\nin watch! Behind the glass of this watch is a\ngently shimmering blue gem, the fuel for the\nenchantment which, when activated, would\ncause electricity to surge through the\nweapon. Not quite enough to leave someone\nparalyzed from one hit alone, but certainly\nenough to leave a good shock behind! PM\nFury_Fire for info.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade Broadsword", "This Jade weapon would be as sharp as diamond\nshard, the Broadsword would be agile and\nswift with each blow, the smith would have\nspent day and night forging this weapon, a\ngrand design fit for a prince\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by JakeFSF.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("2,000 Minas", "This is worth 2,000 Minas if you find and\nreturn it to dabliusmaximus\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dabliusmaximus.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("BlackFerrum Axe", "A fine blackferrum waraxe lies in your hand.\nThe axehead has been sharpened greatly,\nmaking it quite effective. At the other end\nrests a hammer-like bit, to deliver blunt\ndamage. The handle would be made out of fine,\npolished wood, providing a comfortable grip\nfor the user.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Upright Diamond Staff", "Arcane VII\nA excellent staff, perhaps\nwith a hint of magical affinity.\nDurability: 128/128\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Writ of Immunity", "This permit, granted to the the regulators of\nthe Arcane Specialist, allows for Ahab to\ncontinue enacting their duty, without\ninterference from the legionnaires, guards,\nor officials of the church. This document is\nsigned by the Arcane Specialist and the\nLegatus of the First Imperial Legion.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantSoup.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Silk Handkerchief", "A soft, beautiful silk handkerchief laced\nwith small floral patterns. It is white with\ngreen and black trimming, the colours of\nHouse Hearth. It smells sweetly of lilacs and\nyou can notice a name sewn in to one of the\ncorners: \"Elysia Hearth", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Applebrook porter", "I renamed a bottle of rum hehe", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid Enhanced Cactus Green", "A mixture of dried, shredded flowers,\nleaves, stems and seeds. It gives off a\nvery strange stench", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Milkshake", "A rich, decadent chocolate flavored frozen\ndrink. It's thick and creamy. Seems someone\nspent quite a while making this!", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Thaadus' Seeds", "The whole essence of these seeds feel...\nwrong. Pained and tortured, a tragedy in\nemotions only.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:pumpkin_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar Of Magma Dust", "A spice which comes from the deep mines of\nthe Dwarves in Kal'Omith\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Flame's Dust", "An amber powder, never without warmth. It's a\npowerful hallucinogen when snorted.", "minecraft:blaze_powder", ""),
        StaticItem("Handkerchief", "A hemmed square of thin fabric. perfect to\nwipe your nose with", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Vanilla-Strawberry Cake", "Fresh strawberry, creamy vanilla, all wrapped\ninto a tasty cake!", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragment", "A blade so corroded that its jagged edges\nwith shred flesh with ease, and induce\nprofuse bleeding, and infection. Due to the\ncorossion, however, it must be\nwell-maintained, otherwise it will break.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("G'huls bane", "", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Sword", "A rose gold katana that is a part of the\nEdgy Halfling\" set.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Raspberry Cake With Whipped Cream", "Finely whipped cream atops the basic, but\nelegant, treat", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Fragments of a Pot", "These are the fragments of an\nexceptionally-crafted fired cavemud pot. They\nare mottled and scratched, some have been\nworn down to nothing. They are tinged green\nand white from moisture and sun exposure.\nFaded herb-fungus dye can be found on the\nfragments. The remnants of indecipherable\nillustrations can be found on the fragments.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Peach Pound Cake With Orange Flavored Frosting", "You can taste the peach, but the orange\nfrosted top is the best part!", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Umbrella Drink", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Pie", "Food: 6\nSaturation: 5.0\nExpires in 5d 15h 16m", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("1 ⚖ - Silver Coin", "A coin of fine make native to Ponce- known as\nthe \"pound.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by FalkGhoulmeister.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("9 ⚖ - Silver Bullion", "A bullion of fine make native to Ponce.\nEquivalent to 9 Silver Pounds (⚖).\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caranthir_.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("36 ⚖ - Pot o' Silver", "A pot filled with coins native to Ponce\n(Known as \"Pounds\"). Equivalent to 36\nindividual Silver Pounds (⚖) or 4 Silver\nBullions.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Caranthir_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("The Pumpkin of the Beholder's Gaze", "This pumpkin was grown by a sect of blind\nmonks in the service of Knox. It is said that\nthe holder can foretell good and bad pumpkin\nharvests.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Emperor_Zufelt.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle of Giant-Raven Gizzard", "A large portion of gizzard is found within\nthe bottle, suspended in raven-blood. The\ngizzard is fresh, and ready for use in\nalchemical environments.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Whipsmash.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Pie", "A delicious looking pie that smells like\nchocolate instead of pumpkins. If you were to\ntaste the pie, it'd taste like a strawberry\ncake. What sort of trickery is this?\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Pearl", "A large fist sized pearl that gleams a proud\nsilver tint. If held into direct sunlight, it\nwould emit a soft rainbow reflection in a\nsmall radius around the holder. Probably\nworth a hefty sum of minas due to its size!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:snowball", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of jarofdirt", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Spanking Paddle", "Affected by Unbreaking, Efficiency, and Fortune", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkin Soup", "Food: 4\nSaturation: 7.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Potato", "Potatos with cheese and gravy fillings.\nFood: 7\nSaturation: 12.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
        StaticItem("Cream Pie", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Food Crate", "A salted crate for food containment.\nClick on this item with uncooked food in your cursor to store.\nContains:\n11.74x Pork\nTo open, right click with the crate in main hand.", "minecraft:piston", ""),
        StaticItem("Elegant Lorraine Cross", "A beautiful golden cross engraved with\nelegant swirls and floral designs\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Flametongue Long Dagger", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Velsguard", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Animal Skull", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyrm's Bone", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Winter's Blade", "A gleaming bluesteel blade of Master-Crafted\nquality. A fine pattern of Maple leaves run\ndown the blade, and the name, \"Aaron\nWinterglade\" is carved in the hilt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by likhitesplit.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stone Bracelet", "A lame version of a lapis bracelet.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:stone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Spine", "The largest spine taken\nfrom the World Cactus.\nA brutal, barbaric weapon.\nImpale all those that\ndare stand before you.\n*Moderator Approved*\nEver approved this item.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Norlandic Bone Hand-axe", "A tiny, bone hand-axe made out of the bones\nof slain Oren troops! A wonderful little\nsouvenir of Norland, only sold at Ibarigne's\nstall.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jacobcraft04.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Shaman Staff", "Gnarled staff made by cave goblins", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Goo", "This goo seems to cling to whatever it's\nplaced on, requiring two hands and some elbow\ngrease to remove it. No matter how badly you\ntry to seperate it from itself, it always\nreforms. If split into different containers,\nit will press itself against the wall,\nattempting to reach its other half. Talk\nabout clingy!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Sap of Kurahl", "The thick sap of the Lesser Spirit of Hope,\nKural. It's eerily still warm, and fills you\nwith dread and drains your hope whenever you\ntouch it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Bearhead Trophy", "A dismembered head belonging to a bear.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Withfoot Cider", "A clear and amber hued cider with a sweet and\nlighthearted taste. \"Withfoot cider\" Has been\nlabelled onto the bottle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Green", "A lovely herb, for lovely times!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Plain Cookie", "Food: 1\nSaturation: 0.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Bean Buns", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cruzazul8.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:pumpkin_pie", ""),
        StaticItem("A humble invite", "Some sort of poor yet humble invitation... It\nreads the following: You have been invited to\ncome to the party today of the barkeeper on\nthe Alba Street.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Twisted Ruby Staff", "Arcane VI\nA excellent staff, perhaps\nwith a hint of magical affinity.\nDurability: 53/64\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Powered Blinding Crystal", "Arcane I\nA crystal packed with\ndark liquid.\nNote: These are not valid for roleplay.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("White Leather Saddle", "A finely crafted leather saddle dyed in\nwhite. The buckles and stirrups are made of a\ndarkened steel. The outer edge of the sadle\nis set with black spinel and embroidered with\nmotifs of black birds.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Nantosuelta's Touch", "A lump of quasi-metal flesh that emits a\nsickening aura, anyone exposed to it for long\nperiods of time would experience vomiting,\nthen all the subsequent symptoms of radiation\nsickness. The exposed would start to grow\ntumors after 2 irl hours. Its effects can be\nnullified by clothing one's self with lead.\n(Radius 15 blocks, PM BathRugMan when\ncrafting with the material or interacting\nwith it).\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nantosuelta's Spawn.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cut Pain Reliever", "A strong healer of cuts, relieving the pain.\nThe wound is closed almost instantly,\nand the healing of it is fast.\nUsing it makes the patient sleepy, weak and numb.\nThe effects can be overcome with time.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Viligance", "A sword that is powerful.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by knghtLedo.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Drunken Lords Secret", "You hold in your hand a small glass bottle\nfilled with an aqua blue liquid, it glows\nwith an etheral blue hue. A warm sensation is\nfelt throughout your body as you hold it and\nif one were to drink the liquid contained\nwithin, they would become intoxicated rather\nquickly.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Extract", "A fine powder extracted from the mucous film\ncovering a toalak. Upon ingestion, one would\ndiscover its hallucinogenic properties.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Washrags?", "Before you is a soft silk-like material. For\ncleaning?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mabah.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern's tooth", "The bone in your grasp appears to be worn and\nchipped in some places, as if it saw heavy\nuse - nonetheless this tooth from a Wyvern is\nnear razor sharp, enough to slice skin.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Goblin Kazoo", "A kazoo made of solid Braduk Rhino ivory. The\nname 'Tsuko G.' is carved into its top,\npresumably the maker of the instrument passed\ndown through generations of Goblin Bards.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KingOfTheMoon_.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Head", "The head of a cockatrice. It has a pink\ntongue, similar to that of a snake, is\nroughly the size of an olog's head and\nappears, in all other regards, to be a\nchicken. The only other destinction is it's\neyes, which are a yellowish color and have\nblack slits instead of pupils, similar to\nthat of a snake in the daylight.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Zombie Head", "A trophy from the Crypts of Norland, hacked\nclean from a Ghoul's corpse. You look like\nyou're dead, haha!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Head", "The toothless, quite massive head of a\nwyvern, with gaudy maroon scaled and with\nheavily damaged eyes!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bunny Hood", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Malgonious.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragon Bones", "The thick and sturdy bones of a draconic\nbeing -- evidently thinner than normal to the\ntrained eye. Belonging to a wyvern!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Maroon Draconic Ichor", "The thick blood of a wyvern, infused with the\nproperties required to make draughts and\nbloodsteel, among other things. Should it be\nused to do so within a short time of its\ndeparture from the being it once flowed\nthrough. (Expires 2017-11-1)\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Scales", "The scales are about as hard as iron and\nrather heavy as you hold them, seemingly\nrather thick and hard in your hands with the\napproximate weight of a heavy stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dragonslayerelf.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Fang", "Seven inches in length. The sides are\nrounded, but the tip is perfect for piercing.\nAs tough as stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Glass", "This is a cubic meter of volcanic glass. It\nis a delicate form of obsidian.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Ent Ash", "This is a crow leather pouch, containing ent\nash. There is enough here to cover six square\nmeters. It smells of ashes, and tastes of\nburning wood. When it is smeared upon a\nwooden surface, it turns to smoke, and\nsteadily converts the wood into charcoal.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Druid's Breath", "This is a finely-crafted jadeleaf bottle\ncontaining druid’s breath. It is encrusted\nwith fen moss and banded with oak fiber\nstring. It smells of petrichor and lilies.\nWhen emptied onto a shrub or flower, causes\nthat plant to grow twice as fast for one\nelven day.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elven Bones", "This is a scattering of ancient elven bones,\nforming an incomplete skeleton. They are\nmottled and scratched, some have been worn\ndown to nothing. They are tinged green and\nwhite from moisture and sun exposure.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Elf Hair", "This is a lock of hair taken from an ancient\nelf. It has turned dry and frail with the\nages. It is a fine, soft, brown color.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:string", ""),
        StaticItem("Stoneman Dust", "This is a cow leather pouch containing\nStoneman dust. It has been processed from the\nthumb of a Stoneman. It is sufficient for\nproduction of explosives.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:gunpowder", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian-Tipped Arrows", "This is a finely-crafted redwood arrow. It is\nbanded with copper, and has an obsidian tip.\nThe object has hawkfeather vanes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk's Eye", "The large yellow eye of a Giant Hawk. It's\npiercing gaze continues on in death, sending\na shiver up your spine. You'd be fearful to\nmeet its original owner alone! Eww, it's\nstill wet!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Black Blood", "A vial containing a black liquid. Upon closer\ninspection it'd be noticed that it was blood\nfrom a blighted creature! How strange.....\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Taint", "A vial containing dark taint. This mixture is\nextremely dangerous and must be handled with\ncaution. Contact will cause severe pain and\nspread quickly. If contaminated, seek medical\nassistance!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Scale", "A sharp and jagged peice, about 1 foot long\nweighing a decent amount, with a shimmering\nexterior it would have an menevolent beauty\nto it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Hide", "The Wyvern hide would be stronger than\nleather, though producing the same outcome.\nGiven comfortable padding on the inside and a\nstrong exterior on the outside.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Wyvern Scales", "Fits the palm of a grown uruk, and its edges\nare properly narrow. The carmine tone of\nthese scales are natural, and are slightly\nwarm to the touch. About as tough as ferrum,\ntoo.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:stone_slab", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Spider Fangs", "A mouth and fangs obtained from a Large\nSpider that invaded San'Raakh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:quartz_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade Ingots", "This Ingot would be a solid heavy mixture of\nthree types of Materials, one unknown to the\nperson, but the other two are Black Ferrum\nand Jade. The marking of Mariane'a Abernathy\nwould be enscribed under the ingot The Ingot\nis harder than steel and would need a great\nforge to work this alloy. (( Contact me for\nmore infomation \"rply\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Space_Matrix.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("A Carved Bone", "The thigh bone of a horse with the carving of\na symbol that looks like an eye but that the\nknife had never been lifted in it's carving.\nIt is the symbol of a wargoth of Clan Gorkil.\nIn a crude kind of penmanship it would read\nA debt. The War Uzg owes the weilder of this\ntoken a favor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("The Tainted Bite", "This dagger appears to be made entirely of\nsome large creatures tooth. The tip is sharp\nand hard, the rest of the dagger seems as\nthough it was natural as it is now, with\nsharp edges connected to a black ferrum hilt.\nAlong both sides a billowing smoke design\nruns up from hilt to tip, and all over the\ndaggers edges and surface is a spiderweb\npattern of sickly black taint, radiating\nfaint black smog.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Sweet Cake", "", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Armband", "A golden armband with mysterious runes carved\ninto it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Kharak's Resolve", "This staff is fashioned to resemble a\npickaxe, and can work in much the same way.\nIt was used by the Shaman, and Rex,\nKharak'Raguk.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Tome of Dom", "Contains the history of Dom.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of Vomit", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Jar of organs", "A Jar full of various organs, including a\nkidney, gallbladder, a small portion of\nintestines, and a brain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Catarrh.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Scaddernak Egg", "", "minecraft:dragon_egg", ""),
