        StaticItem("Baubas Head", "A roughly decapitated head once belonging to\na Baubas. Its black, dome-like head and razor\nsharp teeth glisten in the light.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skinwalker's Skin", "The severed head of the infamous Skinwalker\nthat haunted Oakshade.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Raven Feather", "*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Alghoul Spine", "The spine of an Alghoul, cut out\nunceremoniously after it was butchered.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Insectoid Wing Mantle", "A trophy pair of large, gleaming insect wings\nof a clear orange colour. Held together by a\nthin mantle of chitin covered flesh.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by HollowGoosey.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Broken Cavity Stone", "This light green, cracked stone feels rather\nrugged and light. It could fit into one's\npalm. If rubbed, the gemstone flickers a\nyellowish, bright hue.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of the Fallen", "The blade seems to be forged by Westerlandic\nsmiths due to marking on the leather hilt,\nmade of sharpened steel designed to punish\nmortal and undead both; however this weapon\nis well-worn, used by a risen Westerlander\nagainst his own brothers. PM Skylez1 for\ninteraction.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Skylez1.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Kina's Key", "This odd, bronze key has a very rigid and\nspecific lock mold. . . The handle would be\nencrusted in the shape of a diamond.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Papa_Liam.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Carcass", "A fresh kill by a novice hunter, exit wounds\nare present but overall the kill appears to\nbe quite clean.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Slyzard's Talon", "The razor-sharp, knife-like claw of a\nSlyzard. You could shave with this.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Slyzard's Hide", "Despite its owners immunity to flame, this\nhide doesn't provide its wearer the same\nbenefit. Very thick and vascular, with thin\nscales all over it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Injector Bolt", "A strange contraption. The head of the bolt\nseems to move about when you touch it, though\nit would require quiet a bit of force to pull\nit open. When the bolt is shot forth and it\nhits a target, either side of the head of the\nbolt will pull backwards, revealing a needle\nwithin the center of the bolt. The needle can\nbe filled and emptied through the back end of\nthe bolt. The initials \"E.B\" would be\nengraved into the side of the bolts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Artificer's.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Assasins blade (One emote to activate before use and three to withdraw.)", "simple concept yet complex mechanism: a long\npiece of metal that straps to the arm\ncontaining a sharp blade. The user may equip\nit through coiling the leather straps around\ntheir forearm and buckling the clamp. A\nbutton lies at its base and upon activation,\nthe blade will spring into action. A tiny\ncrank is built onto the side to withdraw the\nblade back into the metal. One could use this\nweapon to surprise a foe however they would\nhave to take special care in not accidentally\ntriggering it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bolon.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Red Jeweled Broche", "Arcane I\nA small, gleaming ruby brooch, carved in the\nshape of an ornate rose. Each petal\npainstakingly cut, obviously by a detailed\nhand. Small patterns adorn the rose, and a\nset of initials are finely etched into the\nbackside, reading ZR.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wendigo Head", "http://www.ancient-origins.net/sites/default/files/Wendigo-caring-a-human.jpg\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Obsidian Shard", "A rather sharp piece of obsidian.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by knghtLedo.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Death's Sickle", "This large silver sickle belongs to a strange\nbeing, as it is seemingly to heavy to be\ncarried by a mere mortal. It would have an\nungodly glow coming from it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Decaying Arming Sword", "A rusty and dilapitated pattern 1501 arming\nsword used by Shrimp Knight bannermen from\nDuppendale before the Ser Florent Jorrel was\nkilled in 1508", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Banael", "This longsword has been expertly crafted from\nDracanium, which allows the blade to\nwithstand intense amounts of heat. Within\neach side of the blade is carefully etched a\nname, the first being \"Sulwyn\" and the other\nbeing \"Banael\". Strangely upon the death of\nit's Azdrazi weilder the blade would burst\ninto ash before reforming elsewhere with it's\nmaker.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ventai.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Arrow", "A common arrow, marked with the Ivae'Fenn\nsigil on the flights.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Westerlands Standard Issue Gas mask", "A gas mask used to protect against\nbioweaponry and airborne diseases.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser Elrach Lachlans.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Videl, The Young", "A wide, one handed broadsword forged for the\nadept swordsman. The sword itself seems easy\nenough to learn, but may find best use in the\nhands of a more experienced fighter. The wide\nblade gives weight and strength, while the\nthickness makes it usefull for smacking\nthings. The crossguard of the blade is\nflanked by two thick aurum triangles which\nhug the lower end of the blade. The edge is\ncomposed of shining bluesteel, while the\ninner part is made of a dark, durable ferrum\nof sorts, jet black in color. A truly\nremarkable weapon.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LordRoberto.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Deathsguard", "A beautiful shield gifted by Seff Beaumont to\nValkenier as a sign of friendship between the\ntwo. It would be pitch black in color with\nsmall arcane engravements upon the outer\nmetal frame.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Sug.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Reiter Black Lance", "An eleven foot lance with etchings visible\nalong it's length, it would read the same\nwords in a helical fashion, concluding at the\nlance tip: 'Dive through their heart.' The\nlance would have a blackened finish along the\nwooden beam's length, the lance tip would be\ncomposed of black ferrum, in the shape of a\nrhombus.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The World's best cake", "", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Bouquet of Flowers", "A beautiful bouquet of flowers radiate life\nand colour. A note is attached: \"For a\nbeautiful, courageous woman. These elegant\nbrave flowers.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Grappling Hook", "A carbarum hook with a thick and lenghty rope\nattached to it, clearly designed to be used\nby someone rather heavy.", "minecraft:fishing_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Spear", "A delicately crafted Aurum Spear, longer than\nthe Mali'Aheral who wields it; strong enough\nto end any mighty foe.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Vertillian Infinite Red Wine", "A fine, refreshing red wine, best paired with\nsteak dinners or spaghetti.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by AstralPlatinum.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Death's Strike", "This large silver sickle belongs to a strange\nbeing, as it is seemingly too heavy to be\ncarried by a mere mortal. It would have an\nungodly glow coming from it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Horse Armor", "", "minecraft:iron_horse_armor", ""),
        StaticItem("Crow Adherent's Staff", "The catalyst of an estranged Crow Adherent.\nThe time of their ancient cult may be long\npassed, but the latent powers they once used\nlinger this catalyst in faint remnants.\nThough this engraved, feather-adorned branch\noffers no mystical abilities, it gives an\nuplifting feeling to those who hold it, and\nthe restless desire to spread ones' wings and\nfly.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("The Diamond Necklace", "Around your neck hangs a beautiful necklace,\nconsisting out of a fine golden chain, with\neach link being shaped like an rose. Each of\nthose roses was beautifully engraved to show\na realistic nerves, despite how small they\nwere. Clearly, a lot of time went into these\ndetails. The diamond that was attached to the\nchain would be beautifully polished in the\nshape of a star, reflecting any light that\nfell upon it brilliantly to give it an\nexquisite look.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rubens Custom Goods.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of Witebeerd", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Dank Axe", "Forged by House Brawm to sell", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Small Beer", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Extravagant Bouquet of Roses", "Roses, plucked betwixt the emerald acreage\nwithin the Elven Isles; bountiful and\ncaptivating, surely, a bouquet to love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tsuyose.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceremonial Rapier", "A ceremonial sword used in military parades.\nThe hilt is gilded with white gold and the\nhandle is made of ivory. A blue tassel hangs\nfrom the pommel. The blade is not sharpened\nand is intentionally made dull, highly\npolished enough to see your own reflection\nin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mullraugh.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Santegian Medal of Service", "The medal is a silver circular disc. Its\nobverse struck with the Savinian stallion\nupon its face, encircled with the words,\nOhorezko Domina\". The reverse depicting the\nlesser coat of arms of Santegia. It is\nattached to a yellow and blue striped ribbon.\nOriginally presented for outstanding\ncontributions to the Santegian military\nduring the Battle of Voron Bay, 1634, by\nLeoiarizaltzu Salbatzaile de Savin, King of\nSantegia.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashen Skull", "A mask made from hardened clay and painted gray.\nSomething to surprise friends or startle enemies.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleece Of The Demon Sheep", "This fleece of shimmering silver was once\nattached to the demon sheep known as Bah.\nThose who would wear the fleece or hold it\nfor a long time would feel the need to kill\nsmall animals and children.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bah, The Demon Sheep.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Wine Skin", "A leather sac with an uncorked opening made for holding water or wine.\nIt seems like an effective means for carrying liquid to and fro places.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sand Eater Tooth", "This gnarled fang once belonged to a grim\nlooking Sand Eater; a worm native to the\nDeserts of Axios", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Shamanic Trinket", "A trinket embezzled with rubies and quartz\nand the shape of a miniature shrine. There is\na string attached if one either wanted to use\nas a necklace or hang upon the wall.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Marijuanaology.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Gror's Boots", "Just some normal carbarum boots, enchanted to\nmake them look pretty.", "minecraft:diamond_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Gror's Leggings", "Some of the finest dwarven crafted leggings.\nThey are specialy made to fit a slightly\nlarger dwarf. A master dwarf must have\nenchanted them aswell.", "minecraft:diamond_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Gror's Chestplate", "A well crafted dwarven carbarum chestplate,\nenchanted by some of the finest dwarven\nenchants.", "minecraft:diamond_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Gror's Helmet", "A well crafted dwarvish fullhelmet, enchanted\nby some fine dwarven enchants.", "minecraft:diamond_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ragged Chunk of Thanium", "The thanic crystal, weighing in large,\nproduces an intense cold, albeit at the price\nof the absorption of mana. While a deadly\ntool, its prevalent usage seems to of been\nfor transportation thus far. However, a\ncrystal this large could only have a singular\ncause: chaos. Should it be left to its own\ndevices for a period of time, its immediate\nsurroundings will encompass a boreal aura.\nWith water shifting into ice, stone caked in\nsnow. Although, to the mortal man, a slow,\nagonising death encroaches from poisoning\nalone. With extended usage, of course.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:lapis_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Assassin's Dagger", "A needle-sharp one-edged dagger with exotic\nwriting on the hilt.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Bracelet", "This beautiful ornate bracer would lay\ncomfortably around one's wrist. It is made of\ngold and silver, formed in a woven patern,\nover eachother. The gold and silver streaks\nare set with diamonds and opals,\nrespectively. The gemstones would shine\nbeautifully when light hits them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Summer Bouquet", "A bouquet of flowers designed to appeal more\nto a male than a female. It was simple, and\nconsisted of flowers which flourished in the\nsummer sun. Bright reds, oranges and yellows\nwhich were accompanied by rich green leaves.\nNestled within the arrangement was a\nchocolate surprise. A bar of home made milk\nchocolate was wrapped neatly, and attached to\na stick to keep it within the flowery gift.\nAll together, the bouquet was wrapped in a\npapery material, and tied with a teal ribbon.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lirinya.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Shield of Duke Patrek Roswell", "The Shield once carried into battle by the\nReclaimer' of House Roswells nobility and\ntitle of Duke during Tobias Rebellion.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Chambery Tourism Mug", "A mug made for drinking beverages. On the\nside it says \"I went to Chambery and all I\ngot was this lousy mug\". 4.99 Minas MSRP.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ezo_.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Curved Iron Dagger", "A standard iron dagger with a curved blade,\nmaking it easier to tear and rip flesh.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Vial of Incrementum", "A vial of highly viscous, black blood... [PM\nEbonsquire to interact]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Ebonsquire.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("The Serpent's Acid", "The acid is very powerful, and has the same\nproperties as magma. It melts any flesh upon\nphsyical contact.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:lava_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Flawless Ruby Ring", "The diligent work of an expert stonemason.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden pipe", "A simple made wooden pipe with a decently\nlong spruce stem to get a nice and dry smoke.\nThe cylindrical shaped Cherry Bowl has a\ngreen line painted around it's exterior.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:lever", ""),
        StaticItem("Pendlemere Pumpkin", "The brightly orange pumpkin was cultivated by\nthe veteran Halfling farmers in the month of\nAmber's Cold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Halfhold Hay", "The finest grain to ever grace the mortal\nfields. Halfhold Hay was grown by Mister\nHalfhold himself in the Fringe.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Juicemelon", "While this may look like a watermelon on the\noutside, the insides are actually a light\nblue color, rather than red. It's commonly\nused to make fine Juicemelon juice!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:melon_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Pal's Pipeweed", "A strong flavored pipeweed, grown exclusively\nin Pal's garden in Pendlemere.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Northfarthing Sugercane", "An especially sweet form of sugercane which\nhad been brought to Axios from the\nNorthfarthings in Anthos.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("anime", "swimming sneakers approved by froppy", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Winner Coin", "A coin won at the Adelburg Ball that has a\nbig \"2\" engraved into it, for recieving 2nd\nplace in the talent show!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by _SurrenderMaine_.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gryphon's Talon", "The severed talon of a Gryphon - The tip of\nthe talon is razor sharp. A Gryhpon is a huge\ncat-like creature combined with an eagle.\nTruly it is a majestic creature\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Salier.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Boxing gloves", "Made to punch a fool!", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Orenian Brooch (Golden)", "A Golden Brooch in the shape of the Seal of\nOren and the House of Horen. Wear this brooch\nproudly as a Loyal and Zeal Citizen of the\nEmpire of Humanity!", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ser James' Helmet", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ser James.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ardol Baladan", "Arcane V\nA beautiful craft of a weapon, clearly from a\nmaster. Wyvern scales decorate the shaft of\nthe axe as well as the bottom of the axe head\nitself. The most notable thing however is a\nrune on the head of the axe itself. Almost\nhumming with energy. The design of the rune\nprotects the user from its power, as well as\nbinds this weapon to that of a specific\nbloodline the Reyurnt family.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Stailininn vath", "A tower shield of amazing quality, forged by\na master to defend from multiple offenses.\nDirewolf fur rests along the front, giving it\na sleek look; however, the real power rests\non the inside near the grip. Wonderful\ncarvings of runes weave together to protect\nfrom all manner of magical attacks, but\nmainly focused against elemental. This shield\nfinds itself bloodsmithed to a specific\nbloodline, only being useful to those of the\nReyurnt family.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Wolf Head", "", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Vermillion Declaration", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Axe of Idiot Haenseman", "This stone hachet belonged to a Haenseman\nthat though jumping off the Norlandic Capital\nwas a good Idea.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Potent Marijuana", "The Most Concentrated Batch of Marijuana\nEver.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Cup", "A nicely polished spruce wooden cup with two\nlines carved around it making it look like a\nbarrel. The handle is big enough to fit your\nentire hand.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by dkink14.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Hippity Hoppity Get Off My Property", "This warded Waldenian banner is sure to deter\nany trespassers from your free lands.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarvish Cudgel", "A wooden cudgel sized for a medium dwed, the\nweapon itself is reinforced with iron\nbanding, and the head of the cudgel is capped\nwith iron allowing for a harder strike.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Verizon Irongrinder.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Pagan Effigy", "An effigy of a Goat's head with a pentagram\nin the eyess.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ac'athri", "A slick longsword composed of black ferrum in\npristine condition, the crossguard cruciform\nand the pommel a knob. Streaks of alien,\ncurved runes line the broad side of the\nweapon's black blade; glowing a faint amber\nhue.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashrune", "An average steel longsword protected in a\nblack sheath. It's crossguard and pommel\nthick and rounded for ample defense against\nincoming attacks. The sword is masterfully\nforged and double edged, tapering off to form\na wicked point at its end. When wielded by\nany descendant a significant presence would\nbe felt, a low, pleasant thrum filling your\nmind as it surged with holy energies to\ndefend against the eldritch.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ham", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Urn", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("&KThe Sun's Tirade&K", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Frying Pan", "A sturdy cast iron frying pan blackened from\nmany years of use.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ogren Coin", "", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("VonSchlichtenCo Emperor-type Pocketwatch", "This \"Emperor-Type\" pocketwatch made by\nRosalyn VonSchlichten has the date \"1575\nengraved into its back. The time piece sports\nthe VonSchlichten House Crest, and is\nengraved with emeralds around its solid gold\nframe. Inside, it sports a sun and moon dial,\nas well as mechanical numbers denoting the\nday, month, seed, and year.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Ezo_.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Death-Sword", "A sword made of incense. If burned, it would\nsmell. . . Interesting.", "minecraft:wooden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Key Clock", "A peculiarly shaped pocketwatch, there seems\nto be a small spring mechanism that will\nallow a key-like protrusion to extend when\nthe watchface is turned. A trinket, nothing\nmore.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("Sutica Patrol Citation", "Stop! You have violated the law! Pay the\ncourt a fine or serve your sentence. Your\nstolen goods are now forfeit!", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Rattusville Security Detail™ Police Baton", "A large, thick wooden baton detailed in hard\niron plating at the top, obviously used for\nnon-lethal security concerns. A Lorraine\nCross and Konigsberg ensign would be carved\nin at the bottom grip of the baton.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Earings", "The golden earing would have an odd shine\nto it. Around the ring itself are carved\nin runes. The inside would have a carving\nthe blacksmiths name, Roy D'Avre\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Moochael.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skinwalker Oil", "The oily remains of a fallen skinwalker.\nUnfortunately, its husk was destroyed via\nexplosion. Be careful not to stain yourself\nwith it..!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zhulik.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Piece of Frost", "No matter how much heat or flame is applied\nto this frost, it does not melt. Perhaps some\ncult of mages enchanted it...", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Leopold of Marna", "The ashes of King Leopold I of the\nWesterlands reside in this urn. As a Knight,\nArchchancellor, and King, his memory lives\non. The sigil of the Smiling Knight is\nengraved into the urn, along with two angels\non each side of it.", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Club", "A great, barbaric bone of a brutish wolf.\nWould require strenght to be held in hand and\nlooks more like a two handed weapon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Sunny 'Get-Well-Soon' Card", "An exotic Qalasheen card painted with a\nsandstone market and a bright, shining sun\nfor warm wishes! \"I hate writing and cards.\nBut this one is for you. -Almas Lowedge\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Starryy.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Carbarum Chastity Belt", "", "minecraft:diamond_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Zaxion's Ice Blade", "Zaxion... Xaxion? Xazion? ...Haxion? The Ice\nGiant... ?\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by GreenEyedRobLowe.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+29% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Knightly Blade", "An old and majestic looking blade from an\nearlier era which has seemingly lost its\ncombative abilities.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gucko.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rock crab shell", "The rock hardened shell of a slain rock crab\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by craigr341.", "minecraft:cobblestone", ""),
        StaticItem("Hansetian Bear Pelt", "A substantially exquisite looking fur pelt\ntaken from a Hansetian Bear as a trophy.\nQuite a prize for hunters of the land.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Arctic_Guard.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mutton Soup", "A savory, delightful bowl\nof Mutton soup.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Chewing Tobacco", "A tin of Switzer Select chewing tobacco.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Mullraugh.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Stun Batton", "Once the batton hits a foe, it will unleash a\njolt of electricity.", "minecraft:blaze_rod", ""),
        StaticItem("Mar'zuuk", "+37% Arrow Velocity\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Arbiter", "Arcane I\nA sizeable flail wrought from ferrum, its\nlong haft wrapped in supple leather. The\nhefty, spiked ball which hangs at the end of\na connecting chain seems perpetually covered\nin an oily, vaporous substance. Beneath this\nvineer of taint, the metal appears corroded\nand jagged, blue ferrum eaten by the very\nthing that enchants it. Should this defiled\nsurface come into contact with living flesh,\nit will reap lifeforce and even sow disease\nif able to break the skin.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Shamanistic.", "minecraft:diamond_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Encrusted Saddle", "You would notice that the saddle has a large\namount of diamonds embedded onto it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:saddle", ""),
        StaticItem("Von Königsberg Gold", "A 1 Kilogram ingot of pure gold, complete\nwith the imprint of the Königsbergs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Firewood", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
