        StaticItem("Essence of Frost", "A cold, clear, and thick\nfluid that has the consistency\nof a thick oil. It is\nhard to swallow, and you\ncan feel it throughout your\nbody. However it does miracles\nfor both internal and external\nwounds.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
