        StaticItem("Monkey's Paw", "This is the paw of a Hou-Zi, severed at the\nwrist. It is desiccated, molded into a\npointing gesture. Its palm has been wrapped\nwith red linen. Its fingers have been banded\nwith oak fiber string and elm fiber string.\nThe object is encrusted with hicker spice,\nthenner spice, and silver dust.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:nether_wart_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleshy Pomegranate", "This is a pomegranate. It is as large as a\nsoftball. It smells of pomegranate, blood,\nand bleach. It tastes of rotting leaves. It\nis highly carcinogenic, and induces stomach,\nintestinal, and kidney cancers. This takes\nthe form of benign teratomas. Teratomas\nextracted after growing to full size will\nalways have whole organs within them, usually\nteeth, eyes, tongues, fingers, or toes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:nether_wart_block", ""),
