        StaticItem("Druid’s Tooth", "This is the tooth of a druid. It is blunt,\nwith tinges of brown and green. Its root has\nrotted out. It tastes and smells of nothing.\nWhen planted in soil, over the course of one\nelven hour, it sprouts, and grows into an\naspen tree.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
