        StaticItem("Toy Dragon", "A dragon made out of dyed string with a base\nof cotton. He is the color of the sun with\nwide teeth that of simple white fabic\ncarefully mended on. His tail is fraying\nthough held together by various tight knots.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:string", ""),
