        StaticItem("The Night's Gambeson", "The studded, black chest piece would be light\nto hold and wear. It's studs shimmering in\nThe collar having small golden points in a\ntriagular fashion standing tall from it, the\nchest piece would be accompanied by a belt\nmatching the material of the piece.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Potts24.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
