        StaticItem("Illustrious Gem", "This gem seems to glimmer in the light quite\nfrantically, it'd come in a soft white\nleather pouch with a sewn in drawstring. It\nseems to have a praticular glow to it, It'd\nmake a wonderful converation starter, or even\na present to a loved one.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
