        StaticItem("Silver Ring", "A silver with, with a twist. In the middle of\nthe twisting silver would be a small, green\ngemstone, accompanied by multiple, intricate\nvines that had been inscribed upon it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _DropKoala.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
