        StaticItem("Petrification Potion", "The effects take hold of the body quickly.\nWith a crushing sensation, the skin cracks\nand becomes stone-like in texture and property.\nThe user becomes indestructible but also\nimmolbilised, like a statue.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cinnamon Hinted Mulled Wine", "The mulled wine has been made with care,\nhints of ginger, cinnamon, cloves, and orange\ncan be disconcerned by the drinker.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Emerald Set Ring", "The ring would fit snugly around a slim\nfeminine ring finger. The ring is gold and\nthe vibrant green gem is set into the ring\nitself along with several others. The inside\nis inscribed: \"To Charis, Love Kalen.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by 501warhead.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
