        StaticItem("Beef Jerky", "", "minecraft:rotten_flesh", ""),
        StaticItem("A Note To One's Beloved", "Dearest beloved, I shan't arrive home on\ntime. We're to march upon the draconic\nmenace. Our most glorious fight yet, our\nchildren shall not waste another day in fear\nof these damned beasts. Stay strong, and stay\nbeautiful. Love, Talius Fuawn.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Feather of Friendship", "", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("The Skull of Talius", "The skull of Talius, a once renowned general\nof Xan.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Draconic Hide", "Pseudo decayed draconic hide, deriving from\nan era of Gods and war alike.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Signet", "Upon this gold signet bears four asymmetrical\nemerald leaves bound in gold, resplendent in the\nscattered forest sunlight. The ring bears the mark\nof a Lord or Lady of a Greater Seed in Laurehlin;\ngifted only to those who have performed\ngreat service to the country.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("The Papaya Hammer", "Also known as the papaya hammer, a stupidly\nmade hammer with the stone with the size of a\npapaya. Its so stupid - a long stick and a\nmalformed rock. The creator have mercy on\nthese terrible people that make such terrible\nartifacts.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:stone_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Abiding Wedding Band", "A modest ring forged of gold. On the inside,\nthe words 'Gold lasts like Sharyn love' is\nengraved upon the inner-band. This symbolic\nring seems to bear a perpetual warmth, and\nwhen worn in places dense with flourishing\nnature and life, it beckons a deep, calming\npeace within.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Lasting Tulip", "A red, flourished tulip that had been\ncarefully cut from the ground by the lower\nstem. Though it shows the slightest signs of\nwilting, this gift carries an affectionate\nmeaning to it that does not fade with floral\nwithering. When all things come to pass, the\nlasting thought of love drifts endlessly\nthrough the gloom.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Idolomun.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Moonbucks Candle", "A round pink candle that exudes the sweet and\nsimple aroma of pastries and delights baked\nin Moonbucks.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengul Eye Necklace", "A simply leather cord would drape down to the\nthin metal trim that held the stone. The\nstone itself would have an indescribable look\nand quality to it; clearly the work of a\nlegendary jeweler\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Haunter3.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
