        StaticItem("Preserved Black Truffle Slices", "A medium sized cylindrical bottle holding a\nfew small slices of black truffle suspended\nin a tannish yellow olive oil. A culinary\nremedy to make up for the scarcity of the\npungent delicacy that is the truffle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
