        StaticItem("Skeleton Mask", "Lo and behold the skeleton mask, forged\nbetwixt the desolate digits of a long lost\nwoodworker who aspired to produce the most\nrealistic All Spirit Eve's costume for the\nyearly ball held within his hometown. In his\naspiration, he gutted his wife to wear her\nbody akin to a flesh suit, and fashioned his\nskeletal masks atop the very skull of his\ndeceased lover.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ikurnamon Recurve Bow", "+20% Arrow Velocity\nlightweight and as sturdy as steel, having\nbeen made out of rare and ancient tempered\nIkurnamon elven wood. Through intricate\ncarving, its limbs have been adorned with\ncascades of elven embroidery as well as a\nhead of a stag at the front of the grip.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by ShadowedOblivion.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
