        StaticItem("Blackberry Cider", "A dark, fizzy drink that overwhelms the\nsenses with blackberries and would be sweet\nto the taste.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem(">=< Vindicator's Blade >=<", "Arcane I\nA long, double edged blade forged with bluish\nsteel, it's hilt wrapped in rough black\nleather that ensured a firm grip. The wicked\npoint of the blade held a faintly darker hue,\nwickedly sharp for piercing whatever\nopposition it came against. The swords length\nlay covered in ineligible runes and glyphs,\nand when wielded by a holy user of Xan it\nwould thrum vibrantly with the immense amound\nof blessed power that coursed through it. Two\nhooked horizontal prongs of blue steel jut\nout from above it's crossguard, allowing it\nto be utilized for easier parrying.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xan.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("-+-   Kaedreni Longsword   -+-", "A longsword of masterful craft wrought of\nglimmering, well polished steel. The blades\nhilt and crossguard were both standard issue,\nwrapped in leather dyed in a hue of black.\nThe rounded pommel of the blade giving away\nthis craftsmenships origin: the insignia of\nthe White Rose set upon it's hardened steel.\nThe fuller of the blade bared no engravings\nnor markings, merely possessing the\ntraditional double edged blade that formed at\na peak with a wickedly sharp point.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
