        StaticItem("Ring Of Fate", "A ring made to resemble two snakes coiling\naround each other. It gives off a golden\nshine indicating the quality of the material\nused to create the rings. Once the rings are\ntapped twice in rapid succession the pair\nwould change from a golden color to more of a\nredish brown no matter how far apart the\nrings are.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by GusanoArentonio.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Orange Felt Doll", "A doll made almost entirely of orange felt\nand the jet black string that held its limbs\nto its torso. On it's face were two white\nbuttons, the black string attaching them to\nthe face made them look almost like actual\neyes.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
