        StaticItem("Amber Wolf Pelts", "The dappled orange and grey pelt glistens in\nthe sunlight, though be careful! One touch of\nthe pelt with your bare hands could burn you,\ndue to it's acidic properties.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by The_Classy_Guy.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Snow Cloak", "The soft bleached for of the iron-bear hide\ncloak would be a pale, snowy white. Due to\nits origins, the leather is strong, giving\nthe wearer the same defensive shielding of a\nlayer of steel.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Creete.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Veris Shoggin Champion Spade", "A smaller spade made by the best halfling\nsmiths. When held within the air, a pumpkin\nmask would appear on the holds face.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("The Golden Shoggin’ Shovel", "Arcane I\nQuite a heavy object, and could probably\ncause a fair deal of damage in the right\nhands. A pure aurum shovel; from the start of\nthe handle to the tip of the scoop. They say\nthose that possess the golden shogging shovel\nhold some of the greatest shogging abilities\nknown to the realm’s history.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Overgrown Shogging Shovel", "A shovel worthy of the grandest Summer\nshogger! Seemingly, it's been overgrown with\nmoss and vines alike, though it only enhances\nits shogging capabilities to make it a\nformiddable weapon of mass destruction.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:wooden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Ice Shard", "The Ice Shard would be from the Frozen Plain,\nseeming to be quite cold and it would never\nmelt even within the hottest wether. It\ncrystals shimmering delicately shards pointed\nupon it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Scroll: Fireball", "A scroll clad in ink scribbled daelish runes.\nWhen \"Availer\" is uttered, the runes light up\n- evoking a fireball which shoots from the\nscroll. Upon impact, the fireball will splash\nonto the affected area, burning and setting\nafire that which can be ignited, though the\nfarther from the original area, the weaker.\nOnce the spell is finished, the scroll will\nburn up. ((3 emotes to unleash, 5 block AOE\nfor the splash. Contact _SuitAndTie_ for more\ninformation.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Niv_Mizzet.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Shortsword", "The steel of the shortsword is trimmed in\ndark red runes. They glow softly at the touch\nof the warrior who wields it. Masterfully\netched by the Arcadian Runesmiths, the sword\nitself is a powerful weapon. With each\nstrike, the runes flare and the blade is\nengulfed in a flash of fire. It seems to\nprotect the wielder from any backlash beyond\nthe pommel.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Hammer of the Hollow Plague", "The warhammer almost looks ancient, strange\nand intricate markings engraved all along its\nsteel handle. The actual head of the hammer\nis almost in pristine condition, and is\nincredibly cold to the touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Blade of Taveira", "A fine Elven craft that serves a very\nceremonial role. The blade curving slightly\nin the shape on an S and a pommel of pure\ngold.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Bow", "A finely crafted bow made from well tempered\nIronwood. The bow was created to work only\nfor Ele'ira and would be awkward for anyone\nelse to weild. Along the wood, honeysuckles\nwere carved into it as well as several\nbeautifully carved hummingbirds.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by JadePetal.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Shedded Lubba Scales", "The hard scales from a Lubba. These\nblue-green scales seem to twinkle in the\nsunlight, as if they were sea water\nthemselves. They are extremely durable and\nsmooth. Many are fearful of engaging with\nsuch beasts that these scales are desired by\nmany as a form of jewelry.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Large Wolf Fang", "This Wolf fang appears to be over 6 inches in\nlength. It's jagged and threating appearance\nmost likely reflects the beast in which it\nwas ripped from.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Mitt0.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Homestead Blend - 1612", "A skillfully brewed red wine, featuring what\nyou could only describe as hints of\nchocolate. The liquid a deep purple in\ncolour, and a scent which suggested it was\nrather potent in its alcohol content. The\nbottle was sealed with a cork, and decorated\nwith a green wax stamp; the sigil within said\nstamp that of a tree. “Homestead Blend -\n1612” was the only detail written upon the\nlabel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SnugglyKittens.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Wooden Puzzle", "An eight-part wooden puzzle, shaped like a\ncross.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Enmity of Angels", "Ensorcelled by the nameless Ashkeeper, this\nbow carries the power of ancient Fulmenacy,\nor Lightning Evocation. Every arrow drawn\nupon its string is gripped with an electrical\nblessing, whereupon striking another living\nbeing, sends a short but stunning rush of\nenergy through their body. It is capable of\nlocking up muscles for a few seconds, but not\ncapable of ensuing a collapse without several\narrows striking a single target.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DivineJustice.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Violet Concotion", "A viscous mixture of purple substances\nsitting within a corked bottle. The glass is\nexceptionally cold, artificially so; and the\nskull and crossbones label likely means you\nshouldn't drink this.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jallentime.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
