        StaticItem("Cyan Ocarina", "A cyan ocarina made from clay. It is well\nmade, and the clay has a glossy finish,\nmaking it a tad shiny. It has 8 holes along\nthe body, and one more at the end of a\nprotrusion, clearly for the mouth. Initially\nforeign, with a little practice this ocarina\nwould become a breeze to play.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
