        StaticItem("Calendar", "", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Custom Wax Seal", "A simple tin seal adorned with a hand giving\nthe middle finger. The hand is simple, though\nclearly a hand with 5 visible fingers. It is\ncurled into a fist with the middle finger on\nclear display. Below the hand is a small\nhorizontal banner with the words ＦＵＣＫ ＹＯＵ\nindented into it, with a far smaller\nᶠᵘᶜᵏ⁻ʸᵒᵘ⁻ᶠᵘᶜᵏ⁻ʸᵒᵘ⁻ᶠᵘᶜᵏ⁻ʸᵒᵘ indented only a\nsmall bit around the rim of the seal, as to\nonly be raised slightly when applied to a wax\nseal.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("White Truffle", "A single white truffle a bit smaller than a\nchicken egg, its lumpy surface emanating a\ngentle, pungent odor. It seems to've been\nwashed very well, bearing no distinguishable\nblemishes or spots.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
