        StaticItem("Tor-Leyd-Jarkun", "A mighty Dark elven sized Doomhammer, With 1\nfoot long dark oak hilt, Black ferrum coiled\naround it, At the top of the Hammer sits the\nheavy Bloodsteel head weighing 50 pounds, 2\nfeet wide and 2 long, Expertly crafted.\nCovered in Orcish sayings along with the\nwords “Afar Angathfark”, ‘Tor, Fist ob lur,\ngive mi deh focus ob battle, Leyd, Spirid of\nstrength, Bring mi great strength en wagh.”\nUpon the Head of the hammer, On the hilt\nJarkun brin’ mi great dexderidty, gui mi\nhitz in WAGH.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nafari.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.8 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+67% Attack Damage\n+0.0 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Birch Staff", "The wooden staff is formed of three\nintertwining branches of living birch.\nVibrant leaves sprout from the top,\nand the staff is ornamented sparingly\nwith dove and phoenix feathers.\n*Moderator Approved*\nbirdwhisperer approved this item.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
