        StaticItem("Dragon Pendant", "A pendant in the contour of a dragon coiling\nabout a mere aurum twist that led to a chain\nof interlocking loops. It shines brightly\nwith onyx eyes that rests snuggled against\nits carved emerald form. 'From your dear\nadmirer.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Admirer.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
