        StaticItem("Eerie Stone", "For this piece obtains a rough contour and\nmay appear as a simple stone tugged free from\ndebris. However, streaks of ebony coil about\nit and when held within a users hand it comes\nto life with vivid hues of purple and plays\nout a delicate melody according to how it is\nheld!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:cobblestone_wall", ""),
