        StaticItem("Monk Staff", "A double wood staff is in your grasp, it\nis made of young oak and birch\nintertwined in a perfect straight manner.\nAt its top a large piece of lapis in the\nshape of a seven pointed star. This staff\nis imbued with the powers of the\nCelestial Triumvirate.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Seer", "This small, little charm would whisper to you\neach time its held against the left side of\nyour chest. Its words will often be slow and\nheavy, speaking of an assortment of numbers,\nwhich would be your exact age.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("A Clear Night Candle", "A deep blue candle that exudes the strong\nscent of the clean, fresh air of Leyu'celia.\nThose who intake the candle's rather\ntranslucent vapors may be reminded of or even\nsee the stars of a clear night's sky. May or\nmay not have Warhawkian green infused in it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
