        StaticItem("Aurum Ring", "A beautiful ring of aurum and placed atop it\nfirmly secured in place is a hunk of diamond.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Sword of Owyn: Immolation", "A Stygian blade latched upon an ornate hilt.\nThe refined longsword runs with blood red\nfrom the chappe to the tip. With the red\nmarks are etching of flame with Lorraine\ncrosses jutting out from the fires-- arguably\nportraying one of Saint Owyn's deeds.\nEngraved on the convexed guard are the words\nBy the eternal flame we purge.\" --- The\nsword has the ability to shroud the blade in\ncarnivorous fires should one run their hand\nalong the blade, bringing about the fear of\nSaint Owyn to its victims. (PM KnghtArtorias\nif you get ahold of this).\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by knghtArtorias.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Wit's End", "Wit's End belonged to a barbarian of the War\nUzg, who among his kind particularly loved\nthe rush of battle. Each strike against his\nopponents renewed his strength, and each\nvictory only whetted his hunger for further\nbloodshed. He killed his foes slowly,\nrelishing the ebb and trickle of their life\nand drawing might from their terror. He\nsurrounded himself with enemies and\nwaseventually overwhelmed by a mob of\ncombatants, and not even his furious attacks\nwere sufficient to sustain him. The axe,\nincredibly elaborate for an orcish weapon, is\nwarm to the touch.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Darksalvo.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Candy", "A sour candy that will leave a strong and\nbitter taste in your mouth and has a red\nwrapper", "minecraft:glowstone_dust", ""),
