        StaticItem("Schreck'Lak Action Figure", "An intricate figure of glorious\ncraftsmenship.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Travista.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Metal Rose", "A fork that was transmuted into a shape that\nroughly resembled a rose.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Steven.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Sai", "The sia is sharpened, having been made\nmasterfully, a thin sheen of poison across\nthe edge of the blade.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Demographic.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Athri's Bite", "A elegantly crafted dual handed blade. The\nexotic blade complimented with a beautiful\ndarkwood handle. The serpent like blade is\ncomplimented by a fang-like silver head on\nthe base of the handle. Engraved along the\nblade is 'Strike fear in the darkness.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+29% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Alluring Sword", "What was once stuck in the depth of a stone\nprison, tugged free is an alluring weapon of\nstained metal, ornated lightly so it is not\nfeeble - but precious in appearance that it\nmight seem so.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Five Foot Claymore", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
