        StaticItem("Living Instrument", "A rather simple flute, little more than a\nside-blown branch... But its value lies not\nin its ornamentation, but in the soul of its\nsound. Low, primal, but delicate... Tuned\nwith great care as if to refuse to be played\npoorly, once one tames it. Brother to the shy\nbirds after heavy rain, or to the spirit of a\ncampfire. Even a veteran music enthusiast\nwould have difficulty learning to play it,\nunless already accustomed to transverse\nflutes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Gallic.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
