        StaticItem("Locket of Eternal Sunshine", "An unassuming locket the size of the average\nperson's palm. A feeling of warmth washes\nover you as you hold it. If one were to open\nit, they'd see that an orange gemstone is\nhoused within. It glows and shimmers faintly.\n[PM Aehab for more info]\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
