        StaticItem("Erin's Old, Golden Boots", "A pair of old, damaged, golden boots. They\nwere about the right size for a small human.\nOne the sole of the right footed boot read\nthe phrase, \"To Lhindir_, with love.\nXOXOXOXO.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SnugglyKittens.", "minecraft:golden_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruskan Cigar", "A stick of bundled up sun dried tobacco\nleaves, mixing the unmissable scent of\ntraditional Ruskan pineforests with the\nexotic smell of Savoyard plantations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jonificus.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
