        StaticItem("Animal Tag: Sheep", "A tag that makes Garsto's recon mission sheep\ndisguise more believable as he can prove he\nis an official farmer's sheep with the use of\nthis tag.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AnotherDay.", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem Necklace", "An expensive and flashy looking necklace made\nfrom fantastic looking gems strung with a\nsilver chain. The necklace would have a tag\nattached with the words \"Maehr'sae\nHiylun'ehya\" inscripted on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Carberium Mace.", "In your grasp would be a sizeable, 3'5 shaft\nof metal, topped with six carberium wedges at\nits head -- Each of them crawling upward into\npointed tips.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.8 Attack Speed\n+5 Attack Damage\n+45% Attack Damage\n+3.0 Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dark Stone", "The stone was a pitch, raven black; the only\nshreds of colour amongst it being shedding\ncrimson particles. If you held your ear up to\nthe heavy object, you swear you could hear\nindecipherable whispers pass by. The stone\nwas almost indestructible; but you could tell\nit had a use one day.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
