        StaticItem("Remains from the Mask of Undru", "The piece of metal glows in a sick green light, on touch. The wearer would earn a vision\nof a dark world with floating doors inside as well as white eyes staring at him or her.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("-+Judgement+-", "A fairly heavy but long flanged mace, seeming to be\nmade from solid aurum with the edges of the mace-head\nreinforced with ferrum alloy. The overall length of\nthe weapon is around thirty-five inches. Something,\nthat with enough practice, could be made into a\ndefensive counter-part to any witch hunter's arsenal.\nThe helix leather-bound grip feels tough and rugged\nin the hand; ensuring it won't slip.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Murlocs.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Garsto's Triumvirate Staff", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Pumpkinblood", "This is a goat leather flask, containing\npumpkin-man blood. It smells of pumpkins. It\ntastes of iron and pumpkins. Its drinker, for\nthe next saint's day, smells powerfully of\npumpkins, and attracts insects to their\nperson, sufficient to cover their entire body\nin a swarm.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("-=- Oavatos -=-", "An aurum warhammer crafted by a veteran\nblacksmith, Orkish words are carved into the\nhammer-head. Embedded in the handle is a\norkish gem that shimmers in the sunlight. The\nend of the windswept leather-bound handle is\na spearhead, making it possible to stab as\nwell as crush with this spectacular hammer!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Anadunae.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Covenant Tree Seed", "This is a covenant tree seed. It is an inch\nin diameter. When planted in copper-rich\nsoil, and the area it is planted in is struck\nby lightning, it instantly grows into a\ncovenant tree. The seed pulls the copper from\nthe soil and uses it to grow to its adult\nheight. The resulting tree takes on the shape\nof the lightning bolt which formed it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("The Bladeless Blade", "A sword that's absolutely useless.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Rod of Rain", "This is an exceptionally crafted redwood\nstaff. It is encrusted with amber, in which\nclovermoss is trapped. When placed upright in\nsoil under clear skies, it accelerates upward\nas though falling. Rain will occur for two\nsaint's hours in an area twenty meters around\nwhere the rod dissapeared.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
