        StaticItem("Seashell of the Unnamed", "Arcane I\nA seashell hidden within the depths of the\noceans for longer than any elf alive. It's\nseen ware and tear while also having a sheen\nalong its whitened surface. It's able to turn\nany saltwater inside, into freshwater. Or so\nit seems.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Tristin's Mug o' Coffee", "A beautifully crafted mug with an imprint of\nthe Tresery seed upon it's face. If the word\nPotus' it becomes filled with coffee that's\naroma makes one's mouth water and a taste\nthat lifts one's very soul.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of Luck", "This coin-shaped object seems to have an oddly creased form, an unseen form of currency.\n*Moderator Approved*\nSlic3man approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Remains from the Void Circle", "It looks like a remaining piece\nfrom a once gigantic construction.\nEveryone who touches it would feel like\nearning a strong headache.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Filled Soulbound Golem Core", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Darkdragon274.", "minecraft:redstone_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal of Sildur", "The blue Crystal glows in a strange,\nalmost black light. Touching the Crystal\nwould give the wearer a Vision of a\ngigantic fortress with a metal masked,\nBrown and red robed being that commands\ntall black creatures. The Vision would end\nafter the creatures stared at the wearer.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
