        StaticItem(">> Ancient Gem <<", "An ancient and well-polished gem. It sparkles and glitters under all light,\nand rainbow refractions of glimmering beauty are birthed by any light that\npours into it.\nThe value is incalcuable.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
