        StaticItem("Calming Amulet", "An aurum amulet bearing many intricate\ndesigns and carvings upon its surface. A blue\ngem rests within the center, seeming to\noccasionally shimmer with an otherwordly\nenergy. An aura of warmth seems to eminate\nfrom the object, causing those who wear it to\nfind themselves experience less harsh\nemotions. This would not cause them to cease\nyet rather muffle such, allowing easier\nrecovery from tramatic events. A single name\nis carved into the side of it; \"Leyu.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Swgrs_Fav_Lich.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Margarita", "", "minecraft:glass_bottle", ""),
