        StaticItem("Darkbreaker", "The old blade of the Lost Knight, a lich\ncursed by solitary and loneliness who haunted\nthe Aleksandrian forests. In like, theKnight\nenjoyed fame, fortune and popularity, so much\nso that he could not bear to die, and chose\nto become a lich. Yet his new dark form\ndisgusted others, and so he was exiled into\neternal loneliness.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
