        StaticItem("A Worn GreatSword", "This blade would have a worn appearance. The\nlength of a blade would be 4 feet long and 6\ninches thick the blade would be suprisingly\nlight for it's size. It could easily cut off\nthe head of an olog in one foul swoop if\nwielded by a fit warrior.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
