        StaticItem("Flamespitter Wrist Device", "The wrist strapped device would have a back\nend connection for a mesh tubing while the\nfront would be a nozzle, a sparking mechanism\nat tip. Made to be worn under the wrist, the\nuser would brign thier hand upwards at a 90\ndegrees to trigger the drawstring mechanism\nwhich will cause the attached unfunctional\ndevice to work sprayin out liquid flames four\nmeters forward. (Needs the tank item to\nfunction)\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by bestscarface76.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
