        StaticItem("Arcadian Waraxe", "The edge of the black ferrum axe bears a long\nline of runic carvings. Glowing softly in\ntheir red majesty, the runes imbue the power\nof lightning into the axe itself. Upon\ncontact with a foe, lightning springs between\nthe axe and said foe in the blink of an eye.\nIn the same instant, the runes along the\nhandle would glow brighter, protecting the\nholder from any backlash of the lightning. To\nthose knowledgable in the art, the runes are\nclearly of Arcadian origin.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Sun's Vigil", "A durable Greathelm crafted in the forges of\nSavoy, this Carbarum piece of armour bears\nthe customary image of the Great Sun, upon\nits brow, the insignia serving both as a\ndecoration and as an additional layer of\nprotection.", "minecraft:diamond_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruric Warbow", "+30% Arrow Velocity\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dranoth.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Hearthston Diamond", "A ring, carved out of diamond, fitting\nperfectly on the wearer's finger. Golden\nspikes leaving it and at the top another,\nvery large red diamond, coated with fire opal\nand more diamonds and gold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Bunemma.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Falchion", "A sword with a lightly curving, thick blade.\nA few runes run along it's blade, signaling\nit's primary enchantments held to it. It\nwould be stronger and hold it's edge for much\nlonger than a regular blade. The handle it\nwrapped with a dark leather for added comfort\nwhen holding it.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion Healing", "", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Noxian Plackart", "The carbarum armet seems bound with a glyph\nperceieving protection, the visor of the\ngleaming armet appears worn as the vent-all\nand gorget seem rather elegent and\nembellished. The armet repersenting a\nsymbolic piece of armor of The Noxus.", "minecraft:diamond_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Spelunker's Rare Sabatons", "Something rather uncommon but often sought\nfor by all walks of life. These pants grant\nmajor protection at the risk of speed.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by freema5.", "minecraft:diamond_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Noxian Greaves", "", "minecraft:diamond_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Vindicator", "The bluesteel blade has a large pommel\ndecorated with a rare gem, where upon it’s\nside is etched with ’S & E’. The blade itself\nis made of fine steel, which is to be\nexpected from it’s elegant craftsmanship.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+50% Attack Damage\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Stigwig.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Valeforge Breastplate", "Hammered from the armour of the Rex,\nMalgunuz'Raguk, the breastplate is imbued\nwith the righteous fury of the North. Crafted\nfor King Andrik I Barbanov, it was never\nworn, and later given to his son.", "minecraft:iron_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Present", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Z3m0s.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloop, bloop, ice on meh feet", "", "minecraft:iron_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("sord with aids", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Piety", "Steel forged with evident mastercraft,\natypical to war axes mettled by infantry,\nthis heavy weapon's edge is visibly\nmaintained. Upon the cross section, where\nsteel meets the hilt appears the words Piety.\nSome may call it such, only it's original\nwielder can identify the purpose of this\ntext.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruby of Alkaditi", "A bright red ruby that came from the\nsarcophagus of Akagani. It smaller than a\nclenched fist, but if touched directly it\nwill rapidly drain your life force.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ymbninjakiller.", "minecraft:redstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Glow In the Dark Arcane Spinner", "A peculiar, three spoked object which would\nbe a light green in color. Should the object\nbe brought into the dark, it would give off a\nlight green glow.. Any mortal who spins this\nspinner would find themself needing to spin\nit more, else they fall into a soul crushing\ndepression.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Griselbrand__.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of 2amskypecall", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by HI3_.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sorry, HB!", "Sorry we weren't nice to that new guy! Hope\nyou forgive us.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Walking Boots", "These strong and sturdy boots seem to be made\nfor walking long distances! They exhibit a\ndeep green hue and have reinforced patches of\nhardened leather around the stitching to make\nsure they last forever!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugmas Cookies!", "Delicious!", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
