        StaticItem("De-FAN-der", "This shield's kite design consists of several\nmetal rods fanning out to the variousedges of\nthe shield. The space between the rods is\nfilled with a thin, lightweight material. The\nbottom of the shield has a handle, for some\nreason.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by grimmothy.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
